, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 334, 311, 79945, 894, 12188, 429, 1231, 614, 1012, 3694, 311, 279, 46622, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 3326, 19842, 334, 279, 89058, 12188, 1007, 279, 46622, 1667, 264, 22360, 476, 12188, 62883, 5607, 476, 6177, 88034, 13, 2823, 16585, 537, 311, 5557, 279, 46622, 594, 14791, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 28497, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 37920, 13, 315, 30995, 44029, 76248, 334, 311, 264, 4240, 27292, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 311, 72639, 894, 9664, 12188, 624, 19, 13, 3070, 65714, 279, 3082, 448, 264, 40269, 27292, 334, 311, 73241, 1007, 279, 30995, 44029, 76248, 624, 20, 13, 3070, 58083, 220, 16, 37920, 13, 315, 14473, 34089, 26785, 448, 220, 16, 10525, 315, 3015, 97219, 23604, 264, 4240, 27292, 304, 419, 6291, 11, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 1549, 624, 21, 13, 3070, 49, 258, 325, 1632, 334, 448, 264, 27292, 72207, 304, 4240, 3015, 624, 22, 13, 1416, 279, 12188, 374, 1602, 51396, 11, 498, 646, 3070, 19963, 279, 12188, 448, 264, 6869, 46622, 476, 8628, 6038, 334, 13, 576, 8628, 1231, 1492, 57112, 1007, 279, 12188, 624, 23, 13, 1416, 23579, 3171, 944, 975, 11, 498, 1231, 1184, 311, 3070, 8156, 279, 23196, 476, 279, 4453, 46622, 334, 13, 1084, 374, 11102, 311, 1618, 264, 2473, 53511, 311, 3705, 419, 943, 315, 12733, 382, 1359, 2701, 1493, 7354, 11, 498, 646, 13444, 4057, 12188, 504, 697, 15097, 46622, 13, 151645], "pred": "By following these steps, you can effectively remove plastic from your clothes dryer.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1231919531875412, "g_worst_claim": 0.08334612846374512, "g_content": 1.6225788511078933, "g_traj_mean": 1.0664080381393433}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.96, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "44", "question": "how to get plastic out of clothes dryer", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to remove plastic from a clothes dryer:\n\n1. Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes to soften the plastic.\n2. Scrape the plastic off with a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper, taking care not to damage the dryer's interior.\n3. Apply 1 to 2 tsp. nail polish remover to a clean cloth, and rub the plastic to dissolve it.\n4. Rub the area with a damp cloth to rinse the nail polish remover.\n5. Mix 1 tsp. liquid laundry soap with 1 cup water. Dip a clean cloth in this solution, and rub the area again.\n6. Rinse well with a cloth dipped in clean water.\n\nIf the plastic does not come off with this method, another option is to use a hair dryer or heat gun to heat the plastic until it becomes soft and pliable. Then, attempt to peel it off carefully. However, be aware that this method may not work, and in that case, replacing the drum or the entire dryer may be necessary. It is recommended to call a service technician for this type of repair.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to get plastic out of clothes dryer is:\n\n1. Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes to soften the plastic.\n2. Scrape the plastic off with a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper.\n3. Apply nail polish remover to dissolve the plastic.\n4. Rinse with a damp cloth and soap solution.\n5. Use a hair dryer or heat gun to heat the plastic if necessary.\n\nIf the plastic still does not come off, consider replacing the drum or the entire dryer.", "pred": "If the plastic is extremely difficult to remove, consider heating it with a hair dryer or heat gun. Once heated, you may be able to peel off the plastic. However, if you cannot remove all the plastic, you may need to replace the drum or the entire dryer. In such cases, it is recommended to call a service technician for assistance.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "If the plastic is extremely difficult to remove, consider heating it with a hair dryer or heat gun. Once heated, you may be able to peel off the plastic. However, if you cannot remove all the plastic, you may need to replace the drum or the entire dryer. In such cases, it is recommended to call a service technician for assistance.", "cot": "[\"To remove plastic from a clothes dryer, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Run the Dryer on a Regular Setting for 20 Minutes**: This helps soften the plastic, making it easier to remove.\\n\\n2. **Scrape the Plastic Off**: Use a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper to carefully remove the plastic. Be cautious not to damage the dryer's interior.\\n\\n3. **Apply Nail Polish Remover**: Mix 1 to 2 teaspoons of nail polish remover with a clean cloth. Rub the plastic to dissolve it.\\n\\n4. **Rinse with a Damp Cloth**: Use a damp cloth to rinse the area where the plastic was removed.\\n\\n5. **Use Laundry Soap Solution**: Mix 1 teaspoon of liquid laundry soap with 1 cup of water. Dip a clean cloth in this solution and rub the area again.\\n\\n6. **Rinse Thoroughly**: Rinse the area with a cloth dipped in clean water to ensure all residue is removed.\\n\\nIf the plastic is extremely difficult to remove, consider heating it with a hair dryer or heat gun. Once heated, you may be able to peel off the plastic. However, if you cannot remove all the plastic, you may need to replace the drum or the entire dryer. In such cases, it is recommended to call a service technician for assistance.\", \"Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes to soften the plastic. Scrape the plastic off with a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper, taking care not to damage the dryer's interior. Apply 1 to 2 tsp. nail polish remover to a clean cloth, and rub the plastic to dissolve it. Rub the area with a damp cloth to rinse the nail polish remover. Mix 1 tsp. liquid laundry soap with 1 cup water. Dip a clean cloth in this solution, and rub the area again. Rinse well with a cloth dipped in clean water.\", \"To get plastic out of a clothes dryer, you can use several methods depending on the type of plastic and the severity of the situation:\\n\\n1. **Regular Dryer Use for Softening**: Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes to soften the plastic. This can help in loosening the plastic, making it easier to scrape off.\\n\\n2. **Scraping Technique**: Use a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper to gently scrape the plastic off the dryer's interior. Be careful not to damage the dryer's surface.\\n\\n3. **Nail Polish Remover Application**: Apply 1 to 2 teaspoons of nail polish remover to a clean cloth and rub the plastic to dissolve it. Rinse the area with a damp cloth to remove the nail polish remover.\\n\\n4. **Detergent Solution**: Mix 1 teaspoon of liquid laundry soap with 1 cup of water. Dip a clean cloth in this solution and rub the area again. Rinse thoroughly with a cloth dipped in clean water.\\n\\n5. **Heating Method**: If the plastic is difficult to remove, you can heat it with a hair dryer or heat gun. Once the plastic is heated, it may be easier to peel off. However, be cautious as overheating can damage the dryer.\\n\\n6. **Professional Help**: If the plastic is extremely hard to remove, consider replacing the drum or the entire dryer. It is recommended to call a service technician for this type of repair to ensure safety and proper execution.\\n\\n7. **Coil Scrubbing**: For plastic on the dryer's coils, remove ice and use a plastic scraper to scrape off the hardened plastic. Soak a cloth in acetone-based nail polish remover, leave it on the element for 5 minutes, and scrub the remaining plastic off with the cloth. Wipe the coils with a clean, damp cloth and remove any residue with a soapy water-dipped cloth, then rinse with water.\\n\\nThese methods can effectively remove plastic from a clothes dryer, depending on the specific circumstances and the type of plastic involved.\", \"To get plastic out of a clothes dryer, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes** to soften the plastic.\\n2. **Scrape the plastic off** using a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper, being careful not to damage the dryer's interior.\\n3. **Apply 1 to 2 teaspoons of nail polish remover** to a clean cloth.\\n4. **Rub the plastic** with the cloth to dissolve it.\\n5. **Rub the area** with a damp cloth to rinse off the nail polish remover.\\n6. **Mix 1 teaspoon of liquid laundry soap with 1 cup of water**.\\n7. **Dip a clean cloth** in the soapy solution and rub the area again.\\n8. **Rinse well** with a cloth dipped in clean water.\\n\\nThese steps will help you remove plastic from your clothes dryer effectively.\"]", "time_sec": 42.692, "generation_time_seconds": 41.8794, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8011, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 4057, 12188, 504, 264, 15097, 46622, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 6727, 279, 30841, 261, 389, 264, 28800, 20037, 369, 220, 17, 15, 40999, 95518, 1096, 8609, 79945, 279, 12188, 11, 3259, 432, 8661, 311, 4057, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 3326, 19842, 279, 36008, 4114, 95518, 5443, 264, 22360, 476, 12188, 62883, 5607, 476, 6177, 88034, 311, 15516, 4057, 279, 12188, 13, 2823, 45778, 537, 311, 5557, 279, 46622, 594, 14791, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 28497, 74428, 31984, 4926, 1975, 95518, 19219, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 92100, 315, 30995, 44029, 76248, 448, 264, 4240, 27292, 13, 12839, 279, 12188, 311, 72639, 432, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 49, 258, 325, 448, 264, 422, 1121, 83635, 95518, 5443, 264, 40269, 27292, 311, 73241, 279, 3082, 1380, 279, 12188, 572, 6963, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 10253, 81632, 60631, 12478, 95518, 19219, 220, 16, 41284, 315, 14473, 34089, 26785, 448, 220, 16, 10525, 315, 3015, 13, 55047, 264, 4240, 27292, 304, 419, 6291, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 1549, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 49, 258, 325, 663, 14438, 398, 95518, 57368, 325, 279, 3082, 448, 264, 27292, 72207, 304, 4240, 3015, 311, 5978, 678, 48132, 374, 6963, 382, 2679, 279, 12188, 374, 9016, 5000, 311, 4057, 11, 2908, 23579, 432, 448, 264, 6869, 46622, 476, 8628, 6038, 13, 9646, 31713, 11, 498, 1231, 387, 2952, 311, 57112, 1007, 279, 12188, 13, 4354, 11, 421, 498, 4157, 4057, 678, 279, 12188, 11, 498, 1231, 1184, 311, 8290, 279, 23196, 476, 279, 4453, 46622, 13, 758, 1741, 5048, 11, 432, 374, 11102, 311, 1618, 264, 2473, 53511, 369, 12994, 13, 151645], "pred": "If the plastic is extremely difficult to remove, consider heating it with a hair dryer or heat gun. Once heated, you may be able to peel off the plastic. However, if you cannot remove all the plastic, you may need to replace the drum or the entire dryer. In such cases, it is recommended to call a service technician for assistance.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.117938766110214, "g_worst_claim": -0.039332613348960876, "g_content": 1.505101769920287, "g_traj_mean": 1.126242995262146}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [6727, 279, 46622, 389, 264, 5792, 6243, 369, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 311, 79945, 279, 12188, 13, 2463, 19842, 279, 12188, 1007, 448, 264, 22360, 476, 12188, 62883, 5607, 476, 6177, 88034, 11, 4633, 2453, 537, 311, 5557, 279, 46622, 594, 14791, 13, 20552, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 37920, 13, 30995, 44029, 76248, 311, 264, 4240, 27292, 11, 323, 10273, 279, 12188, 311, 72639, 432, 13, 12839, 279, 3082, 448, 264, 40269, 27292, 311, 73241, 279, 30995, 44029, 76248, 13, 19219, 220, 16, 37920, 13, 14473, 34089, 26785, 448, 220, 16, 10525, 3015, 13, 55047, 264, 4240, 27292, 304, 419, 6291, 11, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 1549, 13, 57368, 325, 1632, 448, 264, 27292, 72207, 304, 4240, 3015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Run the dryer on a regular setting for 20 minutes to soften the plastic. Scrape the plastic off with a wooden or plastic spatula or paint scraper, taking care not to damage the dryer's interior. Apply 1 to 2 tsp. nail polish remover to a clean cloth, and rub the plastic to dissolve it. Rub the area with a damp cloth to rinse the nail polish remover. Mix 1 tsp. liquid laundry soap with 1 cup water. Dip a clean cloth in this solution, and rub the area again. Rinse well with a cloth dipped in clean water.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7379343162414573, "g_worst_claim": 0.9834846496582031, "g_content": 2.3624715336033555, "g_traj_mean": 1.7635482549667358}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 633, 12188, 700, 315, 264, 15097, 46622, 11, 498, 646, 990, 3807, 5413, 11649, 389, 279, 943, 315, 12188, 323, 279, 29920, 315, 279, 6534, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 30404, 30841, 261, 5443, 369, 24079, 6019, 95518, 6452, 279, 46622, 389, 264, 5792, 6243, 369, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 311, 79945, 279, 12188, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 304, 44950, 6019, 279, 12188, 11, 3259, 432, 8661, 311, 57128, 1007, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 3326, 4611, 287, 77619, 95518, 5443, 264, 22360, 476, 12188, 62883, 5607, 476, 6177, 88034, 311, 29273, 57128, 279, 12188, 1007, 279, 46622, 594, 14791, 13, 2823, 16585, 537, 311, 5557, 279, 46622, 594, 7329, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 45, 604, 31984, 4926, 1975, 7323, 95518, 20552, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 92100, 315, 30995, 44029, 76248, 311, 264, 4240, 27292, 323, 10273, 279, 12188, 311, 72639, 432, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 3082, 448, 264, 40269, 27292, 311, 4057, 279, 30995, 44029, 76248, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 35, 1404, 15772, 12478, 95518, 19219, 220, 16, 41284, 315, 14473, 34089, 26785, 448, 220, 16, 10525, 315, 3015, 13, 55047, 264, 4240, 27292, 304, 419, 6291, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 1549, 13, 57368, 325, 26364, 448, 264, 27292, 72207, 304, 4240, 3015, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 1519, 1095, 6730, 95518, 1416, 279, 12188, 374, 5000, 311, 4057, 11, 498, 646, 8628, 432, 448, 264, 6869, 46622, 476, 8628, 6038, 13, 9646, 279, 12188, 374, 31713, 11, 432, 1231, 387, 8661, 311, 57112, 1007, 13, 4354, 11, 387, 45778, 438, 71289, 1095, 646, 5557, 279, 46622, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 57513, 11479, 95518, 1416, 279, 12188, 374, 9016, 2588, 311, 4057, 11, 2908, 24891, 279, 23196, 476, 279, 4453, 46622, 13, 1084, 374, 11102, 311, 1618, 264, 2473, 53511, 369, 419, 943, 315, 12733, 311, 5978, 7149, 323, 6169, 11320, 382, 22, 13, 3070, 7339, 321, 32134, 392, 7132, 95518, 1752, 12188, 389, 279, 46622, 594, 70760, 11, 4057, 9853, 323, 990, 264, 12188, 88034, 311, 57128, 1007, 279, 70736, 12188, 13, 2055, 585, 264, 27292, 304, 64702, 603, 5980, 30995, 44029, 76248, 11, 5274, 432, 389, 279, 2392, 369, 220, 20, 4420, 11, 323, 44901, 279, 9664, 12188, 1007, 448, 279, 27292, 13, 467, 3444, 279, 70760, 448, 264, 4240, 11, 40269, 27292, 323, 4057, 894, 48132, 448, 264, 773, 9667, 3015, 1737, 6450, 27292, 11, 1221, 73241, 448, 3015, 382, 9485, 5413, 646, 13444, 4057, 12188, 504, 264, 15097, 46622, 11, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 13161, 323, 279, 943, 315, 12188, 6398, 13, 151645], "pred": "These methods can effectively remove plastic from a clothes dryer, depending on the specific circumstances and the type of plastic involved.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1250552255528454, "g_worst_claim": 0.08836543560028076, "g_content": 1.4866053531044408, "g_traj_mean": 1.0884937047958374}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 633, 12188, 700, 315, 264, 15097, 46622, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 6727, 279, 46622, 389, 264, 5792, 6243, 369, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 334, 311, 79945, 279, 12188, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 3326, 19842, 279, 12188, 1007, 334, 1667, 264, 22360, 476, 12188, 62883, 5607, 476, 6177, 88034, 11, 1660, 16585, 537, 311, 5557, 279, 46622, 594, 14791, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 28497, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 92100, 315, 30995, 44029, 76248, 334, 311, 264, 4240, 27292, 624, 19, 13, 3070, 65714, 279, 12188, 334, 448, 279, 27292, 311, 72639, 432, 624, 20, 13, 3070, 65714, 279, 3082, 334, 448, 264, 40269, 27292, 311, 73241, 1007, 279, 30995, 44029, 76248, 624, 21, 13, 3070, 58083, 220, 16, 41284, 315, 14473, 34089, 26785, 448, 220, 16, 10525, 315, 3015, 334, 624, 22, 13, 3070, 35, 573, 264, 4240, 27292, 334, 304, 279, 773, 9667, 6291, 323, 10273, 279, 3082, 1549, 624, 23, 13, 3070, 49, 258, 325, 1632, 334, 448, 264, 27292, 72207, 304, 4240, 3015, 382, 9485, 7354, 686, 1492, 498, 4057, 12188, 504, 697, 15097, 46622, 13444, 13, 151645], "pred": "These steps will help you remove plastic from your clothes dryer effectively.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0435610449884218, "g_worst_claim": 0.06662658544687125, "g_content": 1.6295087860851754, "g_traj_mean": 1.0605378150939941}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "To fold a quilt, start by placing the quilt on a flat, smooth surface such as a bed or table. Then, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, ensuring the fold is also on the bias. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To fold a quilt, start by placing the quilt on a flat, smooth surface such as a bed or table. Then, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, ensuring the fold is also on the bias. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "cot": "[\"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"To fold a quilt, begin by laying the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed or table. Then, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Follow this by folding the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the bias fold. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the bias fold.\", \"To fold a quilt, start by placing the quilt on a flat, smooth surface such as a bed or table. Then, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, ensuring the fold is also on the bias. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\"]", "time_sec": 22.28, "generation_time_seconds": 21.6197, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6507, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 19, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 20, 13, 60473, 279, 1909