lt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, ensuring the fold is also on the bias. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.5911332024086234, "g_worst_claim": -0.18070614337921143, "g_content": 0.6349797615638146, "g_traj_mean": 0.5710963606834412}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "47", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is also on the bias.", "pred": "To fold a quilt, start by laying it flat on a bed, table, or other flat surface. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the top left corner down toward the center, and finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring each fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To fold a quilt, start by laying it flat on a bed, table, or other flat surface. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the top left corner down toward the center, and finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring each fold is on the bias.", "cot": "[\"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.\", \"To fold a quilt, start by laying it flat on a bed, table, or other flat surface. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the top left corner down toward the center, and finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring each fold is on the bias.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\nStep 1: Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\nStep 2: Fold the lower right corner of the quilt upward towards the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\nStep 3: Fold the lower left corner of the quilt upward towards the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\nStep 4: Fold the top left corner of the quilt downward towards the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\nStep 5: Fold the top right corner of the quilt downward towards the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nAfter completing these steps, you can proceed with sewing the binding to the quilt as described in the first passage.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Lay the Quilt on a Flat Surface**: Place the quilt on a bed, table, or any other flat surface.\\n2. **Fold the Lower Right Corner**: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. **Fold the Lower Left Corner**: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. **Fold the Top Left Corner**: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, keeping the fold on the bias.\\n5. **Fold the Top Right Corner**: Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps will help you create a neat and organized quilt, ready for sewing binding or other finishing touches.\"]", "time_sec": 24.883, "generation_time_seconds": 24.1441, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7298, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 19, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 20, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 382, 9485, 7354, 686, 1492, 498, 1855, 264, 28485, 323, 16645, 11094, 369, 697, 60736, 13, 151645], "pred": "These steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7273251730057164, "g_worst_claim": -0.006580594640511733, "g_content": 0.6901082992553711, "g_traj_mean": 0.6118642687797546}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1191, 553, 34644, 432, 10063, 389, 264, 4845, 11, 1965, 11, 476, 1008, 10063, 7329, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 9295, 11, 11555, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 11, 1549, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 5005, 11, 11555, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 11, 323, 5499, 11, 11555, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 11, 22573, 1817, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 151645], "pred": "To fold a quilt, start by laying it flat on a bed, table, or other flat surface. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Next, fold the lower left corner up toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the top left corner down toward the center, and finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center, ensuring each fold is on the bias.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.906884927138304, "g_worst_claim": 0.19550883769989014, "g_content": 1.0102631942085598, "g_traj_mean": 0.8706944584846497}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 8304, 220, 16, 25, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 315, 279, 60736, 39772, 6974, 279, 4126, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 315, 279, 60736, 39772, 6974, 279, 4126, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 8304, 220, 19, 25, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 315, 279, 60736, 44478, 6974, 279, 4126, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 8304, 220, 20, 25, 60473, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 315, 279, 60736, 44478, 6974, 279, 4126, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 382, 6025, 26568, 1493, 7354, 11, 498, 646, 10354, 448, 51219, 279, 10970, 311, 279, 60736, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 1156, 21085, 13, 151645], "pred": "After completing these steps, you can proceed with sewing the binding to the quilt as described in the first passage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6209164184437399, "g_worst_claim": -0.435878324508667, "g_content": 0.8044654953647667, "g_traj_mean": 0.6258307695388794}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 43, 352, 279, 3406, 2963, 389, 264, 23577, 26963, 95518, 10771, 279, 60736, 389, 264, 4845, 11, 1965, 11, 476, 894, 1008, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 75536, 279, 27536, 10083, 38248, 95518, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 75536, 279, 27536, 13727, 3824