{"id": "48", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, also on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n\nThese steps will result in a neatly folded quilt with four even corners. Note that the size of the quilt is not specified in the passages, so these steps can be applied to quilts of any size.", "pred": "These steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.", "cot": "[\"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps will help you create a neat and organized appearance for your quilt.\", \"In the passage provided, the instructions for folding a quilt are detailed in steps 2 through 5. Here's how to fold a quilt based on the information given:\\n\\n1. **Step 1:** Lay the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\\n2. **Step 2:** Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n3. **Step 3:** Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. **Step 4:** Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. **Step 5:** Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps provide a method to fold the quilt neatly, with the folds made on the bias to add a professional and decorative touch.\", \"Based on the provided passage, here's how to fold a quilt:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure each fold is on the bias.\\n\\nAnswer:[Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, then the lower left corner up to the center, followed by the top left corner down to the center, and finally, fold the top right corner down to the center, ensuring each fold is on the bias.]\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, with the fold on the bias.\\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\"]", "time_sec": 24.919, "generation_time_seconds": 23.8048, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1038, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1