{"id": "50", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "pred": "The passage mentions that a water pick is a great oral care tool that helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. It specifically states that water picks help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It also mentions that water picks can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. They help clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing can not access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The passage mentions that a water pick is a great oral care tool that helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. It specifically states that water picks help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It also mentions that water picks can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. They help clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing can not access.", "cot": "[\"Benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque: A water pik is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at your gum line, helping to remove germs and plaque that are difficult to reach with a toothbrush.\\n\\n2. Maintaining oral health: Water piks can help maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which can reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n\\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums: Water piks can clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"The passage mentions that a water pick is a great oral care tool that helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. It specifically states that water picks help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It also mentions that water picks can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. They help clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing can not access.\", \"A water pick offers several benefits for oral health, including:\\n- Helps eliminate plaque and germs that are difficult to reach with a toothbrush.\\n- Massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth.\\n- Reduces the risk of gingivitis by cleaning better around the teeth and gums.\\n- Removes food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis. It also helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\"]", "time_sec": 17.043, "generation_time_seconds": 16.0978, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9367, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 25, 362, 3015, 47150, 374, 6188, 311, 6102, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 697, 41265, 1555, 11, 10476, 311, 4057, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 5000, 311, 5545, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 382, 17, 13, 42887, 2056, 20655, 2820, 25, 9959, 47150, 82, 646, 1492, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 553, 3072, 4118, 323, 646