{"id": "57", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "To prevent birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves and top of your porch with staples. Additionally, you can install bird netting over your light fixture to deter birds from accessing it. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. It's important to note that any product used to deter birds should be nonflammable and safe to use.", "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "cot": "[\"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\"]", "time_sec": 14.37, "generation_time_seconds": 13.7324, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6281, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0666183130434383, "g_worst_claim": 1.346793293952942, "g_content": 3.0316429138183594, "g_traj_mean": 2.1231918334960938}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0666183130434383, "g_worst_claim": 1.346793293952942, "g_content": 3.0316429138183594, "g_traj_mean": 2.