{"id": "60", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it.\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is:\n\nAttach bird netting to the eaves or install bird netting over the light fixture, and/or mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. Choose a nonflammable and safe netting. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. Choose a nonflammable and safe netting. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "cot": "[\"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\", \"Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. Choose a nonflammable and safe netting. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\"]", "time_sec": 12.082, "generation_time_seconds": 11.5669, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5076, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0878495026750175, "g_worst_claim": 1.3518264293670654, "g_content": 3.0716179438999722, "g_traj_mean": 2.1446099281311035}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.899334556178043, "g_worst_claim": 2.899334556178043, "g_content": 4.486348470052083, "g_traj_mean": 2.7304530143737793}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0878495026750175, "g_worst_claim": 1.3518264293670654, "g_content": 3.0716179438999722, "g_traj_mean": 2.1446099281311035}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 22201, 264, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 4179, 1280, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 151645], "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. Choose a nonflammable and safe netting. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.134284012777764, "g_worst_claim": 1.3518264293670654, "g_content": 3.1697335243225098, "g_traj_mean": 2.1537396907806396}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.23, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "set default browser to windows", "gt": "Method 1 of 2 in passage 2 provides the steps to set the default web browser in Windows 7.", "pred": "1. Open your Firefox browser.\n2. Click on the Firefox menu button, represented by three horizontal lines and located in the upper right hand corner of the browser window.\n3. Select Options.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Open your Firefox browser.\n2. Click on the Firefox menu button, represented by three horizontal lines and located in the upper right hand corner of the browser window.\n3. Select Options.", "cot": "[\"To set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Open the Settings app by clicking the Settings icon in the Start menu or using the Windows + I keyboard shortcut.\\n2. Click on the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\\n4. On the right-side, scroll down to the Web browser section.\\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as the default browser.\\n\\nThese steps will set Google Chrome as the default browser in Windows.\", \"To set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps based on the provided passage:\\n\\n1. **For Microsoft Edge as the default browser**:\\n   - Open the Settings app by accessing the Start menu or using the Windows + I shortcut.\\n   - Click on the \\\"System\\\" option.\\n   - In the left-pane, click \\\"Default apps.\\\"\\n   - In the right-side section, scroll down to the \\\"Web browser\\\" section.\\n   - Click on the \\\"Edge browser\\\" entry to reveal the option to choose an app.\\n   - Click on \\\"Google Chrome\\\" to set it as the default browser.\\n\\n2. **For Mozilla Firefox as the default browser**:\\n   - Open your Firefox browser.\\n   - Click on the Firefox menu button, which is represented by three horizontal lines in the upper right corner of the browser window.\\n   - Select \\\"Options\\\" from the pop-out menu.\\n\\nThese steps help you set either Microsoft Edge or Mozilla Firefox as the default browser in Windows 7.\", \"Set default browser to windows\\n\\n1. Open Settings app.\\n2. Click the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n3. Click Default apps.\\n4. Scroll down the page to see Web browser section.\\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as default browser.\\n\\nAlternatively, set Mozilla Firefox as your default Windows browser:\\n\\n1. Open your Firefox browser.\\n2. Click on the Firefox menu button, represented by three horizontal lines and located in the upper right hand corner of the browser window.\\n3. Select Options.\", \"To set the default browser to Windows:\\n\\n1. Open Settings app. To do so, open Start menu and then click Settings icon. Alternatively, you can use Windows + I keyboard shortcut to quickly open Settings app.\\n\\n2. Click the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n\\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\\n\\n4. Now, on the right-side, scroll down the page to see Web browser section.\\n\\n5. Click on the browser you want to set as default (e.g., Google Chrome).\\n\\n6. Select the preferred browser.\\n\\nFor Mozilla Firefox:\\n1. Open your Firefox browser.\\n2. Click on the Firefox menu button, represented by three horizontal lines and located in the upper right hand corner of the browser window.\\n3. When the pop-out menu appears, select Options.\"]", "time_sec": 25.048, "generation_time_seconds": 24.3599, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6777, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 738, 279, 1638, 6929, 304, 5515, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 