{"id": "68", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn US flag is to either:\n\n1. Remove the blue field and burn it in a peaceful manner, then bury the ashes.\n2. Fold the flag in the customary triangle fold and burn it in a proper ceremony.\n\nTherefore, the answer is:\n\n1. Remove the blue field and burn it, or\n2. Fold the flag in the customary triangle fold and burn it in a proper ceremony.", "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn American flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, then you must fold the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning it.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The proper way to dispose of a worn American flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, then you must fold the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning it.", "cot": "[\"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony.\", \"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. This method involves folding the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning it.\", \"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as mentioned in the passage, is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony.\", \"The proper way to dispose of a worn American flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, then you must fold the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning it.\"]", "time_sec": 9.127, "generation_time_seconds": 8.613, "selection_time_seconds": 0.508, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 374, 311, 8231, 432, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 151645], "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5081557273864745, "g_worst_claim": 1.5081557273864745, "g_content": 1.2067897584703233, "g_traj_mean": 1.4213693141937256}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 374, 311, 8231, 432, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 1096, 1714, 17601, 44742, 279, 5181, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 1573, 19675, 432, 13, 151645], "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. This method involves folding the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning it.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7704579989115397, "g_worst_claim": 1.501917839050293, "g_content": 2.066482095157399, "g_traj_mean": 1.711201548576355}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 11, 374, 311, 8231, 432, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 151645], "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as mentioned in the passage, is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.044064534673787, "g_worst_claim": 0.10135040680567424, "g_content": 1.0721541318026455, "g_traj_mean": 1.0976423025131226}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 3693, 5181, 374, 311, 8231, 279, 5181, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 1416, 498, 525, 2952, 311, 15726, 31543, 697, 23704, 5181, 504, 2473, 11, 1221, 498, 1969, 11555, 279, 5181, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 1573, 19675, 432, 13, 151645], "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn American flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, then you must fol