{"id": "73", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\n\n1. Physical contact: Avoid physical contact that could be misinterpreted as fondling or sexual activity (Passage 1).\n2. Eye contact: If your coworker is consistently staring at you, it may be a sign that they are interested in you (Passage 2).\n3. Smiling: If your coworker smiles at you excessively, even when there is no apparent reason to do so, it may be a sign of flirtation (Passage 2).\n4. Seeking contact: If your coworker consistently finds reasons to be near you or seek you out discreetly, it may indicate that they have feelings for you (Passage 3).\n\nHowever, it is essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean that your coworker is interested in you romantically. It's important to pay attention to the context of their behavior and communicate openly to avoid misunderstandings.\n\nIf you are unsure about your coworker's intentions, it may be best to avoid physical contact and observe their behavior over time before making any conclusions. Additionally, it's crucial to respect your coworker's boundaries and maintain a professional work environment.", "pred": "The male coworker may be flirting with you if he constantly seeks out contact with you, such as by being at your desk or finding reasons to have contact with you. He might also suggest that you not continue flirting with him if he seems uncomfortable.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The male coworker may be flirting with you if he constantly seeks out contact with you, such as by being at your desk or finding reasons to have contact with you. He might also suggest that you not continue flirting with him if he seems uncomfortable.", "cot": "[\"To tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you should look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as fondling, or if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or finds any reason to touch you, it could be a sign of flirting.\", \"The male coworker may be flirting with you if he constantly seeks out contact with you, such as by being at your desk or finding reasons to have contact with you. He might also suggest that you not continue flirting with him if he seems uncomfortable.\", \"To answer whether the male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs like uncomfortable physical contact, such as fondling or inappropriate touches. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests stopping the flirtation, it's best to respect their feelings. Additionally, pay attention to whether they always stare at you or make eye contact when there's no reason for it.\", \"To determine if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as sexual activity or fondling, and if they seem uncomfortable or suggest you stop flirting, it might be a sign they are not interested. Additionally, if they constantly seek you out or find reasons to have contact with you, this can also be an indication of affection or admiration.\"]", "time_sec": 13.819, "generation_time_seconds": 13.1977, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6159, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 498, 1265, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 6961, 3645, 429, 2578, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 11, 476, 421, 566, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 566, 13814, 94402, 518, 498, 476, 13719, 894, 2874, 311, 5796, 498, 11, 432, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 87242, 13, 151645], "pred": "To tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you should look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as fondling, or if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or finds any reason to touch you, it could be a sign of flirting.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3628337765576546, "g_worst_claim": 0.3848761320114136, "g_content": 2.7011353174845376, "g_traj_mean": 1.481466293334961}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 8593, 59968, 261, 1231, 387, 87242, 448, 498, 421, 566, 14971, 25654, 700, 3645, 448, 498, 11, 1741, 438, 553, 1660, 518, 697, 18010, 476, 9271, 7966, 311, 614, 3645, 448, 498, 13, 1260, 2578, 1083, 4190, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 421, 566, 4977, 28113, 13, 151645], "pred": "The male coworker may be flirting with you if he constantly seeks out contact with you, such as by being at your desk or finding reasons to have contact with you. He might also suggest that you not continue flirting with him if he seems uncomfortable.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9249883978455156, "g_worst_claim": 1.4190414216783311, "g_content": 4.00521183013916, "g_traj_mean": 1.8683044910430908}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 4226, 3425, 279, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 1401, 369, 11929, 1075, 28113, 6961, 3645, 11, 1741, 438, 21208, 2718, 476, 32681, 28627, 13, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 22535, 279, 52630, 367, 11, 432, 594, 1850, 311, 5091, 862, 15650, 13, 22406, 11, 2291, 6529, 311, 3425, 807, 2677, 45843, 518, 498, 476, 1281, 7912, 3645, 979, 1052, 594, 902, 2874, 369, 432, 13, 151645], "pred": "To answer whether the male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs like uncomfortable physical contact, such as fondling or inappropriate touches. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests stopping the flirtation, it's best to respect their feelings. Additionally, pay attention to whether they always stare at you or make eye contact when there's no reason for it.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8474623159831096, "g_worst_claim": 0.09044614434242249, "g_content": 1.385026216506958, "g_traj_mean": 0.8295997977256775}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 8253, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 6961, 3645, 429, 2578, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 7244, 5702, 476, 21208, 2718, 11, 323, 421, 807, 2803, 28113, 476, 4190, 498, 2936, 87242, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 264, 1841, 807, 525, 537, 8014, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 807, 14971, 5931, 498, 700, 476, 1477, 7966, 311, 614, 3645, 448, 498, 11, 419, 646, 1083, 387, 458, 27039, 315, 36705, 476, 65839, 13, 151645], "pred": "To determine if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as sexual activity or fondling, and if they seem uncomfortable or suggest you stop flirting, it might be a sign they are not interested. Additionally, if they constantly seek you out or find reasons to have contact with you, this can also be an indication of affection or admiration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.483854707804593, "g_worst_claim": 0.21222257614135742, "g_content": 2.796117146809896, "g_traj_mean": 1.5683039426803589}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.6, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "74", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some signs that a male coworker may be flirting with you:\n\n* He finds reasons to be near you and seek you out discreetly (Passage 3)\n* He is always staring at you and catches your eye (Passage 2)\n* He touches you unnecessarily or finds excuses to have physical contact with you (Passage 2)\n* He smiles at you excessively or without apparent reason (Passage 2)\n* He seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him (Passage 1)\n\nIf you observe these behaviors from a male coworker, it may be a sign that he is interested in you and flirting with you. However, it's essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean the person likes you romantically, and it's possible they just have a friendly interest in you. To confirm their intentions, consider observing their behavior over time, and if you feel comfortable, try initiating a conversation or asking them out.", "pred": "If the guy you're flirting with seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so. You don't want to risk losing your job flirting with him, especially when he's not interested.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "If the guy you're flirting with seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so. You don't want to risk losing your job flirting with him, especially when he's not interested.", "cot": "[\"To tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you should look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as fondling, or if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or finds any reason to touch you, it could be a sign of flirting.\", \"If the guy you're flirting with seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so. You don't want to risk losing your job flirting with him, especially when he's not interested.\", \"Based on the provided passages, to tell if a male coworker is flirting with you, you should look for signs such as:\\n\\n1. **Uncomfortable or Suggestive Physical Contact**: If the coworker avoids physical contact that could be misconstrued as sexual activity or fondling, it might indicate discomfort with your advances. For example, if the coworker suggests that you should stop flirting with him or she seems uncomfortable with your physical proximity.\\n\\n2. **Constant Staring**: If the coworker frequently stares at you when you see her or him, it could be a sign of interest. This behavior can be subtle, so it's important to pay attention to any consistent patterns of attention.\\n\\n3. **Persistent Seeking of Contact**: If the coworker frequently seeks you out discreetly, either by being near your desk or finding reasons to interact with you, it might suggest a desire for more personal attention. This could be a clear sign of flirtation if the coworker's actions are persistent and focused on you.\\n\\n4. **Unusual Smiling**: If the coworker smiles at you for no apparent reason or frequently, it might be a sign of interest. However, it's important to consider whether the smiles are genuine and not part of a workplace culture or social norms.\\n\\n5. **Avoiding Loss of Job**: If the coworker seems uncomfortable and suggests that you should stop flirting with him, it might be a sign that they are not interested. It's crucial to respect these boundaries and avoid risking a professional relationship or job.\\n\\nBy being observant and aware of these signs, you can better understand whether your coworker has flirtatious intentions toward you.\", \"Based on the provided passages, you can tell if your male coworker is flirting with you by observing the following signs:\\n\\n1. **Physical Contact**: Pay attention to any physical contact that might be suggestive or inappropriate. This includes unnecessary touching or fondling. For example, if he frequently places his hand on your arm or shoulder in a way that seems out of context or makes you feel uncomfortable, this could be a sign of flirtation.\\n\\n2. **Uncomfortable Situation**: If he appears uncomfortable or suggests that you should stop flirting with him, it is wise to take his cues seriously. Ignoring his discomfort could lead to an awkward situation, especially if he is not interested.\\n\\n3. **Unusual Attention**: Notice if he frequently stares at you or makes extended eye contact. If he does this, it might be a sign that he is attracted to you. For instance, if he consistently looks at you when you are engaged in a task or conversation, this could indicate interest.\\n\\n4. **Flirty Movements**: Be aware of any flirty movements like leaning in close or smiling in a playful manner. A co-worker who flirts with you might engage in these behaviors more often than others.\\n\\n5. **Seeking Contact**: If he frequently seeks out opportunities to be near you, such as sitting close to you or having excuses to interact with you more than necessary, this could be a sign of affection.\\n\\nBy observing these behaviors and reacting appropriately to any discomfort or signs of interest, you can better understand whether your male coworker is flirting with you.\"]", "time_sec": 29.654, "generation_time_seconds": 28.8737, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7749, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 498, 1265, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 6961, 3645, 429, 2578, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 11, 476, 421, 566, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 566, 13814, 94402, 518, 498, 476, 13719, 894, 2874, 311, 5796, 498, 11, 432, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 87242, 13, 151645], "pred": "To tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you should look for signs such as physical contact that might be misconstrued as fondling, or if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or finds any reason to touch you, it could be a sign of flirting.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3580258143575568, "g_worst_claim": 0.3631843328475952, "g_content": 2.684807459513346, "g_traj_mean": 1.4744060039520264}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [2679, 279, 7412, 498, 2299, 87242, 448, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 653, 773, 13, 1446, 1513, 944, 1366, 311, 5214, 13188, 697, 2618, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 5310, 979, 566, 594, 537, 8014, 13, 151645], "pred": "If the guy you're flirting with seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so. You don't want to risk losing your job flirting with him, especially when he's not interested.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.3658125712559532, "g_worst_claim": 1.5881122861589705, "g_content": 4.338468279157366, "g_traj_mean": 2.5794601440429688}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 311, 3291, 421, 264, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 498, 1265, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 1806, 19411, 480, 476, 328, 3799, 533, 27379, 9180, 95518, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 54852, 6961, 3645, 429, 1410, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 7244, 5702, 476, 21208, 2718, 11, 432, 2578, 13216, 43676, 448, 697, 29903, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 421, 279, 59968, 261, 13230, 429, 498, 1265, 2936, 87242, 448, 1435, 476, 1340, 4977, 28113, 448, 697, 6961, 36743, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 15472, 794, 3249, 95518, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 13814, 94402, 518, 498, 979, 498, 1490, 1059, 476, 1435, 11, 432, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 2734, 13, 1096, 7709, 646, 387, 26447, 11, 773, 432, 594, 2989, 311, 2291, 6529, 311, 894, 12966, 12624, 315, 6529, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 53194, 58705, 315, 9180, 95518, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 13814, 25654, 498, 700, 61404, 398, 11, 2987, 553, 1660, 3143, 697, 18010, 476, 9271, 7966, 311, 16282, 448, 498, 11, 432, 2578, 4190, 264, 12591, 369, 803, 4345, 6529, 13, 1096, 1410, 387, 264, 2797, 1841, 315, 52630, 367, 421, 279, 59968, 261, 594, 6168, 525, 24999, 323, 10735, 389, 498, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 1806, 80224, 4388, 7979, 95518, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 42532, 518, 498, 369, 902, 9981, 2874, 476, 13814, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 2734, 13, 4354, 11, 432, 594, 2989, 311, 2908, 3425, 279, 42532, 525, 22011, 323, 537, 949, 315, 264, 26368, 7674, 476, 3590, 39751, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 52116, 287, 24704, 315, 12011, 95518, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 4977, 28113, 323, 13230, 429, 498, 1265, 2936, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 264, 1841, 429, 807, 525, 537, 8014, 13, 1084, 594, 16587, 311, 5091, 1493, 22711, 323, 5648, 84922, 264, 6584, 5025, 476, 2618, 382, 1359, 1660, 9282, 517, 323, 7853, 315, 1493, 11929, 11, 498, 646, 2664, 3535, 3425, 697, 59968, 261, 702, 52630, 266, 1223, 33234, 8841, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "By being observant and aware of these signs, you can better understand whether your coworker has flirtatious intentions toward you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6162052225593402, "g_worst_claim": -0.12759527293118564, "g_content": 1.3110146558921756, "g_traj_mean": 0.7203264236450195}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 553, 44971, 279, 2701, 11929, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 39253, 9180, 95518, 11471, 6529, 311, 894, 6961, 3645, 429, 2578, 387, 98478, 476, 32681, 13, 1096, 5646, 25165, 30587, 476, 21208, 2718, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 421, 566, 13814, 7482, 806, 1424, 389, 697, 6773, 476, 16882, 304, 264, 1616, 429, 4977, 700, 315, 2266, 476, 3643, 498, 2666, 28113, 11, 419, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 52630, 367, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 1806, 19411, 480, 68378, 95518, 1416, 566, 7952, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 1265, 2936, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 432, 374, 23335, 311, 1896, 806, 55916, 13919, 13, 33781, 5503, 806, 43676, 1410, 2990, 311, 458, 28759, 6534, 11, 5310, 421, 566, 374, 537, 8014, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 1806, 80224, 62020, 95518, 24742, 421, 566, 13814, 94402, 518, 498, 476, 3643, 11577, 7912, 3645, 13, 1416, 566, 1558, 419, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 264, 1841, 429, 566, 374, 28023, 311, 498, 13, 1752, 2867, 11, 421, 566, 20699, 5868, 518, 498, 979, 498, 525, 16634, 304, 264, 3383, 476, 10435, 11, 419, 1410, 13216, 2734, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 3882, 16531, 53285, 3723, 95518, 2823, 7853, 315, 894, 1320, 16531, 19029, 1075, 48348, 304, 3265, 476, 36063, 304, 264, 56069, 11566, 13, 362, 1062, 65516, 879, 1320, 19666, 448, 498, 2578, 16579, 304, 1493, 27099, 803, 3545, 1091, 3800, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 39350, 287, 9180, 95518, 1416, 566, 13814, 25654, 700, 10488, 311, 387, 3143, 498, 11, 1741, 438, 11699, 3265, 311, 498, 476, 3432, 54486, 311, 16282, 448, 498, 803, 1091, 5871, 11, 419, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 36705, 382, 1359, 44971, 1493, 27099, 323, 73050, 34901, 311, 894, 43676, 476, 11929, 315, 2734, 11, 498, 646, 2664, 3535, 3425, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "By observing these behaviors and reacting appropriately to any discomfort or signs of interest, you can better understand whether your male coworker is flirting with you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.4294863246966919, "g_worst_claim": 0.044320862740278244, "g_content": 0.6702611727977362, "g_traj_mean": 0.39438027143478394}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.83, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "75", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "Based on the passages provided, the steps to cook brats are as follows:\n\n1. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook. \n2. Combine beer and onions in a large pot and bring it to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n4. In the meantime, preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.\n5. After simmering, remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and reduce the heat to low, continuing to cook the onions.\n6. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning occasionally, for about 10 to 14 minutes until they are browned evenly.\n7. Serve the bratwurst with the beer and onion mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "To cook bratwurst, start by pricking them with a fork to prevent them from bursting while cooking. Place the bratwurst, onions, butter, and beer in a large stock pot. Bring the mixture to a boil over medium heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes. Before serving, transfer the bratwurst to a preheated grill set to medium-high heat. Cook the bratwurst on the grill, turning occasionally, for 5 to 10 minutes per side until evenly browned. Serve the cooked bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To cook bratwurst, start by pricking them with a fork to prevent them from bursting while cooking. Place the bratwurst, onions, butter, and beer in a large stock pot. Bring the mixture to a boil over medium heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes. Before serving, transfer the bratwurst to a preheated grill set to medium-high heat. Cook the bratwurst on the grill, turning occasionally, for 5 to 10 minutes per side until evenly browned. Serve the cooked bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "cot": "[\"To cook brats, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\\n5. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n6. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\\n7. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\", \"To cook bratwurst, start by pricking them with a fork to prevent them from bursting while cooking. Place the bratwurst, onions, butter, and beer in a large stock pot. Bring the mixture to a boil over medium heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes. Before serving, transfer the bratwurst to a preheated grill set to medium-high heat. Cook the bratwurst on the grill, turning occasionally, for 5 to 10 minutes per side until evenly browned. Serve the cooked bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\", \"1. Prick bratwurst with fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n2. Place in a large stock pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\\n3. Place pot over medium heat, and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\", \"1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. When hot, lightly oil grate.\\n3. Place bratwurst in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\\n4. Place pot over medium heat, and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n5. Cook bratwurst on preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.\\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture; reduce heat to low, and continue cooking the onions.\\n7. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, 5 to 10 minutes.\\n8. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\"]", "time_sec": 22.442, "generation_time_seconds": 21.4335, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0022, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 4296, 1411, 1862, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 624, 17, 13, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 304, 264, 3460, 3338, 26, 4446, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 19, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 20980, 11, 7842, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 624, 20, 13, 2340, 865, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 438, 807, 4296, 624, 21, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 3338, 448, 279, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 22, 13, 10771, 279, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 11, 13054, 3055, 11, 369, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 624, 24, 13, 52932, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n5. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n6. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n7. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.318940975612759, "g_worst_claim": 0.11463654041290283, "g_content": 1.818476290316195, "g_traj_mean": 1.1679877042770386}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 4296, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 11, 1191, 553, 548, 16272, 1105, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 76750, 1393, 17233, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 11, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 304, 264, 3460, 5591, 3338, 13, 39124, 279, 20980, 311, 264, 43690, 916, 11051, 8628, 11, 1221, 7949, 279, 8628, 311, 3347, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 13, 13235, 13480, 11, 8317, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 311, 264, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 738, 311, 11051, 27561, 8628, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 39058, 11, 13054, 22930, 11, 369, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 817, 3108, 3080, 41047, 13876, 291, 13, 52932, 279, 29105, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "To cook bratwurst, start by pricking them with a fork to prevent them from bursting while cooking. Place the bratwurst, onions, butter, and beer in a large stock pot. Bring the mixture to a boil over medium heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes. Before serving, transfer the bratwurst to a preheated grill set to medium-high heat. Cook the bratwurst on the grill, turning occasionally, for 5 to 10 minutes per side until evenly browned. Serve the cooked bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8306315270271422, "g_worst_claim": 0.006090323130289714, "g_content": 1.1977838689630682, "g_traj_mean": 0.864109456539154}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16, 13, 2340, 865, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 438, 807, 4296, 624, 17, 13, 10771, 304, 264, 3460, 5591, 3338, 448, 279, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Prick bratwurst with fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n2. Place in a large stock pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n3. Place pot over medium heat, and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7922150174776714, "g_worst_claim": 0.810578982035319, "g_content": 2.6841322580973306, "g_traj_mean": 1.7282116413116455}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 624, 17, 13, 3197, 4017, 11, 33404, 5590, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 264, 3460, 5591, 3338, 448, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 19, 13, 10771, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 624, 20, 13, 12514, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 369, 220, 16, 15, 311, 220, 16, 19, 4420, 11, 13054, 22930, 311, 13876, 41047, 624, 21, 13, 10783, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 504, 279, 12883, 20980, 26, 7949, 8628, 311, 3347, 11, 323, 3060, 17233, 279, 44597, 624, 22, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 11, 13054, 3055, 11, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 52932, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. When hot, lightly oil grate.\n3. Place bratwurst in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n4. Place pot over medium heat, and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n5. Cook bratwurst on preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture; reduce heat to low, and continue cooking the onions.\n7. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, 5 to 10 minutes.\n8. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5481605840364252, "g_worst_claim": 0.908601847561923, "g_content": 1.7601650864330691, "g_traj_mean": 1.3988049030303955}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 61.44, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "77", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "To cook brats, follow these steps:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n4. Place the bratwurst in a large pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and continue cooking on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally.\n7. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "To cook brats:\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Place the bratwursts in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n4. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding.\n5. Cook the bratwursts on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To cook brats:\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Place the bratwursts in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n4. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding.\n5. Cook the bratwursts on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.", "cot": "[\"To cook brats, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\\n5. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n6. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\\n7. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\", \"Answer: To cook brats, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. In a large pot, combine beer and onions.\\n4. Bring the mixture to a boil.\\n5. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\\n6. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\\n7. Reduce heat to low and continue cooking the onions.\\n8. When the onions are cooked, remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture.\\n9. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning occasionally to brown evenly, for 5 to 10 minutes.\\n10. Serve the cooked bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\\n\\nPrick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding while cooking.\", \"To cook brats:\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Place the bratwursts in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n4. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding.\\n5. Cook the bratwursts on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.\", \"Answer: To cook brats, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Prick bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n2. Place the bratwurst in a large stock pot with onions, butter, and beer.\\n3. Lightly oil the grill grate and preheat the grill for medium-high heat.\\n4. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n5. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.\\n6. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the bratwurst is cooked evenly and thoroughly, preventing any risk of overcooking the onions or the bratwurst itself.\"]", "time_sec": 25.205, "generation_time_seconds": 24.4281, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7691, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 4296, 1411, 1862, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 624, 17, 13, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 304, 264, 3460, 3338, 26, 4446, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 19, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 20980, 11, 7842, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 624, 20, 13, 2340, 865, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 438, 807, 4296, 624, 21, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 3338, 448, 279, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 22, 13, 10771, 279, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 11, 13054, 3055, 11, 369, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 624, 24, 13, 52932, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n5. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n6. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n7. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3005481390367744, "g_worst_claim": 0.13341236114501953, "g_content": 1.8150313093855575, "g_traj_mean": 1.1614388227462769}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 2014, 4296, 1411, 1862, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13,