", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.339695488611857, "g_worst_claim": 1.0287753105163575, "g_content": 1.8956212495502673, "g_traj_mean": 1.4587211608886719}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [20170, 11, 19858, 307, 22629, 304, 21591, 151645], "pred": "Hot, Humid Weather in Indiana", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.468156433105469, "g_worst_claim": 2.468156433105469, "g_content": 6.478845119476318, "g_traj_mean": 3.903110980987549}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [14260, 9104, 304, 21591, 25, 8007, 11, 19858, 307, 22629, 304, 21591, 151645], "pred": "typical weather in Indiana: Hot, Humid Weather in Indiana", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.3286799294607983, "g_worst_claim": 2.3096204485212053, "g_content": 3.5221549442836215, "g_traj_mean": 2.19681453704834}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "97", "question": "typical weather in indiana", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the typical weather in Indiana includes long, warm, humid, and wet summers, and chilly and windy winters. The temperature ranges from 22°F to 85°F throughout the year. The passages also mention snowfall and snow accumulation in specific cities, but do not provide a comprehensive overview of the typical weather in Indiana. Therefore, it is not possible to provide a complete answer based solely on the given passages.", "pred": "Typical weather in Indianapolis, Indiana, United States, is characterized by long, warm, humid summers, and chilly, windy winters. The temperatures typically range from 22°F to 85°F, with rare drops below 3°F or rises above 92°F.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Typical weather in Indianapolis, Indiana, United States, is characterized by long, warm, humid summers, and chilly, windy winters. The temperatures typically range from 22°F to 85°F, with rare drops below 3°F or rises above 92°F.", "cot": "[\"Based on the provided passages, the typical weather in Indiana can be described as follows:\\n\\n1. **Summers**: Long, warm, humid, and wet.\\n2. **Winters**: Chilly and windy.\\n3. **Year-round**: Partly cloudy.\\n\\nSpecific details include:\\n- Temperatures typically vary from 22°F to 85°F.\\n- The temperature is rarely below 3°F or above 92°F.\\n- The wettest year recorded in Indianapolis was 1876 with 57.65 inches of measured rain.\\n- The driest year recorded in Indianapolis was 1934 with 24.97 inches of measured rain.\\n- The most snowfall recorded in one season was 74.5 inches in 1979 in Rockford.\\n- The maximum monthly precipitation was over 16 inches in July 2003 and 2004 at Kokomo.\\n\\nAnswer: Typical weather in Indiana includes long, warm, humid summers; chilly, windy winters; and partly cloudy conditions year-round.\", \"Based on the given passages, the typical weather in Indiana can be described as having both hot and humid summers and chilly, windy winters. The average temperature throughout the year in Indianapolis ranges from 22°F to 85°F, with temperatures rarely dropping below 3°F or rising above 92°F. There is also significant variation in precipitation, with the wettest year recorded in 1876 having 57.65 inches of measured rain and the driest year in 1934 having only 24.97 inches of measured rain. Additionally, there have been instances of extreme snowfall, with the most snowfall recorded in 1979 in Rockford at 74.5 inches in one season.\", \"Answer: Typical weather in Indianapolis, Indiana, United States, is characterized by long, warm, humid summers, and chilly, windy winters. The temperatures typically range from 22°F to 85°F, with rare drops below 3°F or rises above 92°F.\", \"In Indianapolis, Indiana, the summers are long, warm, humid, and wet; the winters are chilly and windy; and it is partly cloudy year round.\"]", "time_sec": 19.507, "generation_time_seconds": 18.6098, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8913, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 14260, 9104, 304, 21591, 646, 387, 7481, 438, 11017, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 9190, 22780, 95518, 5724, 11, 8205, 11, 65938, 11, 323, 14401, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 54, 49940, 95518, 910, 14385, 323, 92921, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 9490, 21015, 95518, 3660, 398, 73549, 382, 47514, 3565, 2924, 510, 12, 74683, 2789, 11136, 13289, 504, 220, 17, 17, 58472, 311, 220, 23, 20, 58472, 624, 12, 576, 9315, 374, 18521, 3685, 220, 18, 58472, 476, 3403, 220, 24, 17, 58472, 624, 12, 576, 14401, 1944, 1042, 12433, 304, 41351, 572, 220, 16, 23, 22, 21, 448, 220, 20, 22, 13, 21, 20, 14924, 315, 16878, 11174, 624, 12, 576, 49411, 477, 1042, 12433, 304, 41351, 572, 220, 16, 24, 18, 19, 448, 220, 17, 19, 13, 24, 22, 14924, 315, 16878, 11174, 624, 12, 576, 1429, 11794, 13464, 12433, 304, 825, 3200, 572, 22