{"id": "119", "question": "teresa name meaning", "gt": "The name Teresa is of Greek, American, Italian, and Spanish origin. In Greek and American, it means 'Reap; from Therasia.' In Italian, it is interpreted as 'Harvester.' In Spanish, the name is associated with two popular saints, 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux.' The name is also thought to originate from the Greek “therizein” meaning “to harvest, harvester” or from the Greek “theros” meaning “summer”.", "pred": "The name Teresa has different meanings depending on the language:\n\n- In Greek, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In American, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In Italian, the name Teresa means \"Harvester.\"\n- In Spanish, the name Teresa means \"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\"\n\nThe name Theresa is also a Greek baby name, and in Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The name Teresa has different meanings depending on the language:\n\n- In Greek, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In American, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In Italian, the name Teresa means \"Harvester.\"\n- In Spanish, the name Teresa means \"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\"\n\nThe name Theresa is also a Greek baby name, and in Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "cot": "[\"The name Teresa has different meanings depending on the language:\\n\\n- In Greek, the name Teresa means \\\"Reap; from Therasia.\\\"\\n- In American, the name Teresa means \\\"Reap; from Therasia.\\\"\\n- In Italian, the name Teresa means \\\"Harvester.\\\"\\n- In Spanish, the name Teresa means \\\"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\\\"\\n\\nThe name Theresa is also a Greek baby name, and in Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \\\"Reaper; from Therasia.\\\"\", \"Reap; from Therasia\", \"The name Teresa has several meanings across different cultures:\\n\\n1. **Greek Meaning**: In Greek, the name Teresa means \\\"Reap\\\" or \\\"Harvester,\\\" originating from Therasia.\\n2. **American Meaning**: In American culture, the name Teresa also means \\\"Reap\\\" or \\\"Harvester,\\\" similar to its Greek origins.\\n3. **Italian Meaning**: In Italian, the name Teresa means \\\"Harvester.\\\"\\n4. **Spanish Meaning**: In Spanish, the name Teresa is associated with two popular saints, Teresa of Avila and Thérèse of Lisieux.\\n5. **Historical Origin**: The name Teresa is derived from the Greek word \\\"therizein,\\\" meaning \\\"to harvest\\\" or \\\"harvester.\\\" It is also thought to come from the Greek word \\\"theros,\\\" meaning \\\"summer.\\\"\", \"Based on the provided passages, the meaning of the name Teresa varies across different cultures:\\n\\n1. **Greek Meaning**: The name Teresa is a Greek baby name. In Greek, the meaning of the name Teresa is \\\"Reap; from Therasia.\\\"\\n2. **American Meaning**: The name Teresa is an American baby name. In American, the meaning of the name Teresa is \\\"Reap; from Therasia.\\\"\\n3. **Italian Meaning**: The name Teresa is an Italian baby name. In Italian, the meaning of the name Teresa is \\\"Harvester.\\\"\\n4. **Spanish Meaning**: The name Teresa is a Spanish baby name. In Spanish, the meaning of the name Teresa is \\\"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux.'\\\"\\n\\nAdditionally, the name Theresa also has the following meanings:\\n\\n1. **Greek Meaning**: The name Theresa is a Greek baby name. In Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \\\"Reaper; from Therasia.\\\"\\n2. **American Meaning**: The name Theresa is an American baby name. In American, the meaning of the name Theresa is \\\"Reaper; from Therasia.\\\"\\n\\nBoth Teresa and Theresa share the Greek origin and the associated meanings related to harvest or reaping.\"]", "time_sec": 22.709, "generation_time_seconds": 21.9882, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7133, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 829, 63440, 702, 2155, 49700, 11649, 389, 279, 4128, 1447, 12, 758, 17860, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 3363, 330, 693, 391, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 10040, 12, 758, 3693, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 3363, 330, 693, 391, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 10040, 12, 758, 14811, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 3363, 330, 26490, 82738, 10040, 12, 758, 15154, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 3363, 330, 675, 315, 1378, 5411, 67120, 364, 51, 37586, 315, 7519, 10524, 6, 323, 364, 1001, 261, 2367, 315, 43072, 52719, 6, 2217, 785, 829, 42712, 374, 1083, 264, 17860, 8770, 829, 11, 323, 304, 17860, 11, 279, 7290, 315, 279, 829, 42712, 374, 330, 693, 3191, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 1189, 151645], "pred": "The name Teresa has different meanings depending on the language:\n\n- In Greek, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In American, the name Teresa means \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n- In Italian, the name Teresa means \"Harvester.\"\n- In Spanish, the name Teresa means \"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\"\n\nThe name Theresa is also a Greek baby name, and in Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6806265290256095, "g_worst_claim": 0.7026221752166748, "g_content": 2.1576065790085566, "g_traj_mean": 1.5529478788375854}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [693, 391, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 151645], "pred": "Reap; from Therasia", "grounding_scores": null}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 829, 63440, 702, 3807, 49700, 3941, 2155, 26735, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 94348, 48103, 95518, 758, 17860, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 3363, 330, 693, 391, 1, 476, 330, 26490, 82738, 1335, 70273, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 28418, 48103, 95518, 758, 3