ividual cloves of garlic.\n4. Place the garlic heads in a baking pan, cut side up. A muffin pan works great for this, as it keeps the garlic bulbs from rolling around.\n5. Drizzle a couple teaspoons of olive oil over each exposed head, using your fingers to rub the olive oil over all the cut, exposed garlic cloves.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5017034796730173, "g_worst_claim": 0.150594433148702, "g_content": 1.7118940477247362, "g_traj_mean": 1.5316805839538574}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 57685, 3842, 30635, 84288, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 697, 23387, 311, 220, 19, 15, 15, 58472, 320, 17, 15, 20, 30937, 4292, 17, 13, 88594, 323, 37867, 279, 25298, 722, 15955, 13617, 315, 279, 4361, 30635, 45812, 11, 9380, 34439, 279, 49950, 315, 279, 3842, 84288, 315, 30635, 13, 715, 18, 13, 12091, 264, 17232, 21430, 11, 3931, 220, 16, 14, 19, 311, 220, 16, 14, 17, 17122, 504, 279, 1909, 315, 84288, 11, 45966, 279, 3842, 84288, 315, 30635, 624, 19, 13, 10771, 279, 30635, 14629, 304, 264, 27815, 7215, 11, 3931, 3108, 705, 13, 320, 32, 54304, 258, 7215, 4278, 2244, 369, 419, 11, 438, 432, 13598, 279, 30635, 53220, 504, 20097, 2163, 28175, 20, 13, 2926, 43137, 264, 5625, 92100, 315, 32113, 5590, 916, 1817, 14900, 1968, 11, 1667, 697, 19225, 311, 10273, 279, 32113, 5590, 916, 678, 279, 3931, 11, 14900, 30635, 84288, 624, 21, 13, 4636, 926, 14725, 11, 279, 30635, 84288, 686, 387, 89058, 323, 646, 387, 9768, 304, 458, 264, 2106, 491, 5476, 304, 279, 44944, 369, 705, 311, 220, 16, 15, 2849, 382, 15309, 86219, 25, 14263, 279, 30635, 84288, 311, 12656, 448, 41293, 323, 48559, 11, 421, 498, 1075, 13, 1752, 4960, 17172, 11, 498, 646, 912, 1045, 272, 352, 25136, 476, 16392, 50526, 24353, 16723, 11, 95779, 359, 86219, 6514, 11, 54078, 16723, 11, 31620, 297, 1580, 5652, 11, 3594, 73, 93496, 11, 270, 30118, 11, 16009, 1534, 11, 259, 1118, 6113, 11, 476, 67086, 13, 22201, 3200, 819, 429, 22766, 279, 3607, 498, 2299, 1667, 279, 53562, 30635, 448, 382, 16141, 25, 11830, 559, 3842, 30635, 84288, 553, 855, 383, 1095, 279, 23387, 311, 220, 19, 15, 15, 58472, 320, 17, 15, 20, 30937, 701, 1051, 20058, 323, 14376, 279, 30635, 11, 24047, 1105, 304, 264, 27815, 7215, 11, 323, 1353, 89119, 32113, 5590, 916, 1105, 13, 96195, 3200, 448, 41293, 323, 48559, 13, 151645], "pred": "Roast individual garlic cloves by preheating the oven to 400°F (205°C), peeling and cutting the garlic, placing them in a baking pan, and drizzling olive oil over them. Optionally season with herbs and spices.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2940134684953202, "g_worst_claim": 0.12342411994934083, "g_content": 1.7355586765529392, "g_traj_mean": 1.2046611309051514}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 57685, 3842, 30635, 84288, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 31166, 697, 30635, 25, 88594, 323, 37867, 279, 25298, 722, 15955, 13617, 315, 279, 4361, 30635, 45812, 11, 9380, 34439, 279, 49950, 315, 279, 3842, 84288, 315, 30635, 13, 12091, 264, 17232, 21430, 11, 3931, 220, 16, 14, 19, 311, 264, 220, 16, 14, 17, 17122, 504, 279, 1909, 315, 84288, 11, 45966, 279, 3842, 84288, 315, 30635, 382, 17, 13, 4968, 19963, 697, 23387, 25, 4968, 19963, 697, 23387, 311, 220, 19, 15, 15, 58472, 320, 17, 15, 20, 11616, 356, 3593, 18, 13, 40580, 279, 30635, 25, 10771, 279, 30635, 14629, 304, 264, 27815, 7215, 11, 3931, 3108, 705, 13, 362, 54304, 258, 7215, 4278, 2244, 369, 419, 11, 438, 432, 13598, 279, 30635, 53220, 504, 20097, 2163, 382, 19, 13, 14263, 448, 32113, 5590, 25, 2926, 43137, 264, 5625, 92100, 315, 32113, 5590, 916, 1817, 14900, 1968, 11, 1667, 697, 19225, 311, 10273, 279, 32113, 5590, 916, 678, 279, 3931, 11, 14900, 30635, 84288, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Season with olive oil: Drizzle a couple teaspoons of olive oil over each exposed head, using your fingers to rub the olive oil over all the cut, exposed garlic cloves.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.38164610254428, "g_worst_claim": 0.150594433148702, "g_cont