outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate.\n2. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined.\n3. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture.\n4. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes.\n5. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4654767550578733, "g_worst_claim": 0.5909162759780884, "g_content": 2.1379058837890623, "g_traj_mean": 1.6018716096878052}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16, 8, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 33404, 5590, 279, 85354, 13, 220, 17, 8, 758, 264, 19212, 11, 6514, 3786, 279, 51514, 12021, 11, 3691, 24353, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 37327, 16723, 11, 25298, 40454, 11, 73188, 12570, 34448, 19187, 11, 323, 16205, 17172, 287, 3080, 26364, 10856, 13, 220, 18, 8, 57368, 325, 35067, 90078, 11, 323, 84847, 279, 14401, 90078, 389, 2176, 11067, 448, 279, 41686, 20980, 13, 220, 19, 8, 3085, 697, 6078, 11, 6245, 279, 41686, 10273, 1119, 279, 13041, 26, 2138, 311, 2498, 369, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 13, 220, 20, 8, 49848, 279, 90078, 916, 24614, 8628, 3080, 902, 5021, 18217, 4766, 11, 911, 220, 16, 17, 4420, 817, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "1) Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. 2) In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. 3) Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. 4) With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. 5) Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.404781965813387, "g_worst_claim": 0.5139609064374652, "g_content": 2.121565246582031, "g_traj_mean": 1.549055576324463}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [4703, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 33404, 5590, 279, 85354, 13, 57368, 325, 35067, 90078, 11, 323, 84847, 279, 14401, 90078, 389, 2176, 11067, 448, 279, 41686, 20980, 13, 3085, 697, 6078, 11, 6245, 279, 41686, 10273, 1119, 279, 13041, 26, 2138, 311, 2498, 369, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 13, 49848, 279, 90078, 916, 24614, 8628, 3080, 902, 5021, 18217, 4766, 11, 911, 220, 16, 17, 4420, 817, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6113462068458908, "g_worst_claim": 0.7296784718831381, "g_content": 2.1627721013249577, "g_traj_mean": 1.816252589225769}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 86.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "252", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to grill pork chops according to Allrecipes.com:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. (Passage 1)\n2. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. (Passage 1)\n3. For Oven-Fried Pork Chops, use stuffing mix for the breading. The pork chops come out tender and juicy. This recipe takes 30 minutes to prepare and 10 minutes to prep. (Passage 2)\n4. To grill pork chops over indirect heat, rinse the chops and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. Massage the spice rub into the meat for 10 minutes before grilling. Grill the chops until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side. (Passage 3)\n\nTherefore, to grill pork chops according to Allrecipes.com, you should preheat the grill, season the pork chops with a spice mixture, and grill them over indirect heat until they are cooked through.", "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate.\n2. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined.\n3. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture.\n4. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes.\n5. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate.\n2. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined.\n3. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture.\n4. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes.\n5. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "cot": "[\"To grill pork chops, preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.\", \"1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate.\\n2. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined.\\n3. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture.\\n4. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes.\\n5. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.\", \"Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.\", \"Answer: Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.\"]", "time_sec": 19.825, "generation_time_seconds": 19.017, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8013, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 39058, 35067, 90078, 11, 855, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 33404, 5590, 279, 85354, 13, 758, 264, 19212, 11, 6514, 3786, 279, 51514, 12021, 11, 3691, 24353, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 37327, 16723, 11, 25298, 40454, 11, 73188, 12570, 34448, 19187, 11, 323, 16205, 17172, 287, 3080, 26364, 10856, 13, 57368, 325, 35067, 90078, 11, 323, 84847, 279, 14401, 90078, 389, 2176, 11067, 448, 279, 41686, 20980, 13, 3085, 697, 6078, 11, 6245, 279, 41686, 10273, 1119, 279, 13041, 26, 2138, 311, 2498, 369, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 13, 49848, 279, 90078, 916, 24614, 8628, 3080, 902, 5021, 18217, 4766, 11, 911, 220, 16, 17, 4420, 817, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "To grill pork chops, preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4911446394539964, "g_worst_claim": 0.45020389556884766, "g_content": 2.0269753028606545, "g_traj_mean": 1.6740820407867432}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 