13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 49574, 11, 498, 1231, 1366, 311, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 1052, 1083, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 11, 2238, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 609, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 13, 151645], "pred": "To clean the dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, you may want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained & a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0021193791819747, "g_worst_claim": 0.39234081904093426, "g_content": 2.5072956914487095, "g_traj_mean": 1.9585617780685425}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 4240, 279, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 26, 279, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 1405, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 748, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 22, 13, 5976, 15826, 279, 80207, 11, 498, 1231, 1083, 1366, 311, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 1052, 1083, 624, 23, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 11, 2238, 624, 24, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 11, 323, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 624, 16, 15, 13, 1084, 686, 1083, 1492, 697, 46622, 1598, 438, 29720, 438, 432, 646, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn’t fastened or sealed to the home’s exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\n7. While cleaning the vents, you may also want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also.\n8. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too.\n9. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning.\n10. It will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.1120616899519087, "g_worst_claim": 0.4196430842081706, "g_content": 2.3367378384459254, "g_traj_mean": 1.8732937574386597}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. It helps to increase the efficiency of oxygen getting into the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. It increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. It helps to absorb more nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, by locking with coenzyme Q10.\n4. It helps to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. It reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. It helps to increase the efficiency of oxygen getting into the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. It increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. It helps to absorb more nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, by locking with coenzyme Q10.\n4. It helps to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. It reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. It helps to increase the efficiency of oxygen getting into the blood with the same amount of work.\\n2. It increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. It helps to absorb more nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, by locking with coenzyme Q10.\\n4. It helps to relieve muscular aches and pains.\\n5. It reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder, according to the passages, include:\\n\\n1. **Increased Oxygen Efficiency**: MSM benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. **Energy Boost**: It helps increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, which facilitates nutrient absorption and utilization.\\n3. **Nutrient Absorption**: MSM powder helps our bodies absorb more nutrients, particularly vitamins and minerals, by working with co-enzyme Q10.\\n4. **Muscle Relief**: It helps relieve muscular aches and pains.\\n5. **Reduced Inflammation**: By reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, MSM powder assists in decreasing the water pressure inside cells that causes swelling.\\n\\nThese benefits highlight how MSM powder supports various bodily functions and aids in recovery and overall health.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder include: helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), and helping to relieve muscular aches and pains by reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\"]", "time_sec": 18.002, "generation_time_seconds": 17.3921, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6024, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0126209029639015, "g_worst_claim": 1.494119644165039, "g_content": 2.4373303463584497, "g_traj_mean": 1.748687744140625}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 1084, 8609, 311, 5263, 279, 15024, 315, 23552, 3709, 1119, 279, 6543, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 1084, 12703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 1084, 8609, 311, 34306, 803, 36393, 11, 1741, 438, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 553, 37855, 448, 1062, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 624, 19, 13, 1084, 8609, 311, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 1084, 25271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1075, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. It helps to increase the efficiency of oxygen getting into the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. It increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. It helps to absorb more nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, by locking with coenzyme Q10.\n4. It helps to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. It reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8735908466414113, "g_worst_claim": 0.6105991999308268, "g_content": 2.6006147211248223, "g_traj_mean": 1.7185436487197876}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 11, 4092, 311, 279, 46769, 11, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 96841, 86569, 66567, 95518, 67491, 7567, 279, 2487, 553, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 32675, 33407, 95518, 1084, 8609, 5263, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 892, 72533, 49023, 43125, 323, 49449, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 78470, 12986, 22080, 65081, 95518, 67491, 16723, 8609, 1039, 12866, 34306, 803, 36393, 11, 7945, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 553, 3238, 448, 1062, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 624, 19, 13, 3070, 61598, 9148, 52395, 95518, 1084, 8609, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3070, 16609, 291, 758, 44764, 367, 95518, 3216, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 67491, 16723, 28844, 304, 43549, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 7761, 429, 11137, 54207, 382, 9485, 7567, 11167, 1246, 67491, 16723, 11554, 5257, 47031, 5746, 323, 51697, 304, 13351, 323, 8084, 2820, 13, 151645], "pred": "These benefits highlight how MSM powder supports various bodily functions and aids in recovery and overall health.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3129712153464002, "g_worst_claim": 0.25518208079867893, "g_content": 2.003083662553267, "g_traj_mean": 1.3330925703048706}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 25, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 45827, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 701, 323, 10476, 311, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 553, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include: helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), and helping to relieve muscular aches and pains by reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.824838045937002, "g_worst_claim": 1.5165720719557543, "g_content": 2.6853411197662354, "g_traj_mean": 1.826361060142517}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "261", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels, helping the body absorb more nutrients, and relieving muscular aches and pains. Additionally, it helps reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels, helping the body absorb more nutrients, and relieving muscular aches and pains. Additionally, it helps reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. **Increased Oxygen Efficiency**: MSM helps the body get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, as mentioned in passage 1.\\n\\n2. **Increased Energy**: MSM powder helps increase energy levels, as stated in passage 1. It does this by making cell walls more permeable, which allows for better nutrient absorption.\\n\\n3. **Improved Nutrient Absorption**: MSM powder aids in absorbing more nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, as mentioned in passage 2. It enhances the absorption of Coenzyme Q10.\\n\\n4. **Relief of Muscular Aches and Pains**: MSM powder helps relieve muscular aches and pains, as stated in passage 3.\\n\\n5. **Reduction of Inflammation**: MSM powder reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, as mentioned in passage 3. It does this by balancing the water pressure inside and outside of cells, which can prevent or reduce swelling and inflammation.\\n\\nAnswer: The benefits of MSM powder include increased oxygen efficiency, increased energy, improved nutrient absorption, relief of muscular aches and pains, and reduction of inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels, helping the body absorb more nutrients, and relieving muscular aches and pains. Additionally, it helps reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder as detailed in the passage include:\\n\\n1. Increasing energy levels: This is achieved by making the cell walls more permeable, allowing for better nutrient absorption and utilization.\\n2. Enhancing oxygen absorption: By improving the efficiency of getting oxygen into the blood with the same amount of work.\\n3. Absorbing more nutrients: Specifically vitamins and minerals, as Co-enzyme Q10 needs MSM (sulfur) to lock in and fully utilize these nutrients.\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains: By reducing inflammation within the body, including due to injuries or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n5. Reducing inflammation: By balancing the water pressure inside and outside cells, preventing inflammation and swelling.\\n\\nThese benefits are supported by the passage and do not require any additional knowledge.\"]", "time_sec": 21.455, "generation_time_seconds": 20.8725, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5756, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.030709045419472, "g_worst_claim": 1.6110907334547777, "g_content": 2.3857188977693258, "g_traj_mean": 1.7287356853485107}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 96841, 86569, 66567, 95518, 67491, 8609, 279, 2487, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 21085, 220, 16, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 96841, 12354, 95518, 67491, 16723, 8609, 5263, 4802, 5866, 11, 438, 10982, 304, 21085, 220, 16, 13, 1084, 1558, 419, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 892, 6147, 369, 2664, 49023, 43125, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 81110, 18372, 12986, 22080, 65081, 95518, 67491, 16723, 51697, 304, 69175, 803, 36393, 11, 1741, 438, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 21085, 220, 17, 13, 1084, 56824, 279, 43125, 315, 3539, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 6740, 4738, 315, 5331, 21366, 362, 8528, 323, 393, 1735, 95518, 67491, 16723, 8609, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 11, 438, 10982, 304, 21085, 220, 18, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 6033, 2654, 315, 758, 44764, 367, 95518, 67491, 16723, 25271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 21085, 220, 18, 13, 1084, 1558, 419, 553, 43363, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 315, 7761, 11, 892, 646, 5358, 476, 7949, 54207, 323, 36040, 382, 16141, 25, 576, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 7172, 23552, 15024, 11, 7172, 4802, 11, 12944, 49023, 43125, 11, 15957, 315, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 11, 323, 13951, 315, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include increased oxygen efficiency, increased energy, improved nutrient absorption, relief of muscular aches and pains, and reduction of inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7391028797018496, "g_worst_claim": -0.17581862211227417, "g_content": 1.304086430867513, "g_traj_mean": 0.8856621384620667}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 7703, 4802, 5866, 11, 10476, 279, 2487, 34306, 803, 36393, 11, 323, 58544, 4405, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 13, 22406, 11, 432, 8609, 7949, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels, helping the body absorb more nutrients, and relieving muscular aches and pains. Additionally, it helps reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6099906301687634, "g_worst_claim": 1.336297247144911, "g_content": 2.5308515375310723, "g_traj_mean": 1.634955883026123}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 438, 11682, 304, 279, 21085, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 25, 1096, 374, 16994, 553, 3259, 279, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 10693, 369, 2664, 49023, 43125, 323, 49449, 624, 17, 13, 28657, 8974, 23552, 43125, 25, 3216, 18392, 279, 15024, 315, 3709, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 18, 13, 22080, 269, 7132, 803, 36393, 25, 44763, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 438, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 3880, 67491, 320, 82, 14308, 324, 8, 311, 5296, 304, 323, 7225, 28066, 1493, 36393, 624, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 25, 3216, 17719, 36040, 2878, 279, 2487, 11, 2670, 4152, 311, 14970, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 25, 3216, 43363, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 11, 26160, 36040, 323, 54207, 382, 9485, 7567, 525, 7248, 553, 279, 21085, 323, 653, 537, 1373, 894, 5107, 6540, 13, 151645], "pred": "These benefits are supported by the passage and do not require any additional knowledge.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4346487815996551, "g_worst_claim": 0.1496135711669922, "g_content": 2.1773667946839943, "g_traj_mean": 1.398145079612732}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 68.97, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels by making the cell walls more permeable, helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and relieving muscular aches and pains.\", \"MSM powder benefits the body in several ways. It helps to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making the cell walls more permeable. It also helps the body absorb more nutrients, particularly vitamins and minerals, as it locks with coenzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains, reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside the cell.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder as mentioned in the passages include:\\n- Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\\n- Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n- Assists in absorbing more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n- Helps relieve muscular aches and pains.\\n- Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.\"]", "time_sec": 14.892, "generation_time_seconds": 14.1935, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6922, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9773890001578789, "g_worst_claim": 1.3587621053059895, "g_content": 2.4340248107910156, "g_traj_mean": 1.7195476293563843}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 7703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 279, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 11, 85287, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 1741, 438, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 323, 58544, 4405, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include increasing energy levels by making the cell walls more permeable, helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and relieving muscular aches and pains.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.39759402539995, "g_worst_claim": 0.9860658645629883, "g_content": 2.2447757720947266, "g_traj_mean": 1.3839503526687622}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [4826, 44, 16723, 7567, 279, 2487, 304, 3807, 5510, 13, 1084, 8609, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 279, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 13, 1084, 1083, 8609, 279, 2487, 34306, 803, 36393, 11, 7945, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 438, 432, 31676, 448, 1062, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 13, 22406, 11, 67491, 16723, 646, 1492, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 11, 7949, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 553, 43363, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 279, 2779, 13, 151645], "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body in several ways. It helps to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making the cell walls more permeable. It also helps the body absorb more nutrients, particularly vitamins and minerals, as it locks with coenzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains, reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside the cell.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7992814178717091, "g_worst_claim": 0.8697400622897677, "g_content": 2.701175446205951, "g_traj_mean": 1.8334134817123413}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 438, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 2924, 510, 12, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 624, 12, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 12, 2688, 1671, 304, 69175, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 12, 88516, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 12, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder as mentioned in the passages include:\n- Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\n- Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n- Assists in absorbing more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n- Helps relieve muscular aches and pains.\n- Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9651466832819209, "g_worst_claim": 0.7055298631841486, "g_content": 2.8131675720214844, "g_traj_mean": 1.8140490055084229}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "265", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "pred": "5. **Reduction in Inflammation**: When the pressure inside a cell is greater than the pressure outside, it leads to inflammation. MSM powder aids in reducing this type of inflammation, contributing to overall health and recovery.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "5. **Reduction in Inflammation**: When the pressure inside a cell is greater than the pressure outside, it leads to inflammation. MSM powder aids in reducing this type of inflammation, contributing to overall health and recovery.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder, as described in the given passages, include:\\n\\n1. **Increase in Energy Levels**: MSM powder helps increase energy by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient utilization of nutrients and oxygen. This leads to a higher efficiency in energy production.\\n\\n2. **Improved Nutrient Absorption**: Coenzyme Q10 works better with MSM in the body, aiding in the absorption of vitamins and minerals more effectively.\\n\\n3. **Relief from Muscular Aches and Pains**: MSM powder is beneficial for relieving muscular discomfort and swelling. It helps reduce inflammation, making it useful for conditions like arthritis and other inflammatory diseases.\\n\\n4. **Enhanced Oxygen Utilization**: By improving the efficiency of oxygen transport in the blood, MSM powder assists in providing more oxygen to various parts of the body.\\n\\n5. **Reduction in Inflammation**: When the pressure inside a cell is greater than the pressure outside, it leads to inflammation. MSM powder aids in reducing this type of inflammation, contributing to overall health and recovery.\", \"Answer: The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in nutrient absorption (vitamins and minerals), and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"The benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n- Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n- Increases energy by making the cell walls more permeable.\\n- Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n- Benefits the body by reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n- Helps relieve muscular aches and pains.\"]", "time_sec": 18.98, "generation_time_seconds": 18.3119, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6628, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20