ide a cell is greater than the pressure outside, it leads to inflammation. MSM powder aids in reducing this type of inflammation, contributing to overall health and recovery.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7084871204167278, "g_worst_claim": 0.12916191724630502, "g_content": 1.182680840585746, "g_traj_mean": 0.7327316403388977}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 576, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 85287, 304, 49023, 43125, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 701, 323, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in nutrient absorption (vitamins and minerals), and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9751806789900597, "g_worst_claim": 1.7237682342529297, "g_content": 2.7099813645885837, "g_traj_mean": 1.9962031841278076}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 12, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 12, 67048, 4802, 553, 3259, 279, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 12, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 12, 38095, 279, 2487, 553, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 12, 88516, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 13, 151645], "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n- Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n- Increases energy by making the cell walls more permeable.\n- Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n- Benefits the body by reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n- Helps relieve muscular aches and pains.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0446721898987636, "g_worst_claim": 1.5098221518776633, "g_content": 2.8720485142299106, "g_traj_mean": 2.0239555835723877}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.97, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "266", "question": "introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer", "gt": "Visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their store and influence their buying behavior. It involves the presentation of the store and its merchandise in a way that aligns with the retailer's goals and marketing strategy. The visual merchandiser's role is crucial as they not only help bring customers to the store but also influence their purchasing decisions, akin to \"making the horse drink\" as per G. Surrendar's analogy. Particularly, visual merchandising related to shop windows has been found to significantly impact consumer buying behavior, with variations observed based on gender and the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.", "pred": "The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. This means that visual merchandising plays a significant role in attracting customers to the store. For example, Surrendar (2001) mentioned that marketing brings the horse to the water but visual merchandising makes the horse drink. This implies that visual merchandising is crucial in engaging consumers and influencing their buying behavior. The main objective of the paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to shop windows, on consumer buying behavior according to sex and to the store attributes most valued by consumers.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. This means that visual merchandising plays a significant role in attracting customers to the store. For example, Surrendar (2001) mentioned that marketing brings the horse to the water but visual merchandising makes the horse drink. This implies that visual merchandising is crucial in engaging consumers and influencing their buying behavior. The main objective of the paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to shop windows, on consumer buying behavior according to sex and to the store attributes most valued by consumers.", "cot": "[\"Introduction to Visual Merchandising: The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. Earlier retailers used advertising as the only media to attract customers to the store. The main objective of this paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to the shop windows, on consumer buying behaviour according to the sex, and to the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centres.\", \"Introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer: Visual merchandisers play a crucial role in retail strategy and company goals by projecting them in the store. Unlike earlier times when advertising was the only medium to attract customers, visual merchandising enhances and supports marketing efforts. Visual merchandising is often described as making the \\\"horse drink\\\" after marketing has brought the \\\"horse to the water,\\\" indicating its effectiveness in converting marketing efforts into tangible customer interest and action. The main objective of a study discussed in one of the passages is to examine the influence of visual merchandising, particularly regarding shop windows, on consumer buying behavior based on gender and the attributes consumers value most in shopping centers. This highlights the importance of visual merchandising in shaping consumer perception and decision-making processes in retail environments.\", \"The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. This means that visual merchandising plays a significant role in attracting customers to the store. For example, Surrendar (2001) mentioned that marketing brings the horse to the water but visual merchandising makes the horse drink. This implies that visual merchandising is crucial in engaging consumers and influencing their buying behavior. The main objective of the paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to shop windows, on consumer buying behavior according to sex and to the store attributes most valued by consumers.\", \"Introduction to Visual Merchandising: The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. Earlier retailers used advertising as the only media to attract customers to the store.\\n\\nVisual merchandising makes the horse drink - It tries to explain how Visual merchandising influences consumer buying behaviour according to the sex, and to the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centres.\"]", "time_sec": 20.895, "generation_time_seconds": 20.17, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7171, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [37155, 311, 20185, 65025, 437, 3791, 25, 576, 9124, 21733, 437, 12059, 374, 7853, 315, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 279, 2813, 8845, 315, 279, 36791, 304, 1973, 311, 2390, 279, 1852, 304, 279, 3553, 13, 46893, 29182, 1483, 12876, 438, 279, 1172, 3687, 311, 9320, 6310, 311, 279, 3553, 13, 576, 1887, 16538, 315, 419, 5567, 374, 311, 3920, 279, 10173, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11, 5310, 279, 825, 5435, 311, 279, 8061, 11030, 11, 389, 11502, 11833, 16999, 4092, 311, 279, 1839, 11, 323, 311, 279, 3553, 8201, 1429, 32547, 553, 13417, 304, 11919, 35182, 13, 151645], "pred": "Introduction to Visual Merchandising: The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. Earlier retailers used advertising as the only media to attract customers to the store. The main objective of this paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to the shop windows, on consumer buying behaviour according to the sex, and to the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centres.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.8311080418209795, "g_worst_claim": 2.0061890097225414, "g_content": 4.05937025282118, "g_traj_mean": 2.6709682941436768}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [37155, 311, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 323, 12687, 311, 279, 11502, 25, 20185, 21733, 437, 61280, 1486, 264, 16587, 3476, 304, 10806, 8282, 323, 2813, 8845, 553, 81282, 1105, 304, 279, 3553, 13, 26048, 6788, 3039, 979, 12876, 572, 279, 1172, 11051, 311, 9320, 6310, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 56824, 323, 11554, 8493, 8869, 13, 20185, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 3545, 7481, 438, 3259, 279, 330, 59675, 7027, 1, 1283, 8493, 702, 7117, 279, 330, 59675, 311, 279, 3015, 1335, 18860, 1181, 26279, 304, 33437, 8493, 8869, 1119, 49301, 6002, 2734, 323, 1917, 13, 576, 1887, 16538, 315, 264, 3920, 14078, 304, 825, 315, 279, 46769, 374, 311, 20961, 279, 10173, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11, 7945, 8826, 8061, 11030, 11, 389, 11502, 11833, 7709, 3118, 389, 9825, 323, 279, 8201, 13417, 897, 1429, 304, 11919, 18652, 13, 1096, 21314, 279, 12650, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 304, 45520, 11502, 20431, 323, 5480, 27746, 11364, 304, 10806, 21737, 13, 151645], "pred": "Introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer: Visual merchandisers play a crucial role in retail strategy and company goals by projecting them in the store. Unlike earlier times when advertising was the only medium to attract customers, visual merchandising enhances and supports marketing efforts. Visual merchandising is often described as making the \"horse drink\" after marketing has brought the \"horse to the water,\" indicating its effectiveness in converting marketing efforts into tangible customer interest and action. The main objective of a study discussed in one of the passages is to examine the influence of visual merchandising, particularly regarding shop windows, on consumer buying behavior based on gender and the attributes consumers value most in shopping centers. This highlights the importance of visual merchandising in shaping consumer perception and decision-making processes in retail environments.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.598070695801113, "g_worst_claim": 0.18443926175435385, "g_content": 2.2111943562825522, "g_traj_mean": 1.5022263526916504}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 9124, 21733, 437, 12059, 374, 7853, 315, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 279, 2813, 8845, 315, 279, 36791, 304, 1973, 311, 2390, 279, 1852, 304, 279, 3553, 13, 1096, 3363, 429, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11088, 264, 5089, 3476, 304, 50547, 6310, 311, 279, 3553, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 54066, 303, 277, 320, 17, 15, 15, 16, 8, 9733, 429, 8493, 12434, 279, 15223, 311, 279, 3015, 714, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 3643, 279, 15223, 7027, 13, 1096, 23945, 429, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 16587, 304, 22570, 13417, 323, 65600, 862, 11833, 7709, 13, 576, 1887, 16538, 315, 279, 5567, 374, 311, 3920, 279, 10173, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11, 5310, 279, 825, 5435, 311, 8061, 11030, 11, 389, 11502, 11833, 7709, 4092, 311, 1839, 323, 311, 279, 3553, 8201, 1429, 32547, 553, 13417, 13, 151645], "pred": "The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. This means that visual merchandising plays a significant role in attracting customers to the store. For example, Surrendar (2001) mentioned that marketing brings the horse to the water but visual merchandising makes the horse drink. This implies that visual merchandising is crucial in engaging consumers and influencing their buying behavior. The main objective of the paper is to study the influence of visual merchandising, especially the one related to shop windows, on consumer buying behavior according to sex and to the store attributes most valued by consumers.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0807443836680792, "g_worst_claim": 0.7252914110819498, "g_content": 3.237185765826513, "g_traj_mean": 2.052342414855957}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [37155, 311, 20185, 65025, 437, 3791, 25, 576, 9124, 21733, 437, 12059, 374, 7853, 315, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 279, 2813, 8845, 315, 279, 36791, 304, 1973, 311, 2390, 279, 1852, 304, 279, 3553, 13, 46893, 29182, 1483, 12876, 438, 279, 1172, 3687, 311, 9320, 6310, 311, 279, 3553, 382, 9594, 21733, 437, 3791, 3643, 279, 15223, 7027, 481, 1084, 16297, 311, 10339, 1246, 20185, 21733, 437, 3791, 33353, 11502, 11833, 16999, 4092, 311, 279, 1839, 11, 323, 311, 279, 3553, 8201, 1429, 32547, 553, 13417, 304, 11919, 35182, 13, 151645], "pred": "Introduction to Visual Merchandising: The visual merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and the company goals of the retailer in order to project the same in the store. Earlier retailers used advertising as the only media to attract customers to the store.\n\nVisual merchandising makes the horse drink - It tries to explain how Visual merchandising influences consumer buying behaviour according to the sex, and to the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centres.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 3.1967908095770072, "g_worst_claim": 2.4019018990652903, "g_content": 4.443333470544149, "g_traj_mean": 2.9734299182891846}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 43.17, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "271", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.", "cot": "[\"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, which are caused by hormonal changes; dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and blood pressure drop; a missed period, which is a common indicator; bloating; spotting; and cramping.\", \"Answer: The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n- Mood swings due to hormonal changes in the body.\\n- Dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and a drop in blood pressure.\\n- A missed period.\\n- Bloating.\\n- Spotting.\\n- Cramping.\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Bloating\\n2. Spotting\\n3. Cramping\"]", "time_sec": 12.514, "generation_time_seconds": 11.9839, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5226, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 60780, 11, 323, 62471, 13, 93567, 56790, 646, 387, 8881, 553, 279, 17726, 315, 43215, 304, 279, 2487, 2337, 4124, 19636, 11, 3259, 264, 5220, 56799, 14269, 323, 582, 70548, 13, 422, 96645, 374, 264, 1102, 315, 19636, 14381, 6543, 29980, 311, 18840, 349, 323, 6543, 7262, 311, 5943, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 525, 4185, 11, 448, 2163, 4279, 315, 678, 20280, 3198, 24084, 60780, 323, 62471, 11, 323, 2163, 220, 18, 304, 220, 16, 15, 3198, 24084, 60780, 2041, 62471, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3922330561806935, "g_worst_claim": 0.5556497573852539, "g_content": 1.9024633290816326, "g_traj_mean": 1.3677953481674194}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 11, 892, 525, 8881, 553, 73118, 4344, 26, 294, 96645, 4152, 311, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 6543, 7262, 5943, 26, 264, 13628, 4168, 11, 892, 374, 264, 4185, 20438, 26, 14211, 1095, 26, 89219, 26, 323, 1560, 30457, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, which are caused by hormonal changes; dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and blood pressure drop; a missed period, which is a common indicator; bloating; spotting; and cramping.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1980763059673887, "g_worst_claim": 0.34756048520406085, "g_content": 1.8676395416259766, "g_traj_mean": 1.3841396570205688}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 576, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 12, 93567, 56790, 4152, 311, 73118, 4344, 304, 279, 2487, 624, 12, 422, 96645, 8881, 553, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 264, 5943, 304, 6543, 7262, 624, 12, 362, 13628, 4168, 624, 12, 425, 28493, 624, 12, 23297, 1280, 624, 12, 4553, 30457, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2313343610082355, "g_worst_claim": 0.7870773315429688, "g_content": 1.7581110000610352, "g_traj_mean": 1.193346381187439}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 17, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 18, 13, 4553, 30457, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Bloating\n2. Spotting\n3. Cramping", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9637390375137329, "g_worst_claim": 0.9637390375137329, "g_content": 1.4018661325628108, "g_traj_mean": 1.0388273000717163}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.34, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy often include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms can be easily overlooked, but they are common indicators that a woman may be pregnant. Additionally, many women may experience mood swings and feel unusually emotional and weepy, due to the hormones in their body. Some may also experience dizziness, as pregnancy can cause blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy often include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms can be easily overlooked, but they are common indicators that a woman may be pregnant. Additionally, many women may experience mood swings and feel unusually emotional and weepy, due to the hormones in their body. Some may also experience dizziness, as pregnancy can cause blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop.", "cot": "[\"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting are also common symptoms. Mood swings are caused by hormones, and dizziness is due to changes in blood vessels and blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting can start around six weeks after the last period.\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy often include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms can be easily overlooked, but they are common indicators that a woman may be pregnant. Additionally, many women may experience mood swings and feel unusually emotional and weepy, due to the hormones in their body. Some may also experience dizziness, as pregnancy can cause blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop.\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy, as mentioned in the provided passages, include mood swings, dizziness, and bloating. Mood swings can be attributed to the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, causing unusual emotional and weeping. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Bloating is also a common symptom, which many women notice as an early sign of pregnancy.\"]", "time_sec": 16.924, "generation_time_seconds": 16.1021, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8176, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 60780, 11, 323, 62471, 13, 93567, 56790, 646, 387, 8881, 553, 279, 17726, 315, 43215, 304, 279, 2487, 2337, 4124, 19636, 11, 3259, 264, 5220, 56799, 14269, 323, 582, 70548, 13, 422, 96645, 374, 264, 1102, 315, 19636, 14381, 6543, 29980, 311, 18840, 349, 323, 6543, 7262, 311, 5943, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 525, 4185, 11, 448, 2163, 4279, 315, 678, 20280, 3198, 24084, 60780, 323, 62471, 11, 323, 2163, 220, 18, 304, 220, 16, 15, 3198, 24084, 60780, 2041, 62471, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting. Mood swings can be caused by the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, making a woman unusually emotional and weepy. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Nausea and vomiting are common, with around half of all pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.379222582645453, "g_worst_claim": 0.57131028175354, "g_content": 1.8802558743223852, "g_traj_mean": 1.3533247709274292}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 646, 2924, 264, 13628, 4168, 11, 14211, 1095, 11, 89219, 11, 323, 1560, 30457, 13, 93567, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 60780, 11, 323, 62471, 525, 1083, 4185, 13495, 13, 93567, 56790, 525, 8881, 553, 43215, 11, 323, 294, 96645, 374, 4152, 311, 4344, 304, 6543, 29980, 323, 6543, 7262, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 646, 1191, 2163, 4743, 5555, 1283, 279, 1537, 4168, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting are also common symptoms. Mood swings are caused by hormones, and dizziness is due to changes in blood vessels and blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting can start around six weeks after the last period.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1634668424743728, "g_worst_claim": 0.597550596509661, "g_content": 1.739664863137638, "g_traj_mean": 1.071108102798462}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 3545, 2924, 264, 13628, 4168, 11, 14211, 1095, 11, 89219, 11, 323, 1560, 30457, 13, 4220, 13495, 646, 387, 6707, 44436, 11, 714, 807, 525, 4185, 33724, 429, 264, 5220, 1231, 387, 20280, 13, 22406, 11, 1657, 3198, 1231, 3139, 19671, 56790, 323, 2666, 56799, 14269, 323, 582, 70548, 11, 4152, 311, 279, 43215, 304, 862, 2487, 13, 4329, 1231, 1083, 3139, 294, 96645, 11, 438, 19636, 646, 5240, 6543, 29980, 311, 18840, 349, 323, 6543, 7262, 311, 5943, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy often include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms can be easily overlooked, but they are common indicators that a woman may be pregnant. Additionally, many women may experience mood swings and feel unusually emotional and weepy, due to the hormones in their body. Some may also experience dizziness, as pregnancy can cause blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9502987736565435, "g_worst_claim": 0.1633911430835724, "g_content": 1.4004402160644531, "g_traj_mean": 1.0361729860305786}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 2924, 19671, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 323, 14211, 1095, 13, 93567, 56790, 646, 387, 29606, 311, 279, 17726, 315, 43215, 304, 279, 2487, 2337, 4124, 19636, 11, 14381, 18511, 14269, 323, 582, 54223, 13, 422, 96645, 374, 264, 1102, 315, 19636, 14381, 6543, 29980, 311, 18840, 349, 323, 6543, 7262, 311, 5943, 13, 425, 28493, 374, 1083, 264, 4185, 48548, 11, 892, 1657, 3198, 5293, 438, 458, 4124, 1841, 315, 19636, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy, as mentioned in the provided passages, include mood swings, dizziness, and bloating. Mood swings can be attributed to the flood of hormones in the body during early pregnancy, causing unusual emotional and weeping. Dizziness is a result of pregnancy causing blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Bloating is also a common symptom, which many women notice as an early sign of pregnancy.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2051189208347735, "g_worst_claim": -0.009722337126731873, "g_content": 1.568898642935404, "g_traj_mean": 1.1595090627670288}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.85, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "276", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition characterized by significant bone density loss, resulting in weakened bones and increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden and severe back pain, loss of height over time, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, fractures, particularly in the spine or hips, are likely to occur.", "pred": "Without proper treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is at a higher risk of developing multiple fractures, especially in the spine and hips, which are crucial for supporting the body's weight.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Without proper treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is at a higher risk of developing multiple fractures, especially in the spine and hips, which are crucial for supporting the body's weight.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, leading to symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones.\", \"Severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, especially in the spine, hips, and wrists.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages, severe osteoporosis is characterized by significant bone density loss, leading to a higher risk of fractures. Symptoms of severe osteoporosis may include:\\n\\n1. **Back Pain**: This pain can be sudden and severe, especially when standing or walking, and may improve when lying down.\\n2. **Loss of Height Over Time**: Osteoporosis can cause a person's height to decrease over time, often accompanied by a stooped posture.\\n3. **Fractures**: Severe osteoporosis increases the likelihood of fractures, particularly in the spine, wrists, and hips. Fractures of the spine can occur even without a fall or injury, as the bones become so weak they start to compress under their own weight.\\n\\nWithout proper treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is at a higher risk of developing multiple fractures, especially in the spine and hips, which are crucial for supporting the body's weight.\"]", "time_sec": 18.087, "generation_time_seconds": 17.228, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8496, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5624098463551506, "g_worst_claim": 0.8262878656387329, "g_content": 2.1596810234917534, "g_traj_mean": 1.5143780708312988}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 19257, 311, 264, 2971, 1380, 279, 24854, 614, 1012, 57664, 553, 17240, 17457, 4709, 11, 6388, 311, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, leading to symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3919186935796364, "g_worst_claim": 1.0440245355878557, "g_content": 1.6463392506475034, "g_traj_mean": 1.2604873180389404}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 2990, 311, 77232, 11, 5310, 304, 279, 34676, 11, 42423, 11, 323, 85778, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, especially in the spine, hips, and wrists.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.37088553905487065, "g_worst_claim": -0.37383580207824707, "g_content": 0.9491046071052551, "g_traj_mean": 0.4404730200767517}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 5089, 17240, 17457, 4709, 11, 6388, 311, 264, 5080, 5214, 315, 77232, 13, 76317, 315, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 1231, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 3707, 34467, 95518, 1096, 6646, 646, 387, 10968, 323, 15386, 11, 5310, 979, 11259, 476, 11435, 11, 323, 1231, 7269, 979, 20446, 1495, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 39838, 315, 21432, 6065, 4120, 95518, 506, 5342, 88666, 10704, 646, 5240, 264, 1697, 594, 2608, 311, 18472, 916, 882, 11, 3545, 23943, 553, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 22560, 531, 1413, 95518, 1345, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 12703, 279, 28636, 315, 77232, 11, 7945, 304, 279, 34676, 11, 85778, 11, 323, 42423, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 12170, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 3635, 773, 7469, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 1212, 862, 1828, 4680, 382, 26040, 6169, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 518, 264, 5080, 5214, 315, 11220, 5248, 77232, 11, 5310, 304, 279, 34676, 323, 42423, 11, 892, 525, 16587, 369, 12613, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 13, 151645], "pred": "Without proper treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is at a higher risk of developing multiple fractures, especially in the spine and hips, which are crucial for supporting the body's weight.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7783757748291306, "g_worst_claim": -0.26170971989631653, "g_content": 1.0314310650492824, "g_traj_mean": 0.7134916186332703}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.07, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "278", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where the bones have been significantly weakened to the point of causing symptoms such as back pain, loss of height, and fractures. According to passage 3, osteoporosis typically has no symptoms until significant bone damage has occurred, making it a \"silent disease\" until it reaches this advanced stage. Passage 2 also highlights that compression fractures of the spine are a common cause of osteoporosis pain, which can be severe and debilitating. Therefore, severe osteoporosis is characterized by a high risk of fractures, particularly in the spine and hips, as well as persistent back pain and loss of height.", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time which results in a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without appropriate treatment, an individual with severe osteoporosis is at a high risk of experiencing fractures, commonly in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The strength of the bones can become so weak that they begin to compress, even without a fall or injury.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time which results in a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without appropriate treatment, an individual with severe osteoporosis is at a high risk of experiencing fractures, commonly in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The strength of the bones can become so weak that they begin to compress, even without a fall or injury.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is a condition that results in a dramatic decrease in bone density, leading to an increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden, severe back pain that worsens when standing or walking, and the loss of height over time with a stooped posture. Fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones are also common. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The bones of the spine can become so weak that they start to compress, even without an injury.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is a condition that has virtually no symptoms until severe bone damage has already occurred. Once the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, symptoms may include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time which results in a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without appropriate treatment, an individual with severe osteoporosis is at a high risk of experiencing fractures, commonly in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The strength of the bones can become so weak that they begin to compress, even without a fall or injury.\"]", "time_sec": 22.533, "generation_time_seconds": 21.3549, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1686, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6156986831338496, "g_worst_claim": 0.83613121509552, "g_content": 2.2188819037543404, "g_traj_mean": 1.5437915325164795}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 264, 2971, 429, 3059, 304, 264, 21771, 18472, 304, 17240, 17457, 11, 6388, 311, 458, 7172, 5214, 315, 77232, 13, 76317, 1231, 2924, 10968, 11, 15386, 1182, 6