, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition that has virtually no symptoms until severe bone damage has already occurred. Once the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, symptoms may include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.654423329863515, "g_worst_claim": 0.8226743936538696, "g_content": 2.4255438018263433, "g_traj_mean": 1.7107210159301758}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 892, 3059, 304, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 8311, 6380, 11, 458, 3842, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 518, 264, 1550, 5214, 315, 24084, 77232, 11, 16626, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 11, 892, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 11, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 576, 8170, 315, 279, 24854, 646, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 3161, 311, 24611, 11, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time which results in a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without appropriate treatment, an individual with severe osteoporosis is at a high risk of experiencing fractures, commonly in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The strength of the bones can become so weak that they begin to compress, even without a fall or injury.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4090086628761127, "g_worst_claim": 0.5805554389953613, "g_content": 2.195721667745839, "g_traj_mean": 1.2540061473846436}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.8, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "279", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where there is significant bone density loss, leading to symptoms such as sudden and severe back pain, loss of height, and an increased risk of fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, and wrists.", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, or wrists. Without treatment, individuals with severe osteoporosis may experience multiple fractures, including those that occur without a fall or injury, as the bones become extremely fragile.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, or wrists. Without treatment, individuals with severe osteoporosis may experience multiple fractures, including those that occur without a fall or injury, as the bones become extremely fragile.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis can be indicated by symptoms such as sudden and severe back pain, particularly in older women, which may signify a spinal compression fracture. Other symptoms include a loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones, and the risk of fractures occurring even without a fall or injury due to weakened spinal bones.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, or wrists. Without treatment, individuals with severe osteoporosis may experience multiple fractures, including those that occur without a fall or injury, as the bones become extremely fragile.\"]", "time_sec": 17.219, "generation_time_seconds": 16.5986, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6099, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5493306080267066, "g_worst_claim": 0.870509922504425, "g_content": 2.136297607421875, "g_traj_mean": 1.5083343982696533}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 16317, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 10968, 323, 15386, 1182, 6646, 11, 7945, 304, 9014, 3198, 11, 892, 1231, 88422, 264, 49012, 25111, 58804, 13, 6944, 13495, 2924, 264, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 11, 323, 279, 5214, 315, 77232, 30865, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 4152, 311, 57664, 49012, 24854, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can be indicated by symptoms such as sudden and severe back pain, particularly in older women, which may signify a spinal compression fracture. Other symptoms include a loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones, and the risk of fractures occurring even without a fall or injury due to weakened spinal bones.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2987338081238764, "g_worst_claim": 0.8997105280558269, "g_content": 1.8980914384890826, "g_traj_mean": 1.193963646888733}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis