{"id": "299", "question": "how to make hot water heater circulate", "gt": "To make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump can be installed. This pump sends cool water from the pipes back to the water heater through a return line, while simultaneously pulling hot water from the heater to keep it hot. This continuous loop ensures that hot water is always available.", "pred": "A hot water circulation pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line, and a pump circulates this water through the water heater to keep it hot. This ensures that hot water is always available.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "A hot water circulation pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line, and a pump circulates this water through the water heater to keep it hot. This ensures that hot water is always available.", "cot": "[\"To make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump is used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. The pump circulates this water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages:\\n\\nTo make a hot water heater circulate:\\n\\n1. A hot water circulation pump is used to send cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line.\\n2. A pump circulates this cooled water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot.\\n3. This continuous loop of water ensures that hot water is always available.\\n\\nAnswer: A hot water circulation pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line, and a pump circulates this water through the water heater to keep it hot. This ensures that hot water is always available.\", \"A hot water circulation pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.\", \"To make a hot water heater circulate, a pump is used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. A continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.\"]", "time_sec": 14.251, "generation_time_seconds": 13.3897, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8547, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 1281, 264, 4017, 3015, 42238, 4225, 6334, 11, 264, 4017, 3015, 34755, 13834, 374, 1483, 13, 1096, 13834, 21308, 7010, 3015, 304, 279, 31175, 1182, 311, 279, 3015, 42238, 1526, 264, 470, 1555, 13, 576, 13834, 4225, 23156, 419, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 438, 4362, 311, 2506, 432, 4017, 13, 1096, 19259, 6337, 315, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 25351, 429, 4017, 3015, 374, 2677, 2500, 13, 151645], "pred": "To make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump is used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. The pump circulates this water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4820683924980413, "g_worst_claim": 0.9942474365234375, "g_content": 1.5216259203459088, "g_traj_mean": 1.5154032707214355}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 1447, 1249, 1281, 264, 4017, 3015, 42238, 4225, 6334, 1447, 16, 13, 362, 4017, 3015, 34755, 13834, 374, 1483, 311, 3624, 7010, 3015, 304, 279, 31175, 1182, 311, 279, 3015, 42238, 1526, 264, 470, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 362, 13834, 4225, 23156, 419, 64310, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 438, 4362, 311, 2506, 432, 4017, 624, 18, 13, 1096, 19259, 6337, 315, 3015, 253