{"id": "318", "question": "how can i check taxes were filed", "gt": "Based on the given passages, you can check the status of your tax return by:\n\n1. Using the IRS2Go app on your smartphone to check the status of your tax return online.\n2. Checking the status of your tax return over the phone by calling the IRS.\n3. Checking the status of your state tax return online or over the phone.\n\nTo check the status of your tax return, you will need your Social Security number, tax filing status, and the amount of any refund due. If you e-filed your return, you can check the status 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to check taxes were filed is:\n\nYou can check the status of your tax return online or over the phone using the methods described above.", "pred": "To check if taxes were filed, you can use several methods. First, you can check the status of your tax return online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours if you're due money back. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes. Additionally, if you e-filed your return, you can wait 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return to see if it was filed.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To check if taxes were filed, you can use several methods. First, you can check the status of your tax return online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours if you're due money back. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes. Additionally, if you e-filed your return, you can wait 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return to see if it was filed.", "cot": "[\"To check if taxes were filed, you can use your mobile phone to check the status of a tax return. You can download the IRS2Go application from the Apple App Store if you are an Apple user. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mail your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\", \"There are several methods to check if your taxes have been filed. You can check the status of your federal tax return either online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mail your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\", \"To check if taxes were filed, you can use several methods. First, you can check the status of your tax return online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours if you're due money back. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes. Additionally, if you e-filed your return, you can wait 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return to see if it was filed.\", \"To check if your taxes were filed, you can:\\n1. Use IRS2Go, a smartphone application, which allows you to handle taxes online. For Apple users, you can download IRS2Go from the Apple App Store.\\n2. Use the IRS tax portal to check the status of your tax return online.\\n3. Call the IRS to inquire about the status of your tax return.\\n4. Use tax software with an application that allows you to check the status of your return by logging into your account.\\n5. Check the acknowledgment receipt of your return from the IRS.\\n6. If you e-filed your return, wait 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return and check the status of your tax return online.\"]", "time_sec": 19.377, "generation_time_seconds": 18.5954, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7717, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 1779, 421, 13125, 1033, 12729, 11, 498, 646, 990, 697, 6371, 4540, 311, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 264, 3742, 470, 13, 1446, 646, 4139, 279, 33383, 17, 10850, 3766, 504, 279, 8162, 1845, 9129, 421, 498, 525, 458, 8162, 1196, 13, 1416, 498, 384, 14203, 67, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 1265, 387, 2952, 311, 633, 264, 20965, 2639, 2878, 220, 22, 17, 4115, 13, 1416, 498, 8072, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 686, 614, 311, 3783, 220, 18, 476, 220, 19, 5555, 1283, 32759, 304, 697, 13125, 13, 151645], "pred": "To check if taxes were filed, you can use your mobile phone to check the status of a tax return. You can download the IRS2Go application from the Apple App Store if you are an Apple user. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mail your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6404692749063123, "g_worst_claim": 0.9703811236790248, "g_content": 2.1816961500379772, "g_traj_mean": 1.6798173189163208}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [3862, 525, 3807, 5413, 311, 1779, 421, 697, 13125, 614, 1012, 12729, 13, 1446, 646, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 697, 6775, 3742, 470, 2987, 2860, 476, 553, 1319, 19744, 279, 33383, 13, 1416, 498, 384, 14203, 67, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 1265, 387, 2952, 311, 633, 264, 20965, 2639, 2878, 220, 22, 17, 4115, 13, 1416, 498, 8072, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 686, 614, 311, 3783, 220, 18, 476, 220, 19, 5555, 1283, 32759, 304, 697, 13125, 13, 151645], "pred": "There are several methods to check if your taxes have been filed. You can check the status of your federal tax return either online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mail your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.470592553608441, "g_worst_claim": 0.8753861647385818, "g_content": 2.021857261657715, "g_traj_mean": 1.500023603439331}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1779, 421, 13125, 1033, 12729, 11, 498, 646, 990, 3807, 5413, 13, 5512, 11, 498, 646, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 697, 3742, 470, 2860, 476, 553, 1319, 19744, 279, 33383, 13, 1416, 498, 384, 14203, 67, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 1265, 387, 2952, 311, 633, 264, 20965, 2639, 2878, 220, 22, 17, 4115, 421, 498, 2299, 4152, 3220, 1182, 13, 1416, 498, 75210, 697, 13125, 11, 498, 686, 614, 311, 3783, 220, 18, 476, 220, 19, 5555, 1283, 32759, 304, 697, 13125, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 498, 384, 14203, 67, 697, 470, 11, 498, 646, 3783, 220, 17, 19, 4115, 1283, 279, 33383, 25498, 22567, 315, 697, 470, 311, 1490, 421, 432, 572, 12729, 13, 151645], "pred": "To check if taxes were filed, you can use several methods. First, you can check the status of your tax return online or by phoning the IRS. If you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours if you're due money back. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes. Additionally, if you e-filed your return, you can wait 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return to see if it was filed.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3453288456736803, "g_worst_claim": 0.5673300822575887, "g_content": 2.244668380073879, "g_traj_mean": 1.4618781805038452}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1779, 421, 697, 13125, 1033, 12729, 11, 498, 646, 510, 16, 13, 5443, 33383, 17, 10850, 11, 264, 21511, 3766, 11, 892, 6147, 498, 311, 3705, 13125, 2860, 13, 1752, 8162, 3847, 11, 498, 646, 4139, 33383, 17, 10850, 504, 279, 8162, 1845, 9129, 624, 17, 13, 5443, 279, 33383, 3742, 23132, 311, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 697, 3742, 470, 2860, 624, 18, 13, 7143, 279, 33383, 311, 67170, 911, 279, 2639, 315, 697, 3742, 470, 624, 19, 13, 5443, 3742, 3162, 448, 458, 3766, 429, 6147, 498, 311, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 697, 470, 553, 8392, 1119, 697, 2692, 624,