{"id": "320", "question": "what is the effect of carbon footprint", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it is clear that the effect of a carbon footprint is a measure of the negative impact of human activities on the environment. The measurement of a carbon footprint typically indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced through daily activities. Additionally, reducing one's carbon footprint can have a positive impact on the environment, even if the changes may seem small.", "pred": "The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities. Even seemingly tiny changes in your lifestyle can make a significant difference in reducing your carbon footprint.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities. Even seemingly tiny changes in your lifestyle can make a significant difference in reducing your carbon footprint.", "cot": "[\"The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.\", \"碳足迹衡量了你生活方式对环境的影响。你所做的一切，无论是正面还是负面，都会对环境产生影响。碳足迹，以吨为单位，表示由于你日常活动而产生的碳氧化物和其他温室气体的量。通过改变生活方式，可以减少你的碳足迹。即使微小的改变也能产生显著的效果。\", \"The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities. Even seemingly tiny changes in your lifestyle can make a significant difference in reducing your carbon footprint.\", \"The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. Everything you do has an impact - positive or negative - on the environment. That's the concept behind your carbon footprint, which is one method of measuring the environmental effect of your lifestyle.\\n\\nA carbon footprint, measured in tons, indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases that are produced as a result of your daily activities. You can reduce your footprint by changing the way you live your life. Even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.\"]", "time_sec": 14.723, "generation_time_seconds": 13.9373, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7765, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 2456, 315, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 264, 1697, 594, 18899, 13, 1084, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 362, 12499, 42872, 11, 16878, 304, 19608, 11, 646, 387, 11046, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 825, 6305, 11, 1496, 22660, 13673, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 13, 151645], "pred": "The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7721814857055775, "g_worst_claim": 0.7949433075754266, "g_content": 1.7910174778529575, "g_traj_mean": 1.4481406211853027}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [100912, 115166, 107613, 34187, 56568, 107142, 32664, 99719, 104126, 1773, 56568, 31838, 99190, 107312, 3837, 102215, 106557, 99998, 103276, 3837, 101938, 32664, 99719, 100394, 99564, 1773, 100912, 115166, 3837, 23031, 101249, 17714, 75317, 3837, 51463, 101887, 56568, 101254, 99600, 68536, 102710, 100912, 101542, 52853, 105504, 111952, 107155, 9370, 32757, 1773, 67338, 101933, 107142, 3837, 73670, 101940, 103929, 100912, 115166, 1773, 102033, 48934, 30709, 9370, 101933, 104425, 100394, 104656, 105005, 1773, 151645], "pred": "碳足迹衡量了你生活方式对环境的影响。你所做的一切，无论是正面还是负面，都会对环境产生影响。碳足迹，以吨为单位，表示由于你日常活动而产生的碳氧化物和其他温室气体的量。通过改变生活方式，可以减少你的碳足迹。即使微小的改变也能产生显著的效果。", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6335035051618303, "g_worst_claim": 1.6335035051618303, "g_content": 3.0162094116210936, "g_traj_mean": 1.6167460680007935}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 697, 18899, 13, 1084, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 697, 7298, 7488, 13, 7418, 22660, 13673, 4344, 304, 697, 18899, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 304, 17719, 697, 12499, 42872, 13, 151645], "pred": "The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities. Even seemingly tiny changes in your lifestyle can make a significant difference in reducing your carbon footprint.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.515723883343064, "g_worst_claim": 0.5926676273345948, "g_content": 1.840136210123698, "g_traj_mean": 1.310652494430542}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 697, 18899, 13, 20094, 498, 653, 702, 458, 5421, 481, 6785, 476, 8225, 481, 389, 279, 4573, 13, 2938, 594, 279, 7286, 4815, 697, 12499, 42872, 11, 892, 374, 825, 1714, 315, 28990, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 697, 18899, 382, 32, 12499, 42872, 11, 16878, 304, 19608, 11, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 429, 525, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 697, 7298, 7488, 13, 1446, 646, 7949, 697, 42872, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 498, 3887, 697, 2272, 13, 7418, 22660, 13673, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 13, 151645], "pred": "A carbon footprint, measured in tons, indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases that are produced as a result of your daily activities. You can reduce your footprint by changing the way you live your life. Even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9203379907649318, "g_worst_claim": 0.818061283656529, "g_content": 2.265735626220703, "g_traj_mean": 1.7231225967407227}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "321", "question": "what is the effect of carbon footprint", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of an individual's lifestyle and daily activities, specifically the amount of greenhouse gases produced, such as carbon dioxide, as a result of those activities. The carbon footprint is typically measured in tons of CO2 released into the atmosphere. The passages also mention that reducing one's carbon footprint can have a significant impact on the environment, even with seemingly small changes. Additionally, the average carbon footprint is mentioned to be around 6 tons per year, with a higher amount in the US due to automobile emissions.", "pred": "The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "cot": "[\"The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.\", \"Carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. Everything you do has an impact---positive or negative---on the environment. That's the concept behind your carbon footprint, which is one method of measuring the environmental effect of your lifestyle. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases that are produced as a result of your daily activities. You can reduce your footprint by changing the way you live your life. Even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.\", \"The question is based on the provided passage and does not require any general knowledge.\\n\\nThe passage states that a carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of one's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. It also mentions that even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference in reducing the carbon footprint.\\n\\nAnswer: The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of one's lifestyle, indicating the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. It shows the environmental effect of our lifestyle and can be reduced by changing the way we live our lives, even with seemingly tiny changes.\", \"The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It quantifies the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. The concept of a carbon footprint helps individuals understand how their actions contribute to environmental pollution. For example, driving a car for long distances and using fossil fuels in heating homes significantly increase one's carbon footprint. On average, a person's carbon footprint varies depending on location; for instance, in the U.S., the average is 20 tons per year. Reducing one's carbon footprint involves making lifestyle changes, such as choosing public transportation, reducing meat consumption, and using energy-efficient appliances. Even small changes can lead to significant reductions in carbon emissions.\"]", "time_sec": 18.979, "generation_time_seconds": 18.3546, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6181, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 2456, 315, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 264, 1697, 594, 18899, 13, 1084, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 362, 12499, 42872, 11, 16878, 304, 19608, 11, 646, 387, 11046, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 825, 6305, 11, 1496, 22660, 13673, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 13, 151645], "pred": "The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, can be reduced by changing the way one lives, even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7936033245210676, "g_worst_claim": 0.765028853165476, "g_content": 1.8301193237304687, "g_traj_mean": 1.462515950202942}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [36607, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 697, 18899, 13, 20094, 498, 653, 702, 458, 5421, 4421, 30487, 476, 8225, 4421, 263, 279, 4573, 13, 2938, 594, 279, 7286, 4815, 697, 12499, 42872, 11, 892, 374, 825, 1714, 315, 28990, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 697, 18899, 13, 362, 12499, 42872, 11, 16878, 304, 19608, 11, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 429, 525, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 697, 7298, 7488, 13, 1446, 646, 7949, 697, 42872, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 498, 3887, 697, 2272, 13, 7418, 22660, 13673, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 13, 151645], "pred": "Carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle. Everything you do has an impact---positive or negative---on the environment. That's the concept behind your carbon footprint, which is one method of measuring the environmental effect of your lifestyle. A carbon footprint, measured in tons, indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases that are produced as a result of your daily activities. You can reduce your footprint by changing the way you live your life. Even seemingly tiny changes can make a significant difference.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.945867814811983, "g_worst_claim": 0.8196887061709449, "g_content": 2.21146297454834, "g_traj_mean": 1.737263798713684}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 3405, 374, 3118, 389, 279, 3897, 21085, 323, 1558, 537, 1373, 894, 4586, 6540, 382, 785, 21085, 5302, 429, 264, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 825, 594, 18899, 13, 1084, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 1084, 1083, 33845, 429, 1496, 22660, 13673, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 304, 17719, 279, 12499, 42872, 382, 16141, 25, 576, 2456, 315, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 825, 594, 18899, 11, 18860, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 1084, 4933, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 1039, 18899, 323, 646, 387, 11046, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 582, 3887, 1039, 6305, 11, 1496, 448, 22660, 13673, 4344, 13, 151645], "pred": "The effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of one's lifestyle, indicating the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. It shows the environmental effect of our lifestyle and can be reduced by changing the way we live our lives, even with seemingly tiny changes.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6619435296777508, "g_worst_claim": 0.009847347107198503, "g_content": 0.8446570805140904, "g_traj_mean": 0.6840272545814514}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 264, 1697, 594, 18899, 13, 1084, 10272, 9606, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 576, 7286, 315, 264, 12499, 42872, 8609, 7775, 3535, 1246, 862, 6168, 16792, 311, 12158, 24761, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 9842, 264, 1803, 369, 1293, 26552, 323, 1667, 30276, 39273, 304, 23579, 10415, 11941, 5263, 825, 594, 12499, 42872, 13, 1913, 5461, 11, 264, 1697, 594, 12499, 42872, 34227, 11649, 389, 3728, 26, 369, 2867, 11, 304, 279, 547, 808, 2572, 279, 5461, 374, 220, 17, 15, 19608, 817, 1042, 13, 3731, 58044, 825, 594, 12499, 42872, 17601, 3259, 18899, 4344, 11, 1741, 438, 18774, 584, 17903, 11, 17719, 13041, 15293, 11, 323, 1667, 4802, 72816, 33702, 13, 7418, 2613, 4344, 646, 2990, 311, 5089, 46211, 304, 12499, 20143, 13, 151645], "pred": "The carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It quantifies the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. The concept of a carbon footprint helps individuals understand how their actions contribute to environmental pollution. For example, driving a car for long distances and using fossil fuels in heating homes significantly increase one's carbon footprint. On average, a person's carbon footprint varies depending on location; for instance, in the U.S., the average is 20 tons per year. Reducing one's carbon footprint involves making lifestyle changes, such as choosing public transportation, reducing meat consumption, and using energy-efficient appliances. Even small changes can lead to significant reductions in carbon emissions.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.4659576869486586, "g_worst_claim": -0.14479315280914307, "g_content": 0.658792707655165, "g_traj_mean": 0.544789731502533}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.98, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "324", "question": "how well do patterned rollers work", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here's what we can conclude about how well patterned rollers work:\n\nPassage 1 suggests that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial ones for certain faux finishes because they can create a random pattern of texture.\n\nPassage 2 provides a personal testimonial about the effectiveness of the Dermaroller for improving the appearance of skin. The writer claims that it makes their skin look younger and healthier, and that it works best when used with serums or moisturizers. However, there is no direct mention of patterned rollers in this passage.\n\nPassage 3 provides instructions for creating a basic texture roller using an old roller pad with clumped tufts and random patterns created by stretching and twisting rubber bands. This passage suggests that patterned rollers can create a textured finish on walls, but there is no information on how effective they are or how well they work.\n\nTherefore, based on the given passages, it is difficult to say definitively how well patterned rollers work. Passage 1 suggests that they may be effective for certain applications, while passage 2 provides a personal endorsement of a specific product (Dermaroller) for improving skin appearance. Passage 3 provides instructions for creating a basic texture roller, but does not provide any information on its effectiveness. Therefore, the answer to the original question is: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the information provided in the passages, patterned rollers, such as the homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, can work well for applying random patterns of texture to walls. However, the effectiveness of patterned rollers can vary depending on the specific type of roller and the texture being applied. For example, the Dermaroller mentioned in passage 2 seems to work better on certain areas of the face than on the neck and chest, and it is suggested that it works best when used with serums or moisturizers.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the passages, patterned rollers, such as the homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, can work well for applying random patterns of texture to walls. However, the effectiveness of patterned rollers can vary depending on the specific type of roller and the texture being applied. For example, the Dermaroller mentioned in passage 2 seems to work better on certain areas of the face than on the neck and chest, and it is suggested that it works best when used with serums or moisturizers.", "cot": "[\"Based on the information provided in the passages, patterned rollers, such as the homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, can work well for applying random patterns of texture to walls. However, the effectiveness of patterned rollers can vary depending on the specific type of roller and the texture being applied. For example, the Dermaroller mentioned in passage 2 seems to work better on certain areas of the face than on the neck and chest, and it is suggested that it works best when used with serums or moisturizers.\", \"Based on the information provided, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than the commercial variety for certain faux finishes. The passages do not provide specific examples or comparisons of how well patterned rollers, specifically Dermarollers, work.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages, patterned rollers, such as the custom-made texture or decorative paint rollers, can work better than commercial varieties for certain applications, especially when creating a random pattern of texture on walls. However, the effectiveness can vary depending on the specific needs and materials used. For instance, a person using a Dermaroller noticed different results with various areas of their skin, indicating that patterned rollers may not uniformly work well across all skin types or areas.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages, patterned rollers, such as homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, can work well for certain purposes. However, the effectiveness seems to vary depending on the context and specific use case.\\n\\nThe first passage suggests that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can be more effective for specific types of finishes, such as faux finishes, because they can apply random patterns of texture. This implies that patterned rollers can achieve the desired effect for certain artistic or decorative purposes.\\n\\nThe second passage does not directly address patterned rollers, but it provides an example of a roller that creates a patterned effect, the Dermaroller. The Dermaroller seems to work better on the face than on the neck and chest, and it appears to have some positive effects on the skin, such as stimulating the skin and giving it a healthier glow. However, the passage does not provide enough information to determine how well the Dermaroller works in general or how well patterned rollers work in general.\\n\\nIn conclusion, based on the provided information, patterned rollers, such as the Dermaroller, seem to work well in certain cases, such as skin treatment and decorative painting, but the effectiveness of patterned rollers in general is not clear.\"]", "time_sec": 20.986, "generation_time_seconds": 20.0316, "selection_time_seconds": 0.945, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 11, 1741, 438, 279, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 11, 646, 975, 1632, 369, 18950, 4194, 12624, 315, 10434, 311, 14285, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 26279, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 943, 315, 28451, 323, 279, 10434, 1660, 9251, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 27