 & Filter group.\n3. Click on the Sort option.\n4. Click on the Sort By drop-down menu to select a column by name. In this example, we want to sort by the Product column (column B) in alphabetical order (A to Z).\n5. Click on the OK button.\n6. After completing these steps, the data in the selected column will be sorted alphabetically when you return to the spreadsheet.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1241713416317012, "g_worst_claim": -0.03447477767864863, "g_content": 1.5348003680889424, "g_traj_mean": 1.2072300910949707}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 30893, 458, 21029, 10834, 27790, 2673, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 8427, 2009, 3137, 518, 279, 19246, 315, 697, 2802, 323, 3250, 69452, 13, 576, 7761, 304, 697, 36636, 11167, 311, 7683, 807, 2299, 4091, 624, 17, 13, 15586, 311, 279, 2885, 5651, 304, 279, 5100, 21029, 44567, 323, 24523, 279, 15967, 609, 12339, 1874, 624, 18, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 15967, 2999, 624, 19, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 15967, 3216, 5943, 14875, 5022, 311, 3293, 264, 3250, 553, 829, 13, 576, 5036, 7866, 311, 279, 69452, 31969, 304, 279, 1156, 2802, 315, 697, 821, 382, 12522, 498, 614, 4091, 279, 3250, 553, 829, 323, 19910, 389, 432, 11, 264, 5943, 14875, 5022, 686, 4994, 13, 22201, 279, 2999, 429, 2890, 5520, 279, 821, 304, 83298, 1973, 320, 32, 311, 1863, 8, 476, 279, 1008, 1616, 2163, 320, 57, 311, 362, 8, 3118, 389, 697, 21933, 382, 6025, 26301, 279, 28273, 2999, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 10402, 3137, 311, 3796, 279, 4344, 13, 3197, 498, 470, 311, 279, 45886, 11, 279, 821, 1265, 1431, 387, 10615, 304, 279, 11882, 83298, 1973, 382, 2679, 498, 10702, 311, 990, 730, 1535, 3069, 369, 21029, 11, 498, 646, 990, 1181, 15967, 60472, 5392, 311, 6707, 3378, 678, 67525, 13, 730, 1535, 3069, 369, 21029, 5646, 803, 1091, 220, 16, 17, 15, 25163, 21029, 7375, 323, 646, 387, 1910, 311, 1430, 369, 220, 18, 15, 2849, 448, 902, 9481, 13, 151645], "pred": "If you prefer to use Kutools for Excel, you can use i