{"id": "400", "question": "temperature bucharest", "gt": "Based on passage 3, the average temperature in Bucharest, Romania during July and August is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures can also reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "pred": "Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer (July and August), the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures often reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer (July and August), the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures often reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "cot": "[\"Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer (July and August), the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures often reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.\", \"Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer (July and August), the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures often reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.\", \"Answer: Bucharest has a humid continental climate with winter temperatures often dipping below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer, the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F), with temperatures often reaching 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.\", \"Bucharest, Romania has a humid continental climate. Winters are characterized by windy conditions and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In contrast, summer (July and August) temperatures average around 23 °C (73 °F), but can reach as high as 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.\"]", "time_sec": 18.355, "generation_time_seconds": 17.3123, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0348, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [33, 1387, 15432, 702, 264, 65938, 57536, 9977, 13, 467, 49940, 646, 633, 92921, 323, 19879, 3545, 23604, 3685, 220, 15, 36286, 34, 40247, 320, 18, 17, 36286, 37, 47910, 701, 7025, 1496, 25100, 311, 27283, 220, 17, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 19, 36286, 37, 568, 758, 7324, 320, 28427, 323, 6156, 701, 279, 5461, 9315, 374, 2163, 220, 17, 18, 36286, 34, 320, 22, 18, 36286, 37, 568, 74683, 2789, 3545, 5545, 220, 18, 20, 36286, 34, 320, 24, 20, 36286, 37, 8, 311, 220, 19, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 16, 15, 19, 36286, 37, 8, 304, 5099, 12, 62566, 13, 151645], "pred": "Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy and temperatures often dip below 0 °Celsius (32 °Fahrenheit), sometimes even dropping to minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer (July and August), the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures often reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6134921768699029, "g_worst_claim": 0.5442138910293579, "g_content": 1.811914571126302, "g_traj_mean": 1.4548004865646362}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [33, 1387, 15432, 702, 264, 65938, 57536, 9977, 13, 467, 49940, 646, 633, 92921, 323, 19879, 3545, 23604, 3685, 220, 15, 36286, 34, 40247, 320, 18, 17, 36286, 37, 47910, 701, 7025, 1496, 25100, 311, 27283, 220, 17, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 19, 36286, 37, 568, 758, 7324, 320, 28427, 323, 6156, 701, 279, 5461, 9315, 374, 2163, 220, 17, 18, 36286, 34,