{"id": "412", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg. After hatching them, buy the breeding structure. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster. The order of the monsters does not matter.", "pred": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. After obtaining the Shugabush, you'll turn it into an egg, then hatch it. Next, you'll need to buy the breeding structure on the Shugabeats Island. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. After obtaining the Shugabush, you'll turn it into an egg, then hatch it. Next, you'll need to buy the breeding structure on the Shugabeats Island. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "cot": "[\"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Doing this will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, then you will need to hatch them and then buy the breeding structure. After that, you can breed them using the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\", \"To breed a Shugabeat in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. Once you have the Shugabush Monster, you will need to hatch it and then buy the breeding structure. After that, you can breed the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. After obtaining the Shugabush, you'll turn it into an egg, then hatch it. Next, you'll need to buy the breeding structure on the Shugabeats Island. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to:\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the Shugabush Monster egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\"]", "time_sec": 16.404, "generation_time_seconds": 15.4664, "selection_time_seconds": 0.931, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 6851, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 13, 43145, 419, 686, 2484, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 458, 18636, 11, 1221, 498, 686, 1184, 311, 43255, 1105, 323, 1221, 3695, 279, 39208, 5944, 13, 4636, 429, 11, 498, 646, 27775, 1105, 1667, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 13, 151645], "pred": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Doing this will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, then you will need to hatch them and then buy the breeding structure. After that, you can breed them using the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.332931771253152, "g_worst_claim": 1.045114517211914, "g_content": 3.4327688950758715, "g_traj_mean": 2.3002467155456543}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 266, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 6