4057, 279, 86480, 812, 2041, 668, 81, 2228, 279, 14961, 13, 25968, 1378, 25374, 315, 4017, 3015, 1119, 264, 19212, 11, 3322, 311, 3421, 279, 30717, 498, 2299, 15826, 13, 1752, 1101, 825, 6573, 315, 30717, 11, 990, 2686, 3015, 13, 1416, 697, 30717, 702, 18747, 32510, 11, 1281, 2704, 807, 2765, 944, 387, 11495, 553, 1660, 84077, 304, 264, 12021, 12987, 6291, 13, 151645], "pred": "Another method involves using warm soapy water and a soft-bristle brush or old toothbrush. Pat the jewelry dry with a soft cloth. If your silver is lightly tarnished, a salt bath should remove the tarnish without abrading the silver. Pour two cups of hot water into a bowl, enough to cover the jewelry you're cleaning. For just one piece of jewelry, use less water. If your jewelry has gemstones, make sure they won't be affected by being submerged in a saltwater solution.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.768176800772586, "g_worst_claim": 0.5581339518229167, "g_content": 2.192911431340888, "g_traj_mean": 1.7539339065551758}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "435", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use a website for people search in France. Sending an email or letter to the Town Hall in the person's city of birth can also be helpful, especially if you have lost relatives or friends. Try to find out the person's middle name, it could make the search easier. You can also use the French white pages, available in English at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the person's last name in the 'Nom' field and first name in the 'Prenom' field, enter address information if known, and then click 'Trouver' to search. For searching in Paris and its suburbs, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. Posting a missed connection on Paris Craigslist might also be helpful.", "pred": "To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages, which can be accessed at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field and click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages, which can be accessed at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field and click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "cot": "[\"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"To find someone in France, you can use various methods:\\n\\n1. **People Search Websites**: Use websites that allow you to search for individuals based on various criteria such as name, middle name, or address. For example, you can search for someone by entering their last name in the \\\"Nom\\\" field on www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French version of the white pages). Additionally, you can enter a first name in the \\\"Prenom\\\" field if you know it.\\n\\n2. **French White Pages**: Visit http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en to access the French white pages. This site allows you to search for individuals by entering their last name and, if known, their first name. For a more comprehensive search, you can also include address information in the \\\"Ou\\\" field.\\n\\n3. **Craigslist**: Post an \\\"MC\\\" (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/) to try and locate someone. This method is useful if you have not seen the person for over ten or twenty years and might be looking for more personal details.\\n\\n4. **Town Hall Searches**: If you know the city or town where the person was born, you can send an email or letter to the town hall in that city. This is particularly helpful if you have lost relatives in cities like Paris, Avignon, Bordeaux, Lyon, or Nice.\\n\\nRemember, if you're searching for someone you haven't seen for a long time, using middle names or specific place details can be very helpful.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages, which can be accessed at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field and click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use a website for people search in France. For example, you can visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the Pages Blanches, which is similar to the white pages in other countries. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field. You can also enter a first name in the Prenom field, and if you know the address, enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have specific information, you can leave the address field blank to search the entire country. Click on the Trouver button to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\"]", "time_sec": 25.797, "generation_time_seconds": 25.0629, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7249, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 320, 258, 6364, 8, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 3197, 15039, 11, 4518, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3270, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 2711, 369, 279, 1697, 304, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 17004, 458, 20869, 320, 1831, 291, 3633, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 1112, 151645], "pred": "To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.421642292509073, "g_worst_claim": 1.1262750625610352, "g_content": 3.714029412520559, "g_traj_mean": 2.6902263164520264}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304,