ch is similar to the white pages in other countries. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field. You can also enter a first name in the Prenom field, and if you know the address, enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have specific information, you can leave the address field blank to search the entire country. Click on the Trouver button to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.543823820299531, "g_worst_claim": 0.6463749625466086, "g_content": 2.084200325658766, "g_traj_mean": 1.379690170288086}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 39.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "436", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use the website www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages. Enter the last name of the person in the \"Nom\" field and optionally enter their first name in the \"Prenom\" field. If you know the address, you can enter it in the \"Ou\" section. Leave it blank if you don't know the address. Click on \"Trouver\" to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number of the matching listings.", "pred": "You can also try the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. Another option is to post an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist at http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "You can also try the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. Another option is to post an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist at http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...", "cot": "[\"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"To find someone in France, you can use local or national directories such as the French white pages (http://www.pagesjaunes.fr). You can enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and if you know their address, you can also enter that information in the Ou section. Alternatively, you can try using a search engine or social media platforms to find people.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use th