{"id": "438", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n\n1. Check the French White Pages (in English): You can use the website pagesjaunes.fr to search for people in France. To search for someone in Paris or its suburbs, enter \"IDF\" (Ile de France) in the department or region field instead of typing Paris.\n2. Use the nom field to enter the last name of the person you are looking for, and you can also include their first name in the prenom field.\n3. Provide address information, if known, in the ou section to refine your search.\n4. Click \"trouver\" to search for the name, and the search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\n\nNote that the effectiveness of these methods may depend on how up-to-date the information in the white pages is and whether the person you are looking for has listed their contact information publicly.", "pred": "To find someone in France, you can use websites such as www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French version of the white pages). You need to enter the last name of the person you are searching for in the Nom field. If you know a first name, you can enter it in the Prenom field. Additionally, if you have address information, you can enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have any specific information, leaving the Ou section blank will search the entire country. Clicking Trouver will initiate the search, and the results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To find someone in France, you can use websites such as www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French version of the white pages). You need to enter the last name of the person you are searching for in the Nom field. If you know a first name, you can enter it in the Prenom field. Additionally, if you have address information, you can enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have any specific information, leaving the Ou section blank will search the entire country. Clicking Trouver will initiate the search, and the results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "cot": "[\"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"To find someone in France, you can try using the website www.pagesjaunes.fr, which is the French version of the white pages. Enter the person's last name in the Nom field, and if you know the first name, enter it in the Prenom field. You can also enter address information in the Ou section, but if you don't know the address, leave it blank to search the entire country. Clicking the Trouver button will display the search results, which will include the person's name, address, and phone number.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use several methods:\\n\\n1. **Visit **www.pagesjaunes.fr**, the French version of the white pages.**\\n   - Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the \\\"Nom\\\" field.\\n   - You can also enter a first name in the \\\"Prenom\\\" field.\\n   - Enter address information, if known, in the \\\"Ou\\\" section.\\n   - Click \\\"Trouver\\\" to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\\n\\n2. **Use the French white pages in English:**\\n   - Go to **http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en**.\\n   - Instead of typing \\\"Paris\\\" in the City field, write \\\"IDF\\\" (or \\\"Ile de France\\\") in the Dept district or region field.\\n   - This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\\n\\n3. **Post a \\\"missed connection\\\" on Paris Craigslist:** \\n   - Visit **http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers**.\\n   - Post a detailed description of the person you're looking for, including photographs, address, and contact information. This can help you find individuals who you have lost contact with.\\n\\nThese methods can help you locate individuals in France by leveraging public records and community platforms.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use websites such as www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French version of the white pages). You need to enter the last name of the person you are searching for in the Nom field. If you know a first name, you can enter it in the Prenom field. Additionally, if you have address information, you can enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have any specific information, leaving the Ou section blank will search the entire country. Clicking Trouver will initiate the search, and the results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\"]", "time_sec": 25.988, "generation_time_seconds": 24.9611, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0188, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 320, 258, 6364, 8, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 3197, 15039, 11, 4518, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3270, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 2711, 369, 279, 1697, 304, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 17004, 458, 20869, 320, 1831, 291, 3633, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 1112, 151645], "pred": "To find so