{"id": "449", "question": "how do i file a lien on a semi", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages. The passages provided do not contain information on how to file a lien on a semi. Passage 1 discusses the possibility of a creditor placing a lien on a home that has been transferred to a spouse, while passage 2 explains the general process for placing a lien on business property but does not mention semis specifically. Passage 3 describes the documentation and distribution of copies of a lien entry form, but does not provide instructions on how to file a lien. Therefore, without additional information, it is impossible to provide an answer to the question.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 6.431, "generation_time_seconds": 5.8727, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5517, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.02020532451570034, "g_worst_claim": -0.02020532451570034, "g_content": -0.03212963342666626, "g_traj_mean": -0.017967702820897102}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.02020532451570034, "g_worst_claim": -0.02020532451570034, "g_content": -0.03212963342666626, "g_traj_mean": -0.017967702820897102}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable