{"id": "461", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is another benefit of cupping massage.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body. This is achieved through the creation of a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be promoted through cupping, which helps in delivering oxygen and nutrients to various parts of the body.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage helps in reducing inflammation of tissues, thereby increasing range of motion, improving flexibility, and controlling pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage provides therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Eliminates toxins, Improved circulation, Pain relief, and Mental benefits.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the benefits of cupping massage include several health advantages: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body when a vacuum is created in the cup, applying negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 16.531, "generation_time_seconds": 15.9362, "selection_time_seconds": 0.589, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 264, 28202, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 892, 16790, 8225, 7262, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 2441, 8760, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892, 646, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 382, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 11, 1741, 438, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8350792732788173, "g_worst_claim": 1.2051646159245417, "g_content": 2.202346095332393, "g_traj_mean": 1.5351895093917847}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 1096, 374, 16994, 1526, 279, 9688, 31