{"id": "462", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits including eliminating toxins from the body, improved circulation, pain relief, and mental benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body.\n2. Improved circulation: It enhances blood circulation.\n3. Pain relief: It helps reduce inflammation of tissues, increasing range of motion, improving flexibility, and controlling pain.\n4. Mental benefits: It decreases anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body.\n2. Improved circulation: It enhances blood circulation.\n3. Pain relief: It helps reduce inflammation of tissues, increasing range of motion, improving flexibility, and controlling pain.\n4. Mental benefits: It decreases anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is another benefit of cupping massage.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Benefits of cupping massage include:\\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body.\\n2. Improved circulation: It enhances blood circulation.\\n3. Pain relief: It helps reduce inflammation of tissues, increasing range of motion, improving flexibility, and controlling pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: It decreases anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the main benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage helps to remove toxins from the body by creating a vacuum that applies negative pressure.\\n2. Improved circulation: It enhances blood circulation, contributing to better overall health.\\n3. Pain relief: By reducing inflammation of tissues, it can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and alleviate pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: It has therapeutic effects, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n1. Eliminating toxins: This is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body.\\n2. Improved circulation: Cupping massage can increase blood circulation.\\n3. Pain relief: It helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 16.037, "generation_time_seconds": 15.4387, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5927, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 264, 28202, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 892, 16790, 8225, 7262, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 2441, 8760, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892, 646, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 382, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 11, 1741, 438, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.801457275996556, 