{"id": "463", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief, increasing range of motion and flexibility, controlling pain, and decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "The benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Elimination of toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Elimination of toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is another benefit of cupping massage.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Eliminates toxins, Improved circulation, Pain relief, Mental benefits.\", \"The benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Elimination of toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Benefits of cupping massage include the following: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 14.762, "generation_time_seconds": 14.1074, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6483, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 264, 28202, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 892, 16790, 8225, 7262, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 2441, 8760, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892, 646, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 382, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 11, 1741, 438, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.815825993