{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is another benefit of cupping massage.\\n\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"To answer the question based on the provided passages and general knowledge, we can identify several benefits of cupping massage from the information given:\\n\\n1. **Eliminates toxins**: As mentioned in both passage 2 and passage 3, cupping massage is effective in getting rid of toxins from the body. This is due to the creation of a negative pressure when a vacuum is applied inside the cup.\\n\\n2. **Improved circulation**: Both passages 2 and 3 indicate that cupping massage increases blood circulation, which is beneficial for overall health.\\n\\n3. **Pain relief**: Cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can lead to increased range of motion, improved flexibility, and pain control, as detailed in passage 2.\\n\\n4. **Mental benefits**: While not explicitly stated in the passages, cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits that can decrease anxiety and depression, as implied in passage 2.\\n\\nAnswer: The benefits of cupping massage include eliminating toxins, improving circulation, providing pain relief, and offering mental health benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 20.708, "generation_time_seconds": 19.8812, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8125, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 264, 28202, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 892, 16790, 8225, 7262, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 2441, 8760, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892, 646, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 382, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 11, 1741, 438, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.829856746013348, "g_worst_claim": 1.1869954329270582, "g_content": 2.177764892578125, "g_traj_mean": 1.5351097583770752}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 25, 220, 16, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 220, 17, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 13, 220, 18, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulatio