 0.03180180490016937, "g_content": 1.0911575317382813, "g_traj_mean": 0.8569266200065613}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [41013, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.056964467091181, "g_worst_claim": 1.8276138305664062, "g_content": 2.6150436401367188, "g_traj_mean": 2.03035306930542}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "Hiking has several benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It also has benefits for the cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Hiking has several benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It also has benefits for the cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.", "cot": "[\"Hiking has several benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It also has benefits for the cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"Benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, providing cardiovascular benefits, and combating stress and anxiety symptoms.\", \"Outdoor hiking has a myriad of benefits for both the body and the mind. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, so you can participate no matter how fit you currently are. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots and discovering these places is a good way of getting to know an area. Some of the benefits of hiking include promoting mental health, being a cardiovascular activity, and having a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"Outdoor hiking has several benefits for both the body and the mind. It is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. Additionally, most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, and discovering these places is a good way to get to know an area. Hiking is also more varied than many other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym.\\n\\nHiking is a cardiovascular activity, and depending on how hard you push yourself during a hike, it can have benefits for your cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing your overall fitness. Exposure to sunshine while hiking will also increase your levels of vitamin D.\\n\\nResearch shows that hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA, and we sometimes forget that.\"]", "time_sec": 16.708, "generation_time_seconds": 16.0795, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6221, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [39, 19233, 702, 3807, 7567, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 1084, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 13, 1084, 1083, 702, 7567, 369, 279, 40613, 1849, 11, 1741, 438, 17719, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 7703, 8084, 17042, 13, 22406, 11, 37364, 702, 264, 6785, 5421, 389, 95078, 279, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 13, 151645], "pred": "Hiking has several benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It also has benefits for the cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9923039805272946, "g_worst_claim": 1.1232511732313368, "g_content": 3.1652234833816, "g_traj_mean": 1.9585868120193481}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 2924, 22136, 10502, 2820, 11, 8241, 40613, 7567, 11, 323, 95078, 8464, 323, 18056, 13495, 13, 151645], "pred": "Benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, providing cardiovascular benefits, and combating stress and anxiety symptoms.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0235885882274416, "g_worst_claim": 1.462798833847046, "g_content": 2.937668936593192, "g_traj_mean": 1.9717530012130737}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [98535, 37364, 702, 264, 51809, 315, 7567, 369, 2176, 279, 2487, 323, 279, 3971, 13, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 773, 498, 646, 15759, 902, 4925, 1246, 4946, 498, 5023, 525, 13, 7496, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 323, 41587, 1493, 7482, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 315, 3709, 311, 1414, 458, 3082, 13, 4329, 315, 279, 7567, 315, 37364, 2924, 22136, 10502, 2820, 11, 1660, 264, 40613, 5702, 11, 323, 3432, 264, 6785, 5421, 389, 95078, 279, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 13, 151645], "pred": "Outdoor hiking has a myriad of benefits for both the body and the mind. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, so you can participate no matter how fit you currently are. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots and discovering these places is a good way of getting to know an area. Some of the benefits of hiking include promoting mental health, being a cardiovascular activity, and having a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.238135046340637, "g_worst_claim": 1.3704885135997424, "g_content": 3.2796251163926233, "g_traj_mean": 2.238544464111328}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [98535, 37364, 702, 3807, 7567, 369, 2176, 279, 2487, 323, 279, 3971, 13, 1084, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 22406, 11, 1429, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 11, 323, 41587, 1493, 7482, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 311, 633, 311, 1414, 458, 3082, 13, 472, 19233, 374, 1083, 803, 27730, 1091, 1657, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 382, 39, 19233, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 11, 323, 11649, 389, 1246, 2588, 498, 4484, 6133, 2337, 264, 34231, 11, 432, 646, 614, 7567, 369, 697, 40613, 1849, 11, 1741, 438, 17719, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 7703, 697, 8084, 17042, 13, 70766, 311, 51395, 1393, 37364, 686, 1083, 5263, 697, 5866, 315, 27071, 422, 382, 27428, 4933, 429, 37364, 702, 264, 6785, 5421, 389, 95078, 279, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 438, 1660, 304, 6993, 374, 80236, 2627, 304, 1039, 15552, 11, 323, 582, 7025, 10667, 429, 13, 151645], "pred": "Research shows that hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA, and we sometimes forget that.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9287098644400367, "g_worst_claim": 0.8034296989440918, "g_content": 3.0114509896056294, "g_traj_mean": 1.8556305170059204}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.7, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "These points highlight the multifaceted benefits of hiking as a hobby.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These points highlight the multifaceted benefits of hiking as a hobby.", "cot": "[\"Hiking has several benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It also has benefits for the cardiovascular system, such as reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"Hiking offers multiple benefits for both physical and mental health. Here are some key benefits mentioned in the passages:\\n\\n1. **Mental Health Promotion**:\\n   - **Variety** (Passage 1): Hiking provides a varied experience, unlike more monotonous exercises in gyms.\\n   - **Combatting Stress and Anxiety** (Passage 3): Research indicates that hiking positively impacts stress and anxiety symptoms.\\n   - **Connection to Nature** (Passage 3): Being in nature is deeply ingrained in human DNA, suggesting a natural appeal and benefit for many.\\n\\n2. **Physical Health Benefits**:\\n   - **Cardiovascular Health** (Passage 2): Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the risk of heart disease and increase overall fitness, depending on the intensity of the hike.\\n\\n3. **Accessibility and Affordability** (Passage 1): Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, suitable for individuals of all fitness levels.\\n\\n4. **Exploration and Local Knowledge** (Passage 1): Discovering local hiking spots can help participants better understand and appreciate their surroundings.\\n\\nThese points highlight the multifaceted benefits of hiking as a hobby.\", \"Answer: Hiking as a hobby offers several benefits to both the body and the mind. It promotes mental health, as it is more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken indoors. Exposure to sunshine during hiking increases vitamin D levels, which has benefits for the cardiovascular system, including reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Hiking also has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.\", \"Hiking is an excellent hobby with numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. Some key benefits of hiking include:\\n\\n1. Promotes Mental Health: Hiking provides a varied experience that is more engaging than other forms of exercise. Being in nature is ingrained in our DNA, and it can help combat the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\\n\\n2. Increases Vitamin D Levels: Exposure to sunshine during a hike can boost vitamin D levels, which is essential for overall health.\\n\\n3. Cardiovascular Benefits: As a cardiovascular activity, hiking can help reduce the risk of heart disease and improve overall fitness, especially when pushed to a challenging level.\\n\\nIn summary, hiking is a cost-effective and easily accessible hobby that can significantly benefit mental health and physical well-being.\"]", "time_sec": 23.477, "generation_time_seconds": 22.8929, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5788, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [39, 19233, 702, 3807, 7567, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 1084, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 