rall fitness. Additionally, hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"The benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, increasing overall fitness, and reducing the chances of heart disease.\", \"Hiking offers a variety of benefits, both for the body and the mind. One significant benefit is that it promotes mental health. Hiking is a more varied activity compared to exercises done in a gym, which can be more stimulating and engaging. Additionally, hiking can have positive impacts on combating stress and anxiety. It's a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the risk of heart disease and improve overall fitness. Hiking also provides exposure to sunlight, which increases vitamin D levels, contributing to better overall health.\", \"Outdoor hiking has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to everyone regardless of their fitness level. Hiking promotes mental health by offering a varied form of exercise that differs from activities typically done in a gym. It also has a positive impact on combating stress and anxiety, as being in nature is deeply ingrained in our DNA. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the risk of heart disease and improve overall fitness, especially when pushed harder during a hike.\"]", "time_sec": 15.066, "generation_time_seconds": 14.2424, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8191, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [39, 19233, 702, 3807, 7567, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 1084, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 13, 1084, 1083, 702, 7567, 369, 279, 40613, 1849, 11, 1741, 438, 17719, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 7703, 8084, 17042, 13, 22406, 11, 37364, 702, 264, 6785, 5421, 389, 95078, 279, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 13, 151645], "pred": "Hiking has several benefits as a hob