t tolerance. Refined coconut oil is made from dried coconuts and has a high smoking point of 450 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for high-temperature cooking methods such as frying. It has lost its coconut flavor and aroma due to the refining process. On the other hand, unrefined coconut oil comes from fresh coconuts and has a lower smoking point of 350 degrees Fahrenheit. It retains its distinct coconut flavor and aroma, but has a milder coconut taste compared to the full-bodied flavor of refined coconut oil.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7786986221040125, "g_worst_claim": 0.20356828689575196, "g_content": 1.0247380656580771, "g_traj_mean": 0.7177135944366455}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 62.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "478", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "gt": "Passage 3 provides information on how to change your address with the U.S. Postal Service. You can visit their website, call the USPS Call Center, or fill out and submit a form at a U.S. Post Office.", "pred": "The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "cot": "[\"The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Change of address with the U.S. Postal Service can be done in three main ways:\\n\\n1. Visit https://moversguide.usps.com/. Safeguard your personal information with identity validation by a simple $1 charge to your credit or debit card. \\n2. Call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777).\\n3. Fill out and submit PS Form 3575, which you can pick up at any U.S. Post Office, and submit it at the Post Office. The form may be submitted at any U.S. Post Office, mailed to any Post Office, or provided to any Postal Mail Carrier.\\n\\nThese options allow you to efficiently update your address with the U.S. Postal Service.\"]", "time_sec": 15.594, "generation_time_seconds": 15.0063, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5816, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 6081, 264, 2297, 315, 2621, 2473, 429, 646, 387, 8145, 304, 438, 2632, 438, 220, 16, 9383, 13, 1096, 2473, 6147, 498, 311, 15456, 705, 311, 220, 16, 15, 15, 11104, 304, 5256, 311, 279, 54217, 5362, 320, 2034, 5012, 568, 576, 2473, 374, 9767, 11, 1667, 279, 5535, 25463, 14310, 311, 5978, 697, 821, 374, 6092, 13, 1446, 646, 4583, 279, 2297, 315, 2621, 1352, 2860, 11, 476, 498, 646, 3947, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 34545, 1618, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 701, 476, 5155, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 13, 151645], "pred": "The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4847303798261917, "g_worst_claim": 0.3731141885121663, "g_content": 2.0359573364257812, "g_traj_mean": 1.4848928451538086}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.24993745982646942, "g_worst_claim": -0.24993745982646942, "g_content": -0.3956425905227661, "g_traj_mean": -0.22225181758403778}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.24993745982646942, "g_worst_claim": -0.24993745982646942, "g_content": -0.3956425905227661, "g_traj_mean": -0.22225181758403778}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [4072, 315, 2621, 448, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 646, 387, 2814, 304, 2326, 1887, 5510, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 11930, 12582, 81871, 697, 4345, 1995, 448, 9569, 10519, 553, 264, 4285, 400, 16, 6757, 311, 697, 6668, 476, 45353, 3701, 13, 715, 17, 13, 7143, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 4292, 18, 13, 21979, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 11, 892, 498, 646, 3735, 705, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 11, 323, 9318, 432, 518, 279, 3877, 8246, 13, 576, 1352, 1231, 387, 14634, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 11, 75210, 311, 894, 3877, 8246, 11, 476, 3897, 311, 894, 54217, 14874, 50861, 382, 9485, 2606, 2138, 498, 311, 29720, 2647, 697, 2621, 448, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 13, 151645], "pred": "These options allow you to efficiently update your address with the U.S. Postal Service.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4253735370000367, "g_worst_claim": -0.14450430870056152, "g_content": 1.939015633719308, "g_traj_mean": 1.436418056488037}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 45.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "479", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "gt": "To change your US postal address, you can visit the official website of the U.S. Postal Service, fill out an online form, or contact their call center. The process is fast and versatile, allowing you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the USPS. It's important to note that you can also use this feature to have your business mail forwarded to a new address due to a permanent move or temporary relocation. The process involves submitting either an online form or filling out and submitting a physical form at any U.S. Post Office.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.\", \"The U.S. Postal Service offers a fast and secure change of address service, allowing users to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service in as little as 1 minute. This service ensures that your data is safe with the latest encryption technologies. To change your address, you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service in as little as 1 minute. This feature is particularly useful for businesses and individuals who need to have their mail forwarded due to a permanent move or temporary relocation. The service can also be useful if your business has been subjected to a disaster that requires relocation. To change your address, you can visit the website https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575, which you can get from any U.S. Post Office.\"]", "time_sec": 18.976, "generation_time_seconds": 18.2892, "selection_time_seconds": 0.682, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 6081, 264, 2297, 315, 2621, 2473, 429, 646, 387, 8145, 304, 438, 2632, 438, 220, 16, 9383, 13, 1096, 2473, 6147, 498, 311, 15456, 705, 311, 220, 16, 15, 15, 11104, 304, 5256, 311, 279, 54217, 5362, 320, 2034, 5012, 568, 576, 2473, 374, 9767, 11, 1667, 279, 5535, 25463, 14310, 311, 5978, 697, 821, 374, 6092, 13, 1446, 646, 4583, 279, 2297, 315, 2621, 1352, 2860, 11, 476, 498, 646, 3947, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 34545, 1618, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 701, 476, 5155, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 13, 151645], "pred": "The U.S. Postal Service offers a change of address service that can be completed in as little as 1 minute. This service allows you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure your data is safe. You can complete the change of address form online, or you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Offic