{"id": "481", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "pred": "Based on the information provided, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may have caused Snapchat to lock your account, as they cannot guarantee your security. Additionally, Snapchat sends messages warning you about third-party apps before locking your account. To potentially regain access to your account, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may have caused Snapchat to lock your account, as they cannot guarantee your security. Additionally, Snapchat sends messages warning you about third-party apps before locking your account. To potentially regain access to your account, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Based on the information provided, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may have caused Snapchat to lock your account, as they cannot guarantee your security. Additionally, Snapchat sends messages warning you about third-party apps before locking your account. To potentially regain access to your account, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Based on the provided passage, a Snapchat account can be temporarily locked if third-party apps are used to access it. The passage states that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, which can lead to the account being locked. Additionally, the passage mentions that users who have been locked out of their accounts often receive a message from Snapchat warning them about the use of third-party apps.\"]", "time_sec": 11.547, "generation_time_seconds": 10.8128, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7251, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0821981132030487, "g_worst_claim": -0.0821981132030487, "g_content": -0.1293063521385193, "g_traj_mean": -0.07309360057115555}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0821981132030487, "g_worst_claim": -0.0821981132030487, "g_content": -0.1293063521385193, "g_traj_mean": -0.07309360057115555}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 2578, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 4220, 10500, 1231, 614, 8881, 55179, 311, 5296, 697, 2692, 11, 438, 807, 4157, 15440, 697, 4763, 13, 22406, 11, 55179, 21308, 6605, 9958, 498, 911, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1573, 37855, 697, 2692, 13, 2014, 13581, 48555, 2615, 311, 697, 2692, 11, 498, 1265, 53635, 279, 4843, 24031, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 697, 3671, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the information provided, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may have caused Snapchat to lock your account, as they cannot guarantee your security. Additionally, Snapchat sends messages warning you about third-party apps before locking your account. To potentially regain access to your account, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.166933551863822, "g_worst_claim": 0.19301880489696155, "g_content": 1.5407687187194825, "g_traj_mean": 1.2187432050704956}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 21085, 11, 264, 55179, 2692, 646, 387, 27092, 16061, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 576, 21085, 5302, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 892, 646, 2990, 311, 279, 2692, 1660, 16061, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 21085, 33845, 429, 3847, 879, 614, 1012, 16061, 700, 315, 862, 9618, 3545, 5258, 264, 1943, 504, 55179, 9958, 1105, 911, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the provided passage, a Snapchat account can be temporarily locked if third-party apps are used to access it. The passage states that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, which can lead to the account being locked. Additionally, the passage mentions that users who have been locked out of their accounts often receive a message from Snapchat warning them about the use of third-party apps.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8550084641149167, "g_worst_claim": 0.16662342018551296, "g_content": 1.2359188927544489, "g_traj_mean": 0.8936664462089539}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "482", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the reason for Snapchat temporarily locking your account is likely due to the use of third-party apps. These apps are not officially supported by Snapchat, and their developers might not provide necessary security features, which can leave your account vulnerable to hacking or unauthorized access. As a result, Snapchat may lock your account to protect your personal information and prevent further potential security risks.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Based on the provided passages, it seems that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat. The company is taking measures to prevent unauthorized access by third-party applications.\"]", "time_sec": 10.123, "generation_time_seconds": 9.4914, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6229, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08224298804998398, "g_worst_claim": -0.08224298804998398, "g_content": -0.12917269468307496, "g_traj_mean": -0.07311126589775085}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true,