{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Based on the information provided, the Snapchat account is temporarily locked because the user is using third-party apps to access Snapchat, which is not permitted by Snapchat. This practice compromises the security of the user's account and can lead to the account being locked.\"]", "time_sec": 8.866, "generation_time_seconds": 7.8926, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9683, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_worst_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_content": -0.13047705888748168, "g_traj_mean": -0.07305851578712463}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_worst_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_content": -0.13047705888748168, "g_traj_mean": -0.07305851578712463}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_worst_claim": -0.08215287327766418, "g_content": -0.13047705888748168, "g_traj_mean": -0.07305851578712463}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 11, 279, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 279, 1196, 374, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 11, 892, 374, 537, 15129, 553, 55179, 13, 1096, 6588, 91446, 279, 4763, 315, 279, 1196, 594, 2692, 323, 646, 2990, 311, 279, 2692, 1660, 16061, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the information provided, the Snapchat account is temporarily locked because the user is using third-party apps to access Snapchat, which is not permitted by Snapchat. This practice compromises the security of the user's account and can lead to the account being locked.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6852025009610798, "g_worst_claim": -0.050853891032082696, "g_content": 1.3600933240807576, "g_traj_mean": 0.7514554262161255}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps can put your account and your friends at risk, and Snapchat does not guarantee security when using such apps. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, it could be because of a third-party app you are using. The only way to get your account back is to uninstall the app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 9.278, "generation_time_seconds": 8.6916, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5763, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_worst_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_content": -0.13029396533966064, "g_traj_mean": -0.07342619448900223}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [7771, 55179, 2692, 1231, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 4220, 10500, 646, 2182, 697, 2692, 323, 697, 4780, 518, 5214, 11, 323, 55179, 1558, 537, 15440, 4763, 979, 1667, 1741, 10500, 13, 1416, 498, 614, 1012, 16061, 700, 315, 697, 2692, 323, 1513, 944, 1414, 3170, 11, 432, 1410, 387, 1576, 315, 264, 4843, 24031, 906, 498, 525, 1667, 13, 576, 1172, 1616, 311, 633, 697, 2692, 1182, 374, 311, 53635, 279, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 697, 3671, 13, 151645], "pred": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps can put your account and your friends at risk, and Snapchat does not guarantee security when using such apps. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, it could be because of a third-party app you are using. The only way to get your account back is to uninstall the app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1220918081764484, "g_worst_claim": 0.28272247314453125, "g_content": 1.2663456766228927, "g_traj_mean": 1.1539154052734375}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_worst_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_content": -0.13029396533966064, "g_traj_mean": -0.07342619448900223}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_worst_claim": -0.08258243650197983, "g_content": -0.13029396533966064, "g_traj_mean": -0.07342619448900223}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.96, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "488", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "pred": "By considering these points, travelers can plan a comprehensive and enjoyable trip to Germany.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "By considering these points, travelers can plan a comprehensive and enjoyable trip to Germany.", "cot": "[\"To plan a trip to Germany, consider the following steps:\\n\\n1. **Budgeting**: Look for budget travel tips to save money on flights, hotels, and sightseeing. For example, you can find discounts on flights and cheap hotels and hostels in Germany.\\n\\n2. **Visa Requirements**: Check the visa requirements for Germany to ensure you have the necessary documents before traveling.\\n\\n3. **Traveling with Pets**: If you're traveling with pets, research air travel with pets, vaccinations for pets, and pet-friendly hotels in Germany. Also, learn the rules for pets on German trains.\\n\\n4. **Cultural Understanding**: Learn about German life and culture to make your trip more enjoyable and rewarding. This can include understanding the customs, traditions, and daily life in Germany.\\n\\n5. **Sightseeing and Activities**: Plan your itinerary based on what you want to see and do in Germany. This could include visiting famous landmarks, museums, and historical sites.\\n\\n6. **Transportation**: Consider how you will get around Germany, whether by public transportation, car rental, or other means.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can plan a well-rounded and enjoyable trip to Germany.\", \"To plan a trip to Germany, it's important to gather information about visa requirements, the best times to visit, and what to see. Additionally, budget travel tips can help save money on flights, accommodation, and dining. For travelers with pets, research air travel regulations, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. Understanding German life and culture can greatly enhance the trip, making it more enjoyable and rewarding.\\n\\nAnswer: Plan your trip to Germany by checking visa requirements, choosing the best time to visit, and exploring cultural events. Budget travel tips can help with flight, accommodation, and dining expenses. For pet owners, research air travel regulations, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. Understanding German life and culture will make your trip more enjoyable and rewarding.\", \"Based on the provided passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should consider several key aspects:\\n\\n1. **Budget**: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodation (like cheap hotels and hostels), and food. Look for discounts and explore cost-effective options for sightseeing and transportation.\\n\\n2. **Visa Requirements**: Familiarize yourself with the visa requirements before you go to Germany. \\n\\n3. **Traveling with Pets**: If you're traveling with pets, check the rules for air travel, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. \\n\\n4. **Timing**: Decide when and where to go in Germany, based on your interests. Research the best seasons and locations to visit.\\n\\n5. **Cultural Understanding**: The more you know about German life and culture, the more enjoyable and rewarding your trip will be. Learn about German customs and traditions to enrich your experience.\\n\\n6. **Getting Around**: Explore options for transportation within Germany to ensure a smooth travel experience.\\n\\nThese steps, combined with the specific examples from the passages, will help you plan a well-rounded and budget-friendly trip to Germany.\", \"Based on the provided passages and general knowledge, to plan a trip to Germany, one should consider the following aspects:\\n\\n1. **Budget Planning**: Look for budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodations, and sightseeing in Germany. Check for discounts and affordable options like budget flights and cheap hotels and hostels.\\n\\n2. **Travel Tips**: Review helpful Germany travel tips to prepare for various aspects of the trip. This includes understanding visa requirements, deciding on the best time and places to visit, and familiarizing yourself with German cities and their attractions.\\n\\n3. **Pet-Friendly Travel**: If traveling with pets, consider tips for air travel with pets, vaccinations, and finding pet-friendly accommodations and travel services in Germany.\\n\\n4. **Cultural Understanding**: Learn about German life and culture to enrich your travel experience and make it more enjoyable and rewarding. This includes understanding German customs, traditions, and the unique opportunities that Germany offers.\\n\\nBy considering these points, travelers can plan a comprehensive and enjoyable trip to Germany.\"]", "time_sec": 30.786, "generation_time_seconds": 29.832, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9474, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3119, 264, 8411, 311, 9856, 11, 2908, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 62901, 287, 95518, 9192, 369, 8039, 5821, 10414, 311, 3581, 3220, 389, 24908, 11, 24332, 11, 323, 13929, 65054, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 498, 646, 1477, 31062, 389, 24908, 323, 11872, 24332, 323, 3468, 2010, 304, 9856, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 3120, 64, 33784, 95518, 4248, 279, 26655, 8502, 369, 9856, 311, 5978, 498, 614, 279, 5871, 9293, 1573, 20971, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 40248, 287, 448, 35886, 95518, 1416, 498, 2299, 20971, 448, 25103, 11, 3412, 3720, 5821, 448, 25103, 11, 90871, 369, 25103, 11, 323, 6753, 21896, 24332, 304, 9856, 13, 7281, 11, 3960, 279, 5601, 369, 25103, 389