{"id": "489", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "gt": "You can see who liked your tweets by using tracking websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. These sites can give you an idea of who is favouriting your tweets. Alternatively, you can also set up notifications on Twitter itself. By going to your account settings and clicking on the notifications link, you can arrange to be notified via email whenever someone likes one of your tweets.", "pred": "To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that can check who favorites tweets.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that can check who favorites tweets.", "cot": "[\"To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.\", \"You can tell who liked your tweet by visiting a website that can track who favorited your tweets.\", \"To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that can check who favorites tweets.\", \"To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that tracks favorites. For example, you can use Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These sites allow you to see who is favoriting your tweets and which tweets you and others are also favoriting. This can help you find other Twitter users to follow or just see what tweets people like of yours.\"]", "time_sec": 10.856, "generation_time_seconds": 10.2433, "selection_time_seconds": 0.604, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 1075, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 80941, 11870, 70485, 13, 4220, 13037, 2138, 498, 311, 3754, 879, 374, 4694, 5853, 697, 23150, 476, 279, 1852, 23150, 438, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.107124226314382, "g_worst_claim": 1.3776043483189173, "g_content": 2.1643495559692383, "g_traj_mean": 2.109009265899658}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [2610, 646, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 553, 16721, 264, 3910, 429, 646, 3754, 879, 4694, 1608, 697, 23150, 13, 151645], "pred": "You can tell who liked your tweet by visiting a website that can track who favorited your tweets.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7021402359008788, "g_worst_claim": 1.7021402359008788, "g_content": 2.1308441162109375, "g_traj_mean": 1.5890769958496094}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 700, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 429, 646, 1779, 879, 26574, 23150, 13, 151645], "pred": "To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that can check who favorites tweets.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7268906633059182, "g_worst_claim": 1.589542269706726, "g_content": 2.8566763401031494, "g_traj_mean": 1.630475401878357}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 700, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 429, 13918, 26574, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 498, 646, 990, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 80941, 11870, 70485, 13, 4220, 6594, 2138, 498, 311, 1490, 879, 374, 4694, 5853, 697, 23150, 323, 892, 23150, 498, 323, 3800, 525, 1083, 4694, 5853, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 498, 1477, 1008, 6271, 3847, 311, 1795, 476, 1101, 1490, 1128, 23150, 1251, 1075, 315, 18316, 13, 151645], "pred": "To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website that tracks favorites. For example, you can use Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These sites allow you to see who is favoriting your tweets and which tweets you and others are also favoriting. This can help you find other Twitter users to follow or just see what tweets people like of yours.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0969678868878865, "g_worst_claim": 1.410643204398777, "g_content": 1.8343267440795898, "g_traj_mean": 1.972936987876892}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "490", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, you can track who liked your tweet by using websites like Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. Additionally, you can set up your Twitter account to receive email notifications whenever someone marks one of your tweets as their favorite.", "pred": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "cot": "[\"To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.\", \"If you want to know who liked your tweet, you can use websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who favorited your tweets or which tweets you and others are also favoriting.\", \"To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. After logging in, you can view the tweets that have been favorited and who liked them. This information can help you find other Twitter users to follow or see what tweets people like of yours!\", \"You can use websites like favotter.net or favstar.fm to track who liked your tweet.\"]", "time_sec": 10.926, "generation_time_seconds": 10.1655, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7542, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 1075, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 80941, 11870, 70485, 13, 4220, 13037, 2138, 498, 311, 3754, 879, 374, 4694, 5853, 697, 23150, 476, 279, 1852, 231