7, 1075, 9244, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 9244, 11870, 70485, 311, 3754, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 13, 151645], "pred": "You can use websites like favotter.net or favstar.fm to track who liked your tweet.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.7910749435424806, "g_worst_claim": 2.7910749435424806, "g_content": 2.498181104660034, "g_traj_mean": 2.6468777656555176}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 49.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "491", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "gt": "You can tell who liked your tweet by using websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm, or by going to Twitter.com and logging in with your Twitter username and password. Once logged in, click on your Twitter name, located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, then click on Settings and finally Blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. By setting this feature, you will receive an email notification whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "pred": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "cot": "[\"To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.\", \"To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These sites allow you to track the people who favorite your tweets or the same tweets as you.\", \"To tell who liked your tweet, you can:\\n\\n1. Use websites like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm, which allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets.\\n2. Set up email notifications on Twitter where you receive notifications whenever someone marks one of your tweets as a favorite.\\n3. Go to Twitter.com, log in with your Twitter username and password, and click on your Twitter name located on the upper right-hand corner of your account's Home page.\\n4. Click on the Settings option that appears in the drop-down menu.\\n5. Click on the blue Notifications link at the top of the screen to set up email notifications for favorites.\\n6. For popular users, you might receive a lot of email notifications.\", \"Based on the provided passage, you can tell who liked your tweet by using specific websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track favorited tweets, which can help you find other Twitter users who have favorited your tweets or the same tweets as you. Additionally, you can set up notifications on your Twitter account to be notified via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as a favorite.\"]", "time_sec": 15.515, "generation_time_seconds": 14.6203, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8889, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 1075, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 80941, 11870, 70485, 13, 4220, 13037, 2138, 498, 311, 3754, 879, 374, 4694, 5853, 697, 23150, 476, 279, 1852, 23150, 438, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "To tell who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These websites allow you to track who is favoriting your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0673182212619254, "g_worst_claim": 1.3320022310529436, "g_content": 2.0354115622384206, "g_traj_mean": 2.0730841159820557}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 700, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 3910, 1075, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 476, 80941, 11870, 70485, 13, 4220, 6594, 2138, 498, 311, 3754, 279, 1251, 879, 6930, 697, 23150, 476, 279, 1852, 23150, 438, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "To find out who liked your tweet, you can use a website like Favotter.net or Favstar.fm. These sites allow you to track the people who favorite your tweets or the same tweets as you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.1046219472996675, "g_worst_claim": 1.300755450600072, "g_content": 2.283032989501953, "g_traj_mean": 2.04364