{"id": "532", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an arm by creating a makeshift sling, securing a bandana over a wounded arm or leg, closing severe wounds in emergency situations, and removing splinters.", "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for a variety of purposes, including immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping to keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to fasten two pieces of fabric or clothing together and can be utilized for various other purposes that may not be immediately apparent.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for a variety of purposes, including immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping to keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to fasten two pieces of fabric or clothing together and can be utilized for various other purposes that may not be immediately apparent.", "cot": "[\"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. And I’ve removed more than one splinter in the wilderness using a trusty safety pin.\", \"safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\", \"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for a variety of purposes, including immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping to keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to fasten two pieces of fabric or clothing together and can be utilized for various other purposes that may not be immediately apparent.\", \"Safety pins are used in a first aid box for various purposes. They can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to the chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. In dire circumstances, they can help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters.\"]", "time_sec": 16.147, "generation_time_seconds": 15.2354, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9059, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [73037, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 76341, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 9767, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 13, 2379, 646, 1496, 387, 1483, 311, 1492, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 13, 1597, 358, 3982, 6963, 803, 1091, 825, 12503, 2245, 304, 279, 48262, 1667, 264, 6950, 88, 7149, 8983, 13, 151645], "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe 