{"id": "533", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an injured arm, securing a bandana over a bleeding wound, and helping to keep a severe wound closed. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box can be used for several purposes. For instance, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. In certain dire circumstances, safety pins can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed instead of using stitches.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Safety pins in a first aid box can be used for several purposes. For instance, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. In certain dire circumstances, safety pins can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed instead of using stitches.", "cot": "[\"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. And I’ve removed more than one splinter in the wilderness using a trusty safety pin.\", \"Safety pins in a first aid box can be used for several purposes. For instance, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. In certain dire circumstances, safety pins can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed instead of using stitches.\", \"In a first aid box, safety pins can be used for several purposes. They can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg and help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.\", \"Safety pins are used for a variety of purposes in a first aid box. They can be utilized to immobilize an arm by securing the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to the chest to create a makeshift arm sling. Safety pins can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. In cases of severe wounds, safety pins can be employed to keep the wound closed, acting as a substitute for stitches in dire situations. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.\"]", "time_sec": 17.363, "generation_time_seconds": 16.4445, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9101, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [73037, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 76341, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 9767, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 13, 2379, 646, 1496, 387, 1483, 311, 1492, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 13, 1597, 358, 3982, 6963, 803, 1091, 825, 12503, 2245, 304, 279, 48262, 1667, 264, 6950, 88, 7149, 8983, 13, 151645], "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can b