{"id": "534", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for the following purposes:\n\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to create a makeshift arm sling (Passage 2).\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg (Passage 2).\n3. Helping to keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances (Passage 2).\n4. Removing splinters (Passage 3).\n\nThe passages mention these specific uses for safety pins in a first aid context, but do not provide any additional information regarding their use in a survival kit.", "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes. According to the passage, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. Additionally, they can be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. The passage also mentions that safety pins can be used to remove splinters.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes. According to the passage, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. Additionally, they can be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. The passage also mentions that safety pins can be used to remove splinters.", "cot": "[\"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. And I’ve removed more than one splinter in the wilderness using a trusty safety pin.\", \"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes. According to the passage, they can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. Additionally, they can be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. The passage also mentions that safety pins can be used to remove splinters.\", \"Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. Safety pins can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and they can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.\", \"Safety pins in a first aid box can be used for several purposes. They can be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can also be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. Additionally, they can be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\"]", "time_sec": 17.452, "generation_time_seconds": 16.7721, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6737, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [73037, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 76341, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 9767, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663