{"id": "542", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "pred": "People born in October are described as having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. Additionally, they are known for their ability to work hard and crave stability and security.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "People born in October are described as having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. Additionally, they are known for their ability to work hard and crave stability and security.", "cot": "[\"People born in October are described as having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. Additionally, they are known for their ability to work hard and crave stability and security.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"People who are born in October have a great interest in form and structure, which makes them good at professions that combine art and structure such as architects, interior decorators, designers, etc. They can also be found as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals who are at their best when they are in control or working on their own. They have the necessary people skills to get along with others, although their impatience may occasionally come through. Additionally, people born in October can have the traits of being restless at heart but also craving stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October are said to have the following traits:\\n\\n1. October 14: Individuals born today have a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions like architecture, interior decoration, design, or any other career that combines art and structure.\\n\\n2. October 5: Born on this date, individuals are described as restless at heart but crave stability and security, which motivates them to work hard in their chosen fields.\\n\\nThese traits are portrayed through general characteristics derived from Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy, as mentioned in the passages.\"]", "time_sec": 15.86, "generation_time_seconds": 15.0116, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8409, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [15919, 9223, 304, 6527, 525, 7481, 438, 3432, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 1352, 323, 5944, 11, 3259, 1105, 14452, 369, 68692, 429, 15963, 1947, 323, 5944, 13, 2379, 525, 1083, 7481, 438, 2393, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 11, 448, 264, 21933, 369, 1660, 304, 2524, 476, 3238, 28135, 13, 22406, 11, 807, 525, 3881, 369, 862, 5726, 311, 975, 2588, 323, 80313, 19753, 323, 4763, 13, 1516