{"id": "546", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* Interest in form and structure (Passage 1)\n* Success-oriented and charming (Passage 2)\n* Personal power and impatience (Passage 2)\n* Crave stability and security (Passage 3)\n\nHowever, it's important to note that these are generalizations based on astrological signs and not all individuals will exhibit these traits. Additionally, there is no information about specific personality traits or characteristics of people born in October. Therefore, I cannot provide a more detailed answer based solely on the given passages.", "pred": "People born in October tend to have a great interest in form and structure, making them good candidates for professions such as architects, interior decorators, designers, or any job that combines art and structure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "People born in October tend to have a great interest in form and structure, making them good candidates for professions such as architects, interior decorators, designers, or any job that combines art and structure.", "cot": "[\"People born in October are described as having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. Additionally, they are known for their ability to work hard and crave stability and security.\", \"People born in October are described to have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them good at professions that combine art and structure. They are also associated with being success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals who are best when in control, their own boss, or working on their own. Occasionally, their impatience might come through.\", \"People born in October have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, which makes them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. Additionally, they are known for their success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful characteristics. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. However, they may occasionally show impatience towards others.\", \"People born in October tend to have a great interest in form and structure, making them good candidates for professions such as architects, interior decorators, designers, or any job that combines art and structure.\"]", "time_sec": 13.285, "generation_time_seconds": 12.7224, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5558, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [15919, 9223, 304, 6527, 525, 7481, 438, 3432, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 1352, 323, 5944, 11, 3259, 1105, 14452, 369, 68692, 429, 15963, 1947, 323, 5944, 13, 2379, 525, 1083, 7481, 438, 2393, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 11, 448, 264, 21933, 369, 1660, 304, 2524, 476, 3238, 28135, 13, 22406, 11, 807, 525, 3881, 369, 862, 5726, 311, 975, 2588, 323, 80313, 19753, 323, 4763, 13, 151645], "pred": "People born in October are described as having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. Additionally, they are known for their ability to work hard and crave stability and security.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.3141692534700007, "g_worst_claim": 1.2640574960147632, "g_content": 4.113508097330729, "g_traj_mean": 2.0802197456359863}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [15919, 9223, 304, 6527, 525, 7481, 311, 614, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 323, 7912, 369, 135