{"id": "554", "question": "why does the company Oracle have 2 CEOs", "gt": "Oracle has two CEOs because the former CEO, Larry Ellison, stepped down and chose to have two of his co-presidents, Safra Catz and Mark Hurd, share the role of CEO.", "pred": "Oracle has two CEOs because Larry Ellison, the founder of the company, unexpectedly announced that he was stepping down from his CEO post and named Safra Catz and Mark Hurd as co-presidents to replace him.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Oracle has two CEOs because Larry Ellison, the founder of the company, unexpectedly announced that he was stepping down from his CEO post and named Safra Catz and Mark Hurd as co-presidents to replace him.", "cot": "[\"Oracle has two CEOs because Larry Ellison, the founder of the company, unexpectedly announced that he was stepping down from his CEO post and named Safra Catz and Mark Hurd as co-presidents to replace him.\", \"Oracle has 2 CEOs because Larry Ellison stepped down as CEO and appointed Mark Hurd and Safra Catz, the co-presidents of Oracle, to share the role of CEO.\", \"Oracle has two CEOs because Larry Ellison, the founder, announced his step down from the CEO position. Safra Catz and Mark Hurd, co-presidents of Oracle, will share the role of CEO.\", \"Oracle has 2 CEOs because Safra Catz and Mark Hurd will share the role of CEO as co-presidents.\"]", "time_sec": 10.503, "generation_time_seconds": 9.682, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8128, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [48663, 702, 1378, 74217, 1576, 29290, 81647, 11, 279, 18996, 315, 279, 2813, 11, 50609, 7228, 429, 566, 572, 35467, 1495, 504, 806, 12156, 1736, 323, 6941, 12582, 956, 17358, 89, 323, 4389, 472, 16081, 438, 1062, 79776, 6880, 311, 8290, 1435, 13, 151645], "pred": "Oracle has two CEOs because Larry Ellison, the founder of the company, unexpectedly announce