{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "To execute the Ball Juggle skill move on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To execute the Ball Juggle skill move on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "cot": "[\"To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to execute the Ball Juggle skill move, you should hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"To execute a skill move on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, to perform a Ball Juggle while standing, hold LT and tap RB.\", \"To execute the Ball Juggle skill move on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations provided: LT (hold) + RB (tap) for the Ball Juggle move.\"]", "time_sec": 10.618, "generation_time_seconds": 9.7372, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8731, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 2736, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 990, 3151, 3137, 27459, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 311, 9026, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 9947, 3271, 11, 498, 1265, 3331, 279, 34469, 3137, 323, 15239, 279, 27974, 3137, 13, 151645], "pred": "To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use sp