{"id": "572", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "pred": "To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to execute the Ball Juggle skill move, you should hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to execute the Ball Juggle skill move, you should hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "cot": "[\"To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to execute the Ball Juggle skill move, you should hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"To execute the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, to perform the Ball Juggle skill move, hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"To execute the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"To do the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\"]", "time_sec": 9.403, "generation_time_seconds": 8.6824, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7137, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 2736, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 99