on.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.093414455979735, "g_worst_claim": 0.805128983088902, "g_content": 1.1333173605111928, "g_traj_mean": 1.0697472095489502}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "573", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate rats and mice from your home and prevent them from returning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate rats and mice from your home and prevent them from returning.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate rats and mice from your home and prevent them from returning.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a critical step to getting rid of mice. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the holes to get back into your house.\"]", "time_sec": 10.924, "generation_time_seconds": 10.2021, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7128, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7064257394699822, "g_worst_claim": 1.2826335089547294, "g_content": 2.4455114665784334, "g_traj_mean": 1.8536016941070557}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 323, 25349, 1007, 894, 4343, 3501, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 22406, 11, 3960, 1246, 311, 21725, 31410, 323, 23627, 504, 697, 2114, 323, 5358, 1105, 504, 13451, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate rats and mice from your home and prevent them from returning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.591837469896079, "g_worst_claim": 1.2545200075422014, "g_content": 2.462062018258231, "g_traj_mean": 1.6470129489898682}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 374, 264, 9023, 3019, 311, 3709, 9279, 315, 23627, 13, 386, 558, 646, 1602, 6157, 1896, 705, 21682, 304, 697, 2114, 323, 1191, 66710, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a critical step to getting rid of mice. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8684720569874815, "g_worst_claim": 1.2826335089547294, "g_content": 2.241373825073242, "g_traj_mean": 1.958396553993225}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 19766, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. You can use steel wool to prevent mice from using the holes to get back into your house.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6841761087913163, "g_worst_claim": 1.2826335089547294, "g_content": 2.214507159064798, "g_traj_mean": 1.7238482236862183}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.82, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Here are some steps you can follow:\n\n1. Identify all entry points where mice can enter your house.\n2. Seal these entry points. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from getting back into your house through the holes.\n3. Remove any food sources that mice might use to access your home.\n4. Learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Here are some steps you can follow:\n\n1. Identify all entry points where mice can enter your house.\n2. Seal these entry points. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from getting back into your house through the holes.\n3. Remove any food sources that mice might use to access your home.\n4. Learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Here are some steps you can follow:\\n\\n1. Identify all entry points where mice can enter your house.\\n2. Seal these entry points. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from getting back into your house through the holes.\\n3. Remove any food sources that mice might use to access your home.\\n4. Learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Mice can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Mice can use entry points, such as pipes or vents, to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside these entry points before sealing them off to prevent mice from returning. Since rats and mice will quickly take advantage of any source of food or shelter, it is important to find and eliminate any food sources and prevent them from returning to your home.\", \"The best way to get rid of mice is to act fast and take immediate action. This is a critical step to prevent mice from taking up residence in your home and nesting.\"]", "time_sec": 13.488, "generation_time_seconds": 12.703, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7785, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.528263927641369, "g_worst_claim": 1.063863890511649, "g_content": 2.413752706427323, "g_traj_mean": 1.7690138816833496}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 5692, 525, 1045, 7354, 498, 646, 1795, 1447, 16, 13, 64547, 678, 4343, 3501, 1380, 23627, 646, 3725, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 52525, 1493, 4343, 3501, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 3709, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 1526, 279, 19766, 624, 18, 13, 10783, 894, 3607, 8173, 429, 23627, 2578, 990, 311, 2615, 697, 2114, 624, 19, 13,