{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action, use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using entry points to get back into your house, and ensure that any food or shelter available to these rodents is eliminated.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, immediate action is essential. Take steps to prevent them from finding entry points into your home. For example, consider using steel wool inside pipes or vents before sealing them off to prevent mice from returning. Additionally, removing any food sources and ensuring that no openings exist where mice can nest is crucial.\", \"The best way to get rid of mice is to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. Steel wool can be used to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into the house. It is also important to remove any food sources and shelter that rats and mice might use.\"]", "time_sec": 12.058, "generation_ti