de pipes or vents before sealing them off to prevent mice from returning. Additionally, removing any food sources and ensuring that no openings exist where mice can nest is crucial.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.489913704860303, "g_worst_claim": 0.8383858020489032, "g_content": 1.8414960588727678, "g_traj_mean": 1.5682212114334106}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 1850, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 374, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 323, 25349, 1007, 894, 4343, 3501, 13, 12500, 38540, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 279, 3753, 13, 1084, 374, 1083, 2989, 311, 4057, 894, 3607, 8173, 323, 22906, 429, 31410, 323, 23627, 2578, 990, 13, 151645], "pred": "The best way to get rid of mice is to take immediate action and seal off any entry points. Steel wool can be used to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into the house. It is also important to remove any food sources and shelter that rats and mice might use.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4434977548164234, "g_worst_claim": 1.0417280197143555, "g_content": 2.352991231282552, "g_traj_mean": 1.4455279111862183}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "576", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to quickly get rid of mice:\n\n1. Take immediate action to get rid of mice as soon as possible, as they can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting (Passage 1).\n2. Seal off all entry points into your home, including holes around pipes and vents, using steel wool to prevent mice from getting back in (Passage 2).\n3. Get rid of any sources of food for mice and rats, as they will quickly take advantage of any food left behind by humans (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide specific instructions on how to quickly get rid of mice once they have entered a home.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, one should take immediate action. Ensure that any entry points into the house are sealed off to prevent mice from entering. Consider using steel wool pads in pipes or vents before sealing them to add extra protection against persistent mice. Additionally, eliminating any food sources and discarding any potential shelter can prevent mice from returning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, one should take immediate action. Ensure that any entry points into the house are sealed off to prevent mice from entering. Consider using steel wool pads in pipes or vents before sealing them to add extra protection against persistent mice. Additionally, eliminating any food sources and discarding any potential shelter can prevent mice from returning.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\", \"Get rid of mice quickly by sealing off entry points, using steel wool as a preventative measure, and eliminating any food sources.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. You need to seal off any entry points where mice can enter your house. For example, consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off. This will prevent the mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Steel wool pads will add an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, one should take immediate action. Ensure that any entry points into the house are sealed off to prevent mice from entering. Consider using steel wool pads in pipes or vents before sealing them to add extra protection against persistent mice. Additionally, eliminating any food sources and discarding any potential shelter can prevent mice from returning.\"]", "time_sec": 12.644, "generation_time_seconds": 11.7868, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8491, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can use steel wool pads to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6022977374848866, "g_worst_claim": 1.2946820940290178, "g_content": 2.4056922511050574, "g_traj_mean": 1.824709177017212}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1949, 9279, 315, 23627, 6157, 553, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 11, 1667, 9509, 38540, 438, 264, 96320, 6629, 11, 323, 39499, 894, 3607, 8173, 13, 151645], "pred": "Get rid of mice quickly by sealing off entry points, using steel wool as a preventative measure, and eliminating any food sources.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4739716317918565, "g_worst_claim": 0.5392914613087972, "g_content": 2.2540369669596356, "g_traj_mean": 1.5119731426239014}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 1184, 311, 25349, 1007, 894, 4343, 3501, 1380, 23627, 646, 3725, 697, 3753, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 2908, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 498, 25349, 432, 1007, 13, 1096, 686, 5358, 279, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 912, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. You need to seal off any entry points where mice can enter your house. For example, consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off. This will prevent the mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Steel wool pads will add an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9359412877017228, "g_worst_claim": 0.8414122899373372, "g_content": 2.7967063903808596, "g_traj_mean": 2.033397912979126}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 825, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 29279, 429, 894, 4343, 3501, 1119, 279, 3753, 525, 19046, 1007, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 16262, 13, 21144, 1667, 9509, 38540, 35995, 304, 31175, 476, 80207, 1573, 65834, 1105, 311, 912, 4960, 9135, 2348, 24999, 23627, 13, 22406, 11, 39499, 894, 3607, 8173, 323, 2560, 28410, 894, 4650, 22906, 646, 5358, 23627, 504, 13451, 13, 151645], "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, one should take immediate action. Ensure that any entry points into the house are sealed off to prevent mice from entering. Consider using steel wool pads in pipes or vents before sealing them to add extra protection against persistent mice. Additionally, eliminating any food sources and discarding any potential shelter can prevent mice from returning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3671747493298672, "g_worst_claim": 0.30045399946324963, "g_conte