{"id": "592", "question": "where does 1099-patr go on 1040", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the answer to the question \"Where does 1099-PATR go on 1040?\" is:\n\nSchedule C, Schedule F, or Form 4835.\n\nAccording to the instructions for Form 1099-PATR, patronage dividends and other distributions in boxes 1, 2, 3, and 5 from a cooperative are reported on one of these forms.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 6.385, "generation_time_seconds": 5.711, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6694, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_worst_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_content": -0.004557467252016068, "g_traj_mean": -0.002172739477828145}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_worst_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_content": -0.004557467252016068, "g_traj_mean": -0.002172739477828145}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_worst_claim": -0.0023846616968512535, "g_content": -0.004557467252016068, "g_traj_mean": -0.002172739477828145}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 31