{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, follow these strategies:\n\n1. Stay close: Maintain close proximity to the tall person to limit their shot opportunities.\n\n2. Slide your feet: Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent.\n\n3. Keep a wedge: Defend against a tall player by keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n\n4. Use an experienced player's tips: Learn from an experienced basketball player's defense strategies.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, follow these strategies:\n\n1. Stay close: Maintain close proximity to the tall person to limit their shot opportunities.\n\n2. Slide your feet: Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent.\n\n3. Keep a wedge: Defend against a tall player by keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n\n4. Use an experienced player's tips: Learn from an experienced basketball player's defense strategies.", "cot": "[\"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, follow these strategies:\\n\\n1. Stay close: Maintain close proximity to the tall person to limit their shot opportunities.\\n\\n2. Slide your feet: Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent.\\n\\n3. Keep a wedge: Defend against a tall player by keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n\\n4. Use an experienced player's tips: Learn from an experienced basketball player's defense strategies.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, you can upload a video on basketball defense for tips from an experienced basketball player.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.\"]", "time_sec": 12.68, "generation_time_seconds": 11.8029, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8716, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 4717, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 1105, 11, 22040, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 11, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 13, 151645], "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.274157831498555, "g_worst_claim": 1.193983554840088, "g_content": 2.454299079047309, "g_traj_mean": 2.03497052192688}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 1795, 1493, 14830, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 3265, 25, 86377, 3265, 36743, 311, 279, 16217, 1697, 311, 3930, 862, 6552, 10488, 382, 