{"id": "630", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to a tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to a tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "cot": "[\"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, follow these steps:\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, particularly near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to maintain proximity and limit shot opportunities.\\n3. If the tall player is taller than you, go with the situation and use the cards you are dealt, as advised by Kareem Abdul Jabbar Jr., who is a 6’6 guard.\\n4. To defend against a tall player, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player, following t