{"id": "631", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief answer to the question \"How to guard a tall person in basketball\":\n\nTo guard a tall person in basketball, it's important to stay as close as possible to them when they're near the three-point line. Slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against them effectively.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.", "cot": "[\"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"Answer: To guard a tall player in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, one should stay as close as possible to the tall player and actively slide their feet from side to side to stay near the opponent and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player can help in defending against a tall player.\", \"Stay as close as possible to the tall person when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\"]"