{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "Health benefits to jalapeno peppers include:\n\n1. Pain relief properties.\n2. Potential for weight loss.\n3. Natural nasal decongestant.\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. High content of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n\nThese benefits are supported by their high capsaicin content, which is responsible for their heat levels and various health effects.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Health benefits to jalapeno peppers include:\n\n1. Pain relief properties.\n2. Potential for weight loss.\n3. Natural nasal decongestant.\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. High content of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n\nThese benefits are supported by their high capsaicin content, which is responsible for their heat levels and various health effects.", "cot": "[\"Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Jalapenos offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Health benefits of jalapeños include pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Health benefits to jalapeno peppers include:\\n\\n1. Pain relief properties.\\n2. Potential for weight loss.\\n3. Natural nasal decongestant.\\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\\n5. High content of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n\\nThese benefits are supported by their high capsaicin content, which is responsible for their heat levels and various health effects.\"]", "time_sec": 11.731, "generation_time_seconds": 11.2652, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4591, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [14542, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7171744651780674, "g_worst_claim": 0.7201120058695475, "g_content": 2.400822957356771, "g_traj_mean": 1.4691323041915894}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [41, 278, 391, 70870, 3010, 264, 8045, 315, 2820, 7567, 11, 2670, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 13, 2379, 525, 1083, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Jalapenos offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5268999619769992