{"id": "638", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, and potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapenos can help defend heart health and provide cardiovascular benefits.", "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "cot": "[\"Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers have several health benefits:\\n\\n1. **Pain Relief**: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which can help in alleviating pain, as mentioned in the second passage.\\n\\n2. **Weight Loss Alternative**: The second passage indicates that jalapeños are a spicy weight loss alternative.\\n\\n3. **Natural Nasal Decongestant**: Jalapeños can help with nasal congestion, as stated in the second passage.\\n\\n4. **Prevent Heart Disease and Cancer**: According to the third passage, jalapeños may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n\\n5. **Full of Vitamins, Minerals, and Antioxidants**: The second passage mentions that jalapeños are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n\\n6. **Cardiovascular Health Benefits**: The third passage specifies that jalapeños are beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attack, strokes, and high blood pressure.\\n\\n7. **Overall Health Maintenance**: The first passage notes that jalapeños are one of the healthiest vegetables, implying they can contribute to overall health maintenance.\\n\\nAnswer: Health benefits of jalapeños include pain relief, being a spicy weight loss alternative, being a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease and cancer, being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and offering cardiovascular health benefits.\", \"Answer: Jalapeno peppers offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, potential weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, and support for cardiovascular health. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Specifically, jalapenos may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\", \"Jalapeno peppers have several health benefits. They contain high levels of capsaicin, which is responsible for their spicy heat. Capsaicin is known for its potential effects on cardiovascular health, offering benefits like preventing heart attacks and strokes. Additionally, they can help with weight loss due to their spicy nature, which can increase metabolism. They also have pain-killing properties, which can be useful. Furthermore, jalapeno peppers are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, contributing to overall health and potentially aiding in weight loss.\"]", "time_sec": 21.151, "generation_time_seconds": 20.5011, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6411, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [14542, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.70642222126497, "g_worst_claim": 0.731511116027832, "g_content": 2.3695176442464194, "g_traj_mean": 1.445842981338501}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 2027, 14529, 57473, 614, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 47, 466, 52395, 95518, 71895, 2027, 18219, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 304, 45549, 22897, 6646, 11, 438, 9733, 304, 279, 2086, 21085, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 8295, 24704, 41109, 95518, 576, 2086, 21085, 14807, 429, 75974, 2027, 18219, 525, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 54281, 38222, 278, 1581, 443, 6969, 517, 95518, 71895, 2027, 18219, 646, 1492, 448, 71088, 54046, 11, 438, 10982, 304, 279, 2086, 21085, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 4703, 684, 17965, 30874, 323, 25153, 95518, 10548, 311, 279, 4843, 21085, 11, 75974, 2027, 18219, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 9432, 315, 28460, 37825, 11, 83786, 11, 323, 6755, 41551, 1783, 95518, 576, 2086, 21085, 33845, 429, 75974, 2027, 18219, 525, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 5770, 815, 32845, 6267, 38095, 95518, 576, 4843, 21085, 29102, 429, 75974, 2027, 18219, 525, 23699, 369, 40613, 2820, 11, 10476, 311, 10505, 2348, 4746, 3359, 11, 52472, 11, 323, 1550, 6543, 7262, 382, 22, 13, 3070, 27489, 6267, 38206, 95518, 576, 1156, 21085, 8388, 429, 75974, 2027, 18219, 525, 825, 315, 279, 2820, 13438, 23880, 11, 72867, 807, 646, 16792, 311, 8084, 2820, 13404, 382, 16141, 25, 6267, 7567, 315, 75974, 2027, 18219, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 1660, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 1660, 264, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 13581, 26160, 4746, 8457, 323, 9387, 11, 1660, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 11, 323, 10004, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeños include pain relief, being a spicy weight loss alternative, being a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease and cancer, being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and offering cardiovascular health benefits.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6776070711712042, "g_worst_claim": -0.08145197800227574, "g_content": 0.9574970446134868, "g_traj_mean": 0.5885000824928284}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 264, 8045, 315, 2820, 7567, 11, 2670, 6646, 15957, 11, 4650, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 5888, 11, 323, 1824, 369, 40613, 2820, 13, 2379, 525, 1083, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 44763, 11, 75974, 391, 70870, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 13, 151645], "pred": "Jalapeno peppers offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, potential weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, and support for cardiovascular health. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Specifically, jalapenos may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4358679123769669, "g_worst_claim": 0.5390597752162388, "g_content": 1.9924807829015396, "g_traj_mean": 1.236616611480713}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [41, 278, 391, 11790, 57473, 614, 3807, 2820, 7567, 13, 2379, 6644, 1550, 5866, 315, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 374, 8480, 369, 862, 47251, 8628, 13, 43365, 61388, 258, 374, 3881, 369, 1181, 4650, 6239, 389, 40613, 2820, 11, 10004, 7567, 1075, 26160, 4746, 8776, 323, 52472, 13, 22406, 11, 807, 646, 1492, 448, 4680, 4709, 4152, 311, 862, 47251, 6993, 11, 892, 646, 5263, 37997, 13, 2379, 1083, 614, 6646, 12646, 9400, 5888, 11, 892, 646, 387, 5390, 13, 23405, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 525, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 11, 28720, 311, 8084, 2820, 323, 13581, 85287, 304, 4680, 4709, 13, 151645], "pred": "Jalapeno peppers have several health benefits. They contain high levels of capsaicin, which is responsible for their spicy heat. Capsaicin is known for its potential effects on cardiovascular health, offering benefits like preventing heart attacks and strokes. Additionally, they can help with weight loss due to their spicy nature, which can increase metabolism. They also have pain-killing properties, which can be useful. Furthermore, jalapeno peppers are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, contributing to overall health and potentially aiding in weight loss.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6128526552736179, "g_worst_claim": 0.06399639844894409, "g_content": 1.0471481011838328, "g_traj_mean": 0.6005075573921204}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 61.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "639", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños have various health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestion, prevention of heart disease and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they have cardiovascular health benefits.", "pred": "The health benefits of jalapeño peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and they are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The health benefits of jalapeño peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and they are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "cot": "[\"Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"The health benefits of jalapeño peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and they are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Based on the provided passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain Relief - Jalapeño peppers have pain-killing properties, which can help alleviate pain in various forms.\\n2. Weight Loss Alternative - They can serve as a spicy weight loss alternative, potentially aiding in fat burning and weight management.\\n3. Natural Nasal Decongestant - Jalapeños can provide relief from congestion by acting as a natural nasal decongestant.\\n4. Potential Prevention of Heart Disease and Cancer - They may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n5. Source of Vitamins, Minerals, and Antioxidants - Jalapeños are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, which contribute to overall health and well-being.\\n6. Cardiovascular Health - They provide cardiovascular health benefits, helping to defend against heart health issues such as heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.\\n\\nThese benefits are supported by the presence of capsaicin, the heat-producing compound found in jalapeños, which is responsible for many of these health effects.\", \"The health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease and cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Jalapenos also provide cardiovascular health benefits, which can help defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.\"]", "time_sec": 17.316, "generation_time_seconds": 16.836, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4754, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [14542, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6978913053633675, "g_worst_claim": 0.8455329736073812, "g_content": 2.3204078674316406, "g_traj_mean": 1.428969144821167}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 2820, 7567, 315, 75974, 2027, 14529, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 5888, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 9387, 11, 323, 807, 525, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "T