24448251724243}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 2820, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 15358, 438, 264, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 13581, 26160, 4746, 8457, 323, 9387, 11, 323, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 71895, 391, 70870, 1083, 3410, 40613, 2820, 7567, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 10505, 2348, 4746, 8776, 11, 52472, 11, 323, 1550, 6543, 7262, 13, 151645], "pred": "The health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease and cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Jalapenos also provide cardiovascular health benefits, which can help defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4110215546592833, "g_worst_claim": 0.38753695487976075, "g_content": 2.0078044346400667, "g_traj_mean": 1.3538377285003662}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "Jalapeños offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Jalapeños offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "cot": "[\"Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and being helpful for cardiovascular health.\", \"Jalapeños offer a variety of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease and cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"The health benefits of jalapeno peppers include:\\n\\n1. Pain relief properties\\n2. Spicy weight loss alternative\\n3. Natural nasal decongestant\\n4. Potential prevention of heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer\\n5. High vitamin, mineral, and antioxidant content\\n\\nJalapeno peppers also have cardiovascular health benefits, particularly in defending against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.\"]", "time_sec": 12.583, "generation_time_seconds": 12.1044, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4737, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [14542, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6754273093624032, "g_worst_claim": 0.7267866929372152, "g_content": 2.3102172215779624, "g_traj_mean": 1.4189972877502441}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [14542, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 2924, 6646, 15957, 11, 4680, 4709, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 11, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 11, 323, 1660, 10950, 369, 40613, 2820, 13, 151645], "pred": "Health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and being helpful for cardiovascular health.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7708289887739983, "g_worst_claim": 0.72678669293