{"id": "679", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "pred": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, and providing relief from abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It also stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Clove tea compresses can be used to relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries, and it can be applied to unbroken skin. If there is a lot of swelling noted with the injury, then ice-cold tea compresses should be used. Warm tea works better with arthritic pain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, and providing relief from abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It also stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Clove tea compresses can be used to relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries, and it can be applied to unbroken skin. If there is a lot of swelling noted with the injury, then ice-cold tea compresses should be used. Warm tea works better with arthritic pain.", "cot": "[\"Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, and providing relief from abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It also stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Clove tea compresses can be used to relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries, and it can be applied to unbroken skin. If there is a lot of swelling noted with the injury, then ice-cold tea compresses should be used. Warm tea works better with arthritic pain.\", \"Based on the provided passages, drinking clove tea has several benefits including:\\n\\n1. Soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body.\\n2. Providing relief from stress, as when combined with honey and herbal mixtures like basil, mint, and cardamom.\\n3. Improving digestion, aiding in the production of saliva, blood flow, and gastric secretions.\\n4. Relieving muscle, joint, and ligament pain due to its analgesic effects.\\n5. Reducing swelling associated with injuries, when applied as a compress to unbroken skin.\\n6. Alleviating gas pain and other stomach upsets.\\n7. Promoting blood flow and saliva production.\\n\\nThere is no specific information provided about side effects of drinking clove tea in the given passages.\", \"Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from muscle, joint, and ligament pain, and aiding in digestion. Clove tea can be mixed with other herbs like basil, mint, and cardamom, and honey can be added for additional benefits. \\n\\nSide effects of drinking clove tea are not explicitly mentioned in the provided passages.\", \"Benefits:\\n1. Relieves stress and soothes the senses.\\n2. Provides relief from stress when mixed with other herbs like basil, mint, and cardamom, and taken with honey.\\n3. Has skin benefits, particularly when consumed regularly.\\n4. Can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries due to its analgesic effects.\\n5. Useful for soothing abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets due to its analgesic qualities and stimulating effects on blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions.\\n\\nSide Effects:\\n1. The passage does not mention any specific side effects of drinking clove tea.\"]", "time_sec": 20.556, "generation_time_seconds": 19.7071, "selection_time_seconds": 0.845, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 64364, 279, 37107, 11, 58544, 4405, 8464, 11, 323, 8241, 15957, 504, 55956, 6646, 11, 6819, 6646, 11, 323, 1008, 22350, 705, 4917, 13, 1084, 1083, 94355, 6543, 6396, 11, 84557, 5670, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 311, 12296, 304, 73402, 13, 18679, 586, 15243, 24611, 288, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 47739, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 11, 323, 432, 646, 387, 9251, 311, 650, 48909, 6787, 13, 1416, 1052, 374, 264, 2696, 315, 54207, 10342, 448, 279, 10895, 11, 1221, 9853, 1786, 813, 15243, 24611, 288, 1265, 387, 1483, 13, 45763, 15243, 4278, 2664, 448, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 13, 151645], "pred": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, and providing relief from abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It also stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Clove tea compresses can be used to relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries, and it can be applied to unbroken skin. If there is a lot of swelling noted with the injury, then ice-cold tea compresses should be used. Warm tea works better with arthritic pain.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.169762703901073, "g_worst_claim": 1.0102741241455078, "g_content": 3.091347156871449, "g_traj_mean": 2.074058771133423}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 702, 3807, 7567, 2670, 1447, 16, 13, 2055, 78, 1596, 279, 37107, 323, 58544, 4405, 8464, 304, 279, 2487, 624, 17, 13, 80100, 15957, 504, 8464, 11, 438, 979, 10856, 448, 25744, 323, 50387, 6514, 18513, 1075, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 624, 18, 13, 21961, 4405, 73402, 11, 85287, 304, 279, 5670, 315, 84557, 11, 6543, 6396, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 624, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 323, 28313, 2838, 6646, 4152, 311, 1181, 3181, 4188, 292, 6239, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 54207, 5815, 448, 14970, 11, 979, 9251, 438, 264, 24611, 311, 650, 48909, 6787, 624, 21, 13, 1674, 3449, 22897, 6819, 6646, 323, 1008, 22350, 705, 4917, 624, 22, 13, 17582, 11519, 6543, 6396, 323, 84557, 5670, 382, 3862, 374, 902, 3151, 1995, 3897, 911, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "There is no specific information provided about side effects of drinking clove tea in the given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6380927574343591, "g_worst_claim": -0.10445636510848999, "g_content": 1.9890346272786459, "g_traj_mean": 1.2740323543548584}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 64364, 279, 37107, 11, 58544, 4405, 8464, 11, 8241, 15957, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 323, 28313, 2838, 6646, 11, 323, 85287, 304, 73402, 13, 18679, 586, 15243, 646, 387, 9519, 448, 1008, 41293, 1075, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 11, 323, 25744, 646, 387, 3694, 369, 5107, 7567, 13, 4710, 16384, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 525, 537, 20975, 9733, 304, 279, 3897, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from muscle, joint, and ligament pain, and aiding in digestion. Clove tea can be mixed with other herbs like basil, mint, and cardamom, and honey can be added for additional benefits. \n\nSide effects of drinking clove tea are not explicitly mentioned in the provided passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3292281226527811, "g_worst_claim": 0.5278137683868408, "g_content": 1.8406009674072266, "g_traj_mean": 1.233607292175293}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [84323, 510, 16, 13, 6512, 38135, 8464, 323, 43176, 6375, 279, 37107, 624, 17, 13, 36617, 15957, 504, 8464, 979, 9519, 448, 1008, 41293, 1075, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 11, 323, 4429, 448, 25744, 624, 18, 13, 11443, 6787, 7567, 11, 7945, 979, 25983, 15502, 624, 19, 13, 2980, 47739, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 4152, 311, 1181, 3181, 4188, 292, 6239, 624, 20, 13, 50512, 369, 64364, 55956, 6646, 11, 6819, 6646, 11, 323, 1008, 22350, 705, 4917, 4152, 311, 1181, 3181, 4188, 292, 28500, 323, 64692, 6239, 389, 6543, 6396, 11, 84557, 5670, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 382, 16384, 29146, 510, 16, 13, 576, 21085, 1558, 537, 6286, 894, 3151, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 13, 151645], "pred": "Side Effects:\n1. The passage does not mention any specific side effects of drinking clove tea.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9898748834228484, "g_worst_claim": -0.2085937261581421, "g_content": 2.6038808822631836, "g_traj_mean": 1.6520824432373047}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "By following these steps, you can get a free VoIP service and a phone number that allows you to make and receive calls from your PSTN or mobile phone.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "By following these steps, you can get a free VoIP service and a phone number that allows you to make and receive calls from your PSTN or mobile phone.", "cot": "[\"To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Identify a VoIP Service Provider**: Look for VoIP service providers that offer free or low-cost services. Some popular options include Google Voice, which provides a free virtual phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls.\\n\\n2. **Sign Up for the Service**: Visit the website of the VoIP service provider and sign up for an account. For example, you can visit Google's website to sign up for a free virtual phone number.\\n\\n3. **Claim Your Free Number**: After signing up, you will be provided with a free VoIP number. This number can be used to receive calls from PSTN or mobile phones.\\n\\n4. **Forward Calls to Your Device**: If you want to receive calls on your mobile phone, you can forward your VoIP number to your mobile number. This allows you to receive calls on your mobile device.\\n\\n5. **Use SIP Devices**: If you have a SIP device, you can use it to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account. This is particularly useful if you need to make calls to other countries.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can get a free VoIP service and phone number, allowing you to make and receive calls using the internet.\", \"To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n1. Visit a respected company, such as Google, to get your free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\\n2. Use a cloud VoIP service that offers toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number (like a cell phone) or used with a SIP device.\\n3. Use SIP devices to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account.\", \"To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit my YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. This video will show you how you can get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP). A VoIP number is a phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\", \"To get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Find a VoIP Service Provider**: Look for VoIP service providers that offer free services or have low-cost options. Some well-known providers include Google Voice, WhatsApp, and others.\\n\\n2. **Create an Account**: Sign up for an account with the chosen VoIP service provider. This typically involves providing some basic information such as your name, phone number, and email address.\\n\\n3. **Claim Your Free VoIP Number**: After creating an account, you will typically be assigned a free VoIP number. This number can be used to receive calls from both PSTN and mobile phones.\\n\\n4. **Optional: Use Additional Features**: Many VoIP services offer additional features like voicemail, call forwarding, and voicemail-to-email. You can explore these options to enhance your experience with the VoIP service.\\n\\n5. **Setup SIP Devices (Optional)**: If you want to make calls using a SIP device, you can do so by forwarding the VoIP number to your SIP device or using it directly within the VoIP service portal.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can get a free VoIP service and a phone number that allows you to make and receive calls from your PSTN or mobile phone.\"]", "time_sec": 27.972, "generation_time_seconds": 26.8571, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1059, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 633, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 28301, 1437, 264, 28079, 3298, 5362, 22916, 95518, 9192, 369, 28079, 3298, 2473, 12565, 429, 3010, 1910, 476, 3347, 40138, 3516, 13, 4329, 5411, 2606, 2924, 5085, 27930, 11, 892, 5707, 264, 1910, 4108, 4540, 1372, 429, 5711, 279, 7602, 311, 1992, 323, 5258, 6738, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 7264, 3138, 369, 279, 5362, 95518, 19008, 279, 3910, 315, 279, 28079, 3298, 2473, 9109, 323, 1841, 705, 369, 458, 2692, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 498, 646, 3947, 5085, 594, 3910, 311, 1841, 705, 369, 264, 1910, 4108, 4540, 1372, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 45544, 4615, 3574, 5624, 95518, 4636, 15971, 705, 11, 498, 686, 387, 3897, 448, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 1372, 13, 1096, 1372, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 5258, 6738, 504, 40984, 45, 476, 6371, 17619, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 25925, 40127, 311, 4615, 13903, 95518, 1416, 498, 1366, 311, 5258, 6738, 389, 697, 6371, 4540, 11, 498, 646, 4637, 697, 28079, 3298, 1372, 311, 697, 6371, 1372, 13, 1096, 6147, 498, 311, 5258, 6738, 389, 697, 6371, 3671, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 10253, 65441, 40377, 95518, 1416, 498, 614, 264, 65441, 3671, 11, 498, 646, 990, 432, 311, 1281, 36698, 6738, 311, 2274, 5109, 448, 697, 9437, 2692, 13, 1096, 374, 7945, 5390, 421, 498, 1184, 311, 1281, 6738, 311, 1008, 5837, 382, 1359, 2701, 1493, 7354, 11, 498, 646, 633, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 4540, 1372, 11, 10693, 498, 311, 1281, 323, 5258, 6738, 1667, 