{"id": "694", "question": "does watching snapchat stories increase score", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that watching Snapchat stories does not directly increase your Snapchat score. The passages mention that the score is increased by sending and receiving more snaps, and by interacting with friends on the platform. Watching stories is not mentioned as a factor that contributes to increasing one's score. Therefore, the answer to the question is: No, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your score.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 6.759, "generation_time_seconds": 6.1215, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6302, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_worst_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_content": -0.08748425245285034, "g_traj_mean": -0.05019519105553627}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_worst_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_content": -0.08748425245285034, "g_traj_mean": -0.05019519105553627}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_worst_claim": -0.0564110204577446, "g_content": -0.0