{"id": "709", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is the answer to the question:\n\nThe colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings:\n\n* White represents purity\n* Blue represents patriotism\n* Red represents the willingness to shed blood during warfare\n\nThe three white stars on the flag represent the three grand divisions of Tennessee: East, Middle, and West. The blue field with the white stars is meant to symbolize the three divisions bound together as one.", "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "cot": "[\"The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\", \"The colors of the Tennessee flag represent the national colors of the United States. White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passage, the colors of the Tennessee flag have significant meanings:\\n\\n1. **White**: Represents purity.\\n2. **Blue**: Stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee.\\n3. **Red**: Symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\", \"The colors of the Tennessee flag represent significant symbolism. White symbolizes purity, blue represents the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\"]", "time_sec": 11.696, "generation_time_seconds": 11.0172, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6724, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 614, 3151, 49700, 13, 5807, 10868, 52400, 11, 6303, 13352, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 7735, 4756, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7596460282802582, "g_worst_claim": 1.2576205253601074, "g_content": 2.3680341720581053, "g_traj_mean": 1.8340798616409302}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 4009, 279, 5313, 7987, 315, 279, 3639, 4180, 13, 5807, 7735, 4756, 52400, 11, 6303, 13352, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 10868, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag represent the national colors of the United States. White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7460081055050805, "g_worst_claim": 1.2043215433756511, "g_content": 2.368216307266899, "g_traj_mean": 1.7662101984024048}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 21085, 11, 279, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 614, 5089, 49700, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 14075, 95518, 38893, 52400, 624, 17, 13, 3070, 10331, 95518, 794, 2844, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 624, 18, 13, 3070, 6033, 95518, 19612, 4756, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the information provided in the passage, the colors of the Tennessee flag have significant meanings:\n\n1. **White**: Represents purity.\n2. **Blue**: Stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee.\n3. **Red**: Symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2878494120051718, "g_worst_claim": 0.8269190788269043, "g_content": 1.9799888045699507, "g_traj_mean": 1.309340476989746}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 4009, 5089, 82376, 13, 5807, 7735, 4756, 52400, 11, 6303, 10868, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 13352, 369, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag represent significant symbolism. White symbolizes purity, blue represents the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.898680321375529, "g_worst_claim": 1.35528621673584, "g_content": 2.703814370291574, "g_traj_mean": 2.0088741779327393}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "710", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag are said to have the following meanings:\n\n* White: Purity\n* Red: Readiness to shed blood during warfare\n* Blue: Patriotism of the people of Tennessee\n\nTherefore, the colors of the Tennessee flag are meant to symbolize the state's patriotism, willingness to defend itself, and purity.", "pred": "White stands for purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "White stands for purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "cot": "[\"The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\", \"The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings:\\n- White: Symbolizes purity.\\n- Red: Represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\\n- Blue: Stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee.\", \"White stands for purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\", \"The colors of the Tennessee flag have deep significance. White, red, and blue are the national colors of the United States, each symbolizing different values. White stands for purity, blue represents the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\"]", "time_sec": 11.423, "generation_time_seconds": 10.4346, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9827, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 614, 3151, 49700, 13, 5807, 10868, 52400, 11, 6303, 13352, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 7735, 4756, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings. White represents purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8029867154179198, "g_worst_claim": 1.3084015846252441, "g_content": 2.446150207519531, "g_traj_mean": 1.85990571975708}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 614, 3151, 49700, 510, 12, 5807, 25, 19612, 4756, 52400, 624, 12, 3731, 25, 38893, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 624, 12, 8697, 25, 794, 2844, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have specific meanings:\n- White: Symbolizes purity.\n- Red: Represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.\n- Blue: Stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5365939017326113, "g_worst_claim": 0.86585799853007, "g_content": 2.248448371887207, "g_traj_mean": 1.5806537866592407}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [14075, 13352, 369, 52400, 11, 6303, 13352, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 13352, 369, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "White stands for purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.6650243778421423, "g_worst_claim": 1.7208912589333274, "g_content": 3.6459889729817707, "g_traj_mean": 2.3118724822998047}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 614, 5538, 25361, 13, 5807, 11, 2518, 11, 323, 6303, 525, 279, 5313, 7987, 315, 279, 3639, 4180, 11, 1817, 7735, 4849, 2155, 2750, 13, 5807, 13352, 369, 52400, 11, 6303, 10868, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 11, 323, 2518, 7735, 4756, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13, 151645], "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag have deep significance. White, red, and blue are the national colors of the United States, each symbolizing different values. White stands for purity, blue represents the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red symbolizes the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.385985171433651, "g_worst_claim": 0.4885781028053977, "g_content": 2.105971654256185, "g_traj_mean": 1.5686815977096558}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 45.83, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "712", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Passage 2: The exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passage, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. These exercises are part of The Anarchy Workout, a 6-week high-intensity interval training program designed to transform the body.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passage, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. These exercises are part of The Anarchy Workout, a 6-week high-intensity interval training program designed to transform the body.", "cot": "[\"The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest, which involves pumping the pecs and stretching the connective tissue surrounding them to allow more room for muscle growth.\\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passage, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. These exercises are part of The Anarchy Workout, a 6-week high-intensity interval training program designed to transform the body.\", \"The exercises in The Anarchy Workout that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\"]", "time_sec": 11.819, "generation_time_seconds": 11.0562, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7594, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0017097918330164, "g_worst_claim": 0.7060307661692301, "g_content": 4.094008053050322, "g_traj_mean": 2.5529654026031494}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 29053, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 11, 892, 17601, 52126, 279, 30000, 82, 323, 41849, 279, 4564, 533, 19847, 14590, 1105, 311, 2138, 803, 3054, 369, 15747, 6513, 624, 17, 13, 25995, 287, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest, which involves pumping the pecs and stretching the connective tissue surrounding them to allow more room for muscle growth.\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.5533170484361194, "g_worst_claim": 0.5975845257441202, "g_content": 3.7992940102854083, "g_traj_mean": 2.382937431335449}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 21085, 11, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 4220, 22932, 525, 949, 315, 576, 1527, 15272, 69142, 11, 264, 220, 21, 29509, 1550, 20052, 7968, 9873, 4862, 2025, 6188, 311, 5165, 279, 2487, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passage, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. These exercises are part of The Anarchy Workout, a 6-week high-intensity interval training program designed to transform the body.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8169084116081138, "g_worst_claim": 0.3399308919906616, "g_content": 3.1488546643938338, "g_traj_mean": 2.1204628944396973}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 304, 576, 1527, 15272, 69142, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises in The Anarchy Workout that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 3.417817549272017, "g_worst_claim": 3.417817549272017, "g_content": 4.312108039855957, "g_traj_mean": 3.326876163482666}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 57.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.3, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "cot": "[\"The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"The exercises mentioned in the passages that tone the chest are:\\n\\n1. Dumbbell Cross-Over: This exercise involves lying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to your sides, and then slowly curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. This movement helps to tone the chest and surrounding connective tissue.\\n\\n2. Pushups: The first workout starts with a modified tri-set for the chest, which includes pushups. Pushups are a classic chest exercise that target the pectoral muscles and improve overall chest strength.\\n\\n3. Dumbbell Bench Press: The second chest blast is done by pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The bench press is a compound exercise that works the chest muscles directly, as well as the triceps and shoulders, helping to tone and build the chest muscles.\\n\\nThese exercises are specifically designed to target the chest muscles and are part of a high-intensity interval training program that aims to transform the body and build lean muscle all over.\", \"The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"The exercises that tone the chest according to the passages are modified tri-sets for the chest and dumbbell bench presses paired with pushups.\"]", "time_sec": 15.109, "generation_time_seconds": 14.2791, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8239, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9795354415499975, "g_worst_claim": 0.5273210604985555, "g_content": 4.123720954446232, "g_traj_mean": 2.571744441986084}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 525, 1447, 16, 13, 422, 3551, 17250, 11261, 12, 1918, 25, 1096, 10158, 17601, 20446, 389, 697, 1182, 448, 264, 29255, 17250, 304, 1817, 1424, 11, 32359, 697, 11715, 700, 311, 697, 11067, 11, 323, 1221, 13970, 13957, 287, 697, 6078, 3786, 3080, 279, 29255, 65, 6436, 3367, 3403, 279, 4126, 315, 697, 15138, 13, 1096, 7203, 8609, 311, 16232, 279, 15138, 323, 14590, 4564, 533, 19847, 382, 17, 13, 22950, 8602, 25, 576, 1156, 25242, 8471, 448, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 11, 892, 5646, 4484, 8602, 13, 22950, 8602, 525, 264, 11416, 15138, 10158, 429, 2169, 279, 281, 1256, 278, 23648, 323, 7269, 8084, 15138, 8170, 382, 18, 13, 422, 3551, 17250, 35258, 8445, 25, 576, 2086, 15138, 20671, 374, 2814, 553, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 576, 13425, 3493, 374, 264, 23628, 10158, 429, 4278, 279, 15138, 23648, 5961, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 489, 74569, 323, 26906, 11, 10476, 311, 16232, 323, 1936, 279, 15138, 23648, 382, 9485, 22932, 525, 11689, 6188, 311, 2169, 279, 15138, 23648, 323, 525, 949, 315, 264, 1550, 20052, 7968, 9873, 4862, 2025, 429, 21538, 311, 5165, 279, 2487, 323, 1936, 15651, 15747, 678, 916, 13, 151645], "pred": "These exercises are specifically designed to target the chest muscles and are part of a high-intensity interval training program that aims to transform the body and build lean muscle all over.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0616054797757595, "g_worst_claim": 0.10605841875076294, "g_content": 1.939358489681976, "g_traj_mean": 1.199468731880188}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9795354415499975, "g_worst_claim": 0.5273210604985555, "g_content": 4.123720954446232, "g_traj_mean": 2.571744441986084}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 4092, 311, 279, 46769, 525, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 34426, 448, 4484, 8602, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest according to the passages are modified tri-sets for the chest and dumbbell bench presses paired with pushups.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.435115541730608, "g_worst_claim": 2.435115541730608, "g_content": 3.8568690163748607, "g_traj_mean": 2.3562233448028564}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 49.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "716", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "cot": "[\"The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest, designed to pump your pecs and stretch the connective tissue that surrounds them, thereby allowing more room under your skin for the muscles to grow.\\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nSpecific examples from the passages include:\\n- The first workout starts with a modified tri-set for the chest.\\n- The second chest blast is done by pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n- The instructions for the modified tri-set include:\\n  - Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand.\\n  - Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross.\\n  - Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest.\\n  - Slowly return your arms back to your sides.\\n\\nThese exercises are part of a high-intensity interval training program that aims to transform the body and build lean muscle all over, including the chest and surrounding connective tissue.\", \"The passage mentions that The Anarchy Workout DVDs include chest workouts. Specifically, it describes two chest workouts:\\n\\n1. The first workout involves a modified tri-set for the chest, which is designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them. This exercise allows more room under the skin for the muscles to grow.\\n\\n2. The second chest workout is done by pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nThese workouts are part of a 6-week program designed to not only target the chest but also build lean muscle all over the body.\", \"Based on the provided passage and general knowledge, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest, pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses, and using dumbbells to curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest.\"]", "time_sec": 19.481, "generation_time_seconds": 18.5918, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8844, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [785, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0142849079974288, "g_worst_claim": 0.685905933380127, "g_content": 4.09660743264591, "g_traj_mean": 2.556046485900879}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 29053, 2406,