76, 2086, 15138, 25242, 374, 2814, 553, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 382, 9485, 45844, 525, 949, 315, 264, 220, 21, 29509, 2025, 6188, 311, 537, 1172, 2169, 279, 15138, 714, 1083, 1936, 15651, 15747, 678, 916, 279, 2487, 13, 151645], "pred": "These workouts are part of a 6-week program designed to not only target the chest but also build lean muscle all over the body.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.1944310794338113, "g_worst_claim": 0.9680756462944878, "g_content": 2.5844552176339284, "g_traj_mean": 1.969283103942871}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 21085, 323, 4586, 6540, 11, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 11, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 11, 323, 1667, 29255, 65, 6436, 311, 13957, 697, 6078, 3786, 3080, 279, 29255, 65, 6436, 3367, 3403, 279, 4126, 315, 697, 15138, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the provided passage and general knowledge, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest, pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses, and using dumbbells to curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.93718546816591, "g_worst_claim": 0.4155697292751736, "g_content": 3.0831698099772136, "g_traj_mean": 2.005629539489746}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 43.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "717", "question": "how to poach an egg using a poachpod", "gt": "To poach an egg using a PoachPod, first, bring a large pot of water to a boil. Lightly oil the silicone PoachPod, then crack an egg and gently slide it into the PoachPod, taking care not to break the yolk. Float the PoachPod in the boiling water, ensuring it remains upright and no water gets inside. Cover the pot with a lid and let the egg cook for about six minutes. After cooking, use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the PoachPod out of the hot water. Finally, flip the PoachPod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate. The PoachPod can be cleaned in a dishwasher.", "pred": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact, resulting in a perfectly domed-shaped egg.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact, resulting in a perfectly domed-shaped egg.", "cot": "[\"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Prepare the Pod**: Lightly oil the PoachPod before use. This helps prevent the egg from sticking to the pod.\\n\\n2. **Crack the Egg**: Crack an egg into the oiled PoachPod, being careful not to break the yolk.\\n\\n3. **Float the Pod**: Carefully float the PoachPod in a pot of boiling water. Ensure the pod stays upright and no water gets into the pod.\\n\\n4. **Cook the Egg**: Cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid and let the egg cook for about 4-6 minutes.\\n\\n5. **Remove the Pod**: After the egg is cooked, remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the PoachPod out of the hot water.\\n\\n6. **Release the Egg**: Flip the PoachPod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.\", \"To poach an egg using a poachpod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Bring a large pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Crack an egg and gently slide the egg into the silicone poaching pod, being careful not to break the egg's yolk.\\n3. Carefully float the poaching pod in the boiling water, making sure the pod stays upright and no water gets into the pod.\\n4. Cover the pot with the lid and let the egg cook for six minutes.\\n5. Remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the poaching pod out of the hot water.\\n6. Flip the poaching pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release your poached egg onto the plate.\\n\\nThese steps ensure that the egg poaches perfectly without breaking, and the poachpod is easily cleaned afterward.\", \"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Bring a large pot of water to a boil.** Ensure the water is hot enough to maintain a simmer throughout the poaching process.\\n\\n2. **Crack an egg and gently slide it into your silicone poaching pod.** Be careful not to break the yolk. \\n\\n3. **Float the poaching pod in the boiling water.** Make sure the pod stays upright and that no water gets into the pod. This helps keep the egg intact and prevents breaking the yolk.\\n\\n4. **Cover the pot with a lid.** This helps retain heat and ensures the egg cooks evenly.\\n\\n5. **Let the egg cook.** The cooking time is recommended as 6 minutes. However, depending on the desired doneness, you can adjust the time to 4-6 minutes.\\n\\n6. **Remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the poaching pod out of the hot water.** \\n\\n7. **Flip the poaching pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release your poached egg onto the plate.**\\n\\nThis process ensures a perfectly poached egg, with the yolk intact and the whites cooked to the desired texture.\", \"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Prepare the Pod:** Lightly oil the silicone poaching pod before use. This step helps prevent the egg from sticking to the pod during cooking.\\n\\n2. **Crack the Egg:** Gently crack an egg into the oiled PoachPod, being careful not to break the yolk. The PoachPod allows you to float and poach the egg in boiling water, similar to how a lily pad floats on a pond.\\n\\n3. **Float the Pod in Boiling Water:** Carefully place the PoachPod into a large pot of boiling water. Ensure that the pod stays upright and does not let any water into it. The water should be at a rolling boil, not simmering.\\n\\n4. **Cook the Egg:** Cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid to trap the heat and steam inside. Let the egg cook for 4 to 6 minutes. The exact cooking time may vary slightly depending on the egg's freshness and the water's temperature.\\n\\n5. **Remove the Pod:** Once the egg is fully cooked, remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the PoachPod out of the hot water.\\n\\n6. **Release the Egg:** Flip the PoachPod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom of the pod to release the poached egg onto the plate.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact, resulting in a perfectly domed-shaped egg.\"]", "time_sec": 36.084, "generation_time_seconds": 34.8575, "selection_time_seconds": 1.218, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3193, 610, 458, 18636, 1667, 264, 13808, 610, 23527, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 50590, 279, 16821, 95518, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 1573, 990, 13, 1096, 8609, 5358, 279, 18636, 504, 36972, 311, 279, 7509, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 16001, 473, 279, 41213, 95518, 54945, 458, 18636, 1119, 279, 297, 2181, 13808, 610, 23527, 11, 1660, 16585, 537, 311, 1438, 279, 379, 22604, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 5442, 279, 16821, 95518, 10627, 3641, 2224, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 304, 264, 3338, 315, 49837, 3015, 13, 29279, 279, 7509, 26558, 48585, 323, 902, 3015, 5221, 1119, 279, 7509, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 58382, 279, 41213, 95518, 17757, 279, 3338, 448, 264, 10296, 2220, 14810, 26334, 323, 1077, 279, 18636, 4296, 369, 911, 220, 19, 12, 21, 4420, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 13021, 279, 16821, 95518, 4636, 279, 18636, 374, 29105, 11, 4057, 279, 26334, 323, 990, 264, 3460, 1739, 15521, 45505, 476, 259, 13181, 311, 11893, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 700, 315, 279, 4017, 3015, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 16077, 279, 41213, 95518, 40284, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 35841, 1495, 916, 264, 11968, 323, 29273, 3493, 389, 279, 5622, 311, 4879, 279, 3193, 3854, 18636, 8630, 279, 11968, 382, 1986, 1714, 25351, 429, 279, 18636, 374, 3193, 3854, 41047, 323, 279, 379, 22604, 8458, 34439, 13, 151645], "pred": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7981899744479463, "g_worst_claim": 0.2032092332839966, "g_content": 1.2868692149286685, "g_traj_mean": 0.8240888714790344}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 3193, 610, 458, 18636, 1667, 264, 3193, 610, 39073, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3460, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 17, 13, 54945, 458, 18636, 323, 29273, 14983, 279, 18636, 1119, 279, 52925, 3193, 11829, 7509, 11, 1660, 16585, 537, 311, 1438, 279, 18636, 594, 379, 22604, 624, 18, 13, 10627, 3641, 2224, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 304, 279, 49837, 3015, 11, 3259, 2704, 279, 7509, 26558, 48585, 323, 902, 3015, 5221, 1119, 279, 7509, 624, 19, 13, 17757, 279, 3338, 448, 279, 26334, 323, 1077, 279, 18636, 4296, 369, 4743, 4420, 624, 20, 13, 10783, 279, 26334, 323, 990, 264, 3460, 1739, 15521, 45505, 476, 259, 13181, 311, 11893, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 700, 315, 279, 4017, 3015, 624, 21, 13, 40284, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 35841, 1495, 916, 264, 11968, 323, 29273, 3493, 389, 279, 5622, 311, 4879, 697, 3193, 3854, 18636, 8630, 279, 11968, 382, 9485, 7354, 5978, 429, 279, 18636, 3193, 14242, 13942, 2041, 14719, 11, 323, 279, 3193, 610, 39073, 374, 6707, 27722, 47943, 13, 151645], "pred": "These steps ensure that the egg poaches perfectly without breaking, and the poachpod is easily cleaned afterward.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2760704379601402, "g_worst_claim": 0.24581170082092285, "g_content": 1.584290807387408, "g_traj_mean": 1.25238037109375}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 3193, 610, 458, 18636, 1667, 264, 13808, 610, 23527, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 64527, 264, 3460, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 13, 334, 29279, 279, 3015, 374, 4017, 3322, 311, 10306, 264, 61815, 6814, 279, 3193, 11829, 1882, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 16001, 473, 458, 18636, 323, 29273, 14983, 432, 1119, 697, 52925, 3193, 11829, 7509, 13, 334, 2823, 16585, 537, 311, 1438, 279, 379, 22604, 13, 4710, 18, 13, 3070, 5442, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 304, 279, 49837, 3015, 13, 334, 7405, 2704, 279, 7509, 26558, 48585, 323, 429, 902, 3015, 5221, 1119, 279, 7509, 13, 1096, 8609, 2506, 279, 18636, 34439, 323, 27934, 14719, 279, 379, 22604, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 30896, 279, 3338, 448, 264, 26334, 13, 334, 1096, 8609, 14060, 8628, 323, 25351, 279, 18636, 72427, 41047, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 10061, 279, 18636, 4296, 13, 334, 576, 17233, 882, 374, 11102, 438, 220, 21, 4420, 13, 4354, 11, 11649, 389, 279, 12685, 1513, 23709, 11, 498, 646, 7500, 279, 882, 311, 220, 19, 12, 21, 4420, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 13021, 279, 26334, 323, 990, 264, 3460, 1739, 15521, 45505, 476, 259, 13181, 311, 11893, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 700, 315, 279, 4017, 3015, 13, 334, 4710, 22, 13, 3070, 46808, 279, 3193, 11829, 7509, 35841, 1495, 916, 264, 11968, 323, 29273, 3493, 389, 279, 5622, 311, 4879, 697, 3193, 3854, 18636, 8630, 279, 11968, 13, 56177, 1986, 1882, 25351, 264, 13942, 3193, 3854, 18636, 11, 448, 279, 379, 22604, 34439, 323, 279, 21874, 29105, 311, 279, 12685, 10434, 13, 151645], "pred": "This process ensures a perfectly poached egg, with the yolk intact and the whites cooked to the desired texture.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mea