279, 18636, 1119, 432, 311, 5358, 36972, 13, 151645], "pred": "Note: The instructions provided in Passage 2 do not specify whether the pod needs to be lightly oiled before use, which is a common step in poaching eggs. It is advisable to lightly oil the pod before cracking the egg into it to prevent sticking.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1293578039233334, "g_worst_claim": 0.038613390922546384, "g_content": 1.6851381000719572, "g_traj_mean": 1.1281285285949707}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.21, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "720", "question": "how to poach an egg using a poachpod", "gt": "Sure! Here's how to poach an egg using a PoachPod® based on the provided passages:\n\n1. Bring a large pot of water to a boil. (Passage 1)\n2. Carefully crack an egg into the PoachPod®, being careful not to break the yolk. (Passage 2)\n3. Gently slide the PoachPod® into the boiling water, making sure it floats upright and no water enters the pod. (Passage 2)\n4. Cover the pot with a lid and cook for 6 minutes. (Passage 2)\n5. Use a large slotted spoon or tongs to carefully remove the PoachPod® from the water and flip it upside down over a plate. (Passage 2)\n6. Press gently on the bottom of the PoachPod® to release the poached egg onto the plate. (Passage 2)\n\nThat's it! According to the passages, the PoachPod® makes it easy to poach eggs by allowing you to float them in boiling water without breaking the yolk. Just make sure to lightly oil the pod before adding the egg to prevent sticking.", "pred": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.", "cot": "[\"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Prepare the Pod**: Lightly oil the PoachPod before use. This helps prevent the egg from sticking to the pod.\\n\\n2. **Crack the Egg**: Crack an egg into the oiled PoachPod, being careful not to break the yolk.\\n\\n3. **Float the Pod**: Carefully float the PoachPod in a pot of boiling water. Ensure the pod stays upright and no water gets into the pod.\\n\\n4. **Cook the Egg**: Cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid and let the egg cook for about 4-6 minutes.\\n\\n5. **Remove the Pod**: After the egg is cooked, remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the PoachPod out of the hot water.\\n\\n6. **Release the Egg**: Flip the PoachPod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.\", \"1. Begin by bringing a large pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Crack an egg and gently slide it into your silicone poaching pod, ensuring not to break the yolk.\\n3. Float the poaching pod in the boiling water, making sure it stays upright and no water gets into the pod.\\n4. Cover the pot with a lid and let the egg cook for six minutes.\\n5. Remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the poaching pod out of the hot water.\\n6. Flip the poaching pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release your poached egg onto the plate.\", \"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Bring a large pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Crack the egg into the PoachPod, making sure not to break the yolk.\\n3. Float the PoachPod in the boiling water, ensuring the pod stays upright and no water gets into the pod.\\n4. Cover the pot with a lid and let the egg cook for six minutes.\\n5. Remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the PoachPod out of the hot water.\\n6. Flip the PoachPod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate.\", \"To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Prepare the Pod**: Fill the flexible silicone pod with water and place it in a large pot of boiling water.\\n\\n2. **Crack the Egg**: Crack an egg and gently slide it into the silicone pod, ensuring the yolk remains intact and the pod stays upright.\\n\\n3. **Float the Pod**: Let the pod float in the boiling water. Make sure it does not touch the bottom or the sides of the pot to avoid any mishaps.\\n\\n4. **Cook the Egg**: Cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid and let the egg cook for approximately 4-6 minutes.\\n\\n5. **Remove the Pod**: After the egg is fully cooked, use a large slotted spoon or tongs to carefully lift the pod out of the hot water.\\n\\n6. **Release the Egg**: Flip the pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact, providing a delicate texture and rich flavor.\"]", "time_sec": 29.434, "generation_time_seconds": 28.647, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7811, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1249, 3193, 610, 458, 18636, 1667, 264, 13808, 610, 23527, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 50590, 279, 16821, 95518, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 1573, 990, 13, 1096, 8609, 5358, 279, 18636, 504, 36972, 311, 279, 7509, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 16001, 473, 279, 41213, 95518, 54945, 458, 18636, 1119, 279, 297, 2181, 13808, 610, 23527, 11, 1660, 16585, 537, 311, 1438, 279, 379, 22604, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 5442, 279, 16821, 95518, 10627, 3641, 2224, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 304, 264, 3338, 315, 49837, 3015, 13, 29279, 279, 7509, 26558, 48585, 323, 902, 3015, 5221, 1119, 279, 7509, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 58382, 279, 41213, 95518, 17757, 279, 3338, 448, 264, 10296, 2220, 14810, 26334, 323, 1077, 279, 18636, 4296, 369, 911, 220, 19, 12, 21, 4420, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 13021, 279, 16821, 95518, 4636, 279, 18636, 374, 29105, 11, 4057, 279, 26334, 323, 990, 264, 3460, 1739, 15521, 45505, 476, 259, 13181, 311, 11893, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 700, 315, 279, 4017, 3015, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 16077, 279, 41213, 95518, 40284, 279, 13808, 610, 23527, 35841, 1495, 916, 264, 11968, 323, 29273, 3493, 389, 279, 5622, 311, 4879, 279, 3193, 3854, 18636, 8630, 279, 11968, 382, 1986, 1714, 25351, 429, 279, 18636, 374, 3193, 3854, 41047, 323, 279, 379, 22604, 8458, 34439, 13, 151645], "pred": "This method ensures that the egg is poached evenly and the yolk remains intact.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8041779962372636, "g_worst_claim": 0.