nk_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "737", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "Based on the given passages, SMS stands for Short Message Service and allows you to send a message of up to 160 characters to another device. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send a message including pictures, videos, sounds, text, or any combination of the four. The content of an MMS message has a maximum size of 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, GIF, etc.", "pred": "SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.", "cot": "[\"SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.\", \"SMS (Short Message Service) allows you to send text messages, while MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send messages that include pictures, audio, video, or any combination of these types of content. MMS is an evolution of SMS, meaning it has more features than SMS.\", \"SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, while MMS allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of the four.\", \"SMS only allows you to send text, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.\"]", "time_sec": 10.287, "generation_time_seconds": 9.4385, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8441, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [65565, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 1172, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 151645], "pred": "SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7702915403578015, "g_worst_claim": 0.3757769266764323, "g_content": 3.0904153188069663, "g_traj_mean": 1.6582717895507812}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [65565, 320, 12472, 4856, 5362, 8, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 6605, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 320, 40404, 26936, 73170, 5362, 8, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 6605, 429, 2924, 9185, 11, 7699, 11, 2766, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 1493, 4494, 315, 2213, 13, 386, 4826, 374, 458, 15379, 315, 29909, 11, 7290, 432, 702, 803, 4419, 1091, 29909, 13, 151645], "pred": "SMS (Short Message Service) allows you to send text messages, while MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send messages that include pictures, audio, video, or any combination of these types of content. MMS is an evolution of SMS, meaning it has more features than SMS.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8327203353755495, "g_worst_claim": 0.2261035442352295, "g_content": 1.4196803753192608, "g_traj_mean": 0.7328013777732849}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [65565, 374, 21739, 311, 11628, 1467, 15382, 6605, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 11628, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 151645], "pred": "SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, while MMS allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of the four.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9637256728278267, "g_worst_claim": 0.7526320729936872, "g_content": 3.4019088745117188, "g_traj_mean": 1.8586186170578003}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [65565, 1172, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 151645], "pred": "SMS only allows you to send text, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7089162150388042, "g_worst_claim": 0.35255641407436794, "g_content": 2.638183275858561, "g_traj_mean": 1.630406141281128}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "739", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "Sure! Here's my answer based on the given passages:\n\nThe main difference between SMS (Short Message Service) and MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) is that SMS is limited to sending text-only messages, while MMS allows for sending multimedia content such as images, videos, and audio files, in addition to text.\n\nAccording to passage 1, SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and can be split into multiple parts if they are longer. MMS messages, on the other hand, can carry a larger size of content, including pictures, videos, and audio files, with a maximum size of 300KB.\n\nPassage 2 explains that SMS is a premium service offered by mobile companies, while passage 3 highlights the differences between SMS and MMS, stating that SMS only allows for text, while MMS allows for multimedia content.\n\nTherefore, the key differences between SMS and MMS are:\n\n* SMS is limited to text-only messages, while MMS allows for multimedia content.\n* SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and can be split into multiple parts, while MMS messages can carry a larger size of content.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "The main difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages, whereas MMS allows you to send messages that include pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of these.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The main difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages, whereas MMS allows you to send messages that include pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of these.", "cot": "[\"SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.\", \"SMS stands for Short Message Service and is commonly referred to as a text message. With a SMS, you can send a message of up to 160 characters to another device. Longer messages will automatically be split up into several parts. Most cell phones support this type of text messaging.\\n\\nMMS stands for Multimedia Messaging Service and is an evolution of SMS. With MMS, you can send a message including pictures, video, or audio content to another device. It is most commonly used to send a photo taken with a camera phone to another phone.\\n\\nThe main differences are that SMS can only send text, while MMS can send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.\", \"SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, while MMS allows for the sending of pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of these.\", \"The main difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages, whereas MMS allows you to send messages that include pictures, sounds, videos, or any combination of these.\"]", "time_sec": 13.926, "generation_time_seconds": 13.0555, "selection_time_seconds": 0.866, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [65565, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 1172, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 151645], "pred": "SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6561441585500403, "g_worst_claim": 0.35829610294765896, "g_content": 2.808013916015625, "g_traj_mean": 1.5801901817321777}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [65565, 13352, 369, 10698, 4856, 5362, 323, 374, 16626, 13862, 311, 438, 264, 1467, 1943, 13, 3085, 264, 29909, 11, 498, 646, 3624, 264, 1943, 315, 705, 311, 220, 16, 21, 15, 5766, 311, 2441, 3671, 13, 93326, 6605, 686, 9463, 387, 6718, 705, 1119, 3807, 5479, 13, 7496, 2779, 17619, 1824, 419, 943, 315, 1467, 29522, 382, 44, 4826, 13352, 369,